<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1DS</para>
  <para style="mt1">Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛ Mɔungi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔɔzeizu mɔunpa, Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi ma Mɔungi ta Felesiɛi ti ɓɔni su, ti ɠɛ ga sɛʋɛ ɠila kpe nɔ. Sɛpetante zɛʋɛi zu ɠa gaaɠwɛɛni su ná mɔunpa. Sɛpetante zɛʋɛi naa ɠa é ga Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai, nii tatigai Gɛlɛke wooi zu. Daaseigi é ba Eɓulu wooi zu, naa ɠa ga «folo ɠilagilagi zu vaiti ti leʋesu». Faaɠwɛ nu mɔinmɔin ka kaazu ga Ɛsedalase ɠa é Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛ felegɔiti sɛʋɛai, naa ʋɛɛ Ɛsedalase Ná-Sɛʋɛi ʋa ta Neɠemi nɔnɔi. Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui wɛlɛʋɛ sɛʋɛ mɔinmɔin su, nii a kɛ é nɔnɔ ma zɛʋɛiti kɛ, ma un ge daa ma ga Samiyɛle Ná-Sɛʋɛ felegɔiti ta Masagiti Ta-Zɛʋɛ felegɔiti. Faaɠwɛ nu wolai ma mɔinmɔin daaʋɛ da ga sɛʋɛi niiti kɛɛʋɛ kona unnaanigɔ zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta unnaani puulɔɔlugɔi (400-450), aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ, naa zoloogɛ nɔ kpein Ɛsedalase ná-eteai ma ziɛgi ma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi ma Mɔungi ta Felesiɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ɠa nu wɔlɔzaɠagiti daaseigiti dɔlɔsu, é zo Adama ma, é zeeli Abalaame ma, ta Izilayɛle ɠɛɛ vai ga ɓɔɠɔ you naa lɔɔzeizuʋɛ, eyɛsu é zeeli Izilayɛle nuiti gaaɠalema ziɛgi ma, ti ɠula duɔlai zu Ɓaɓilɔne. É zo niina naama ziɛgi ma, Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛiti ta Izilayɛle ná-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai zuɠulazu, é zo Sayile ná-masadai ma ziɛgi ma, é zeeli Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠolo siɛgi ma. Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛiti su, sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui wola ɠaazulogɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ná-fai ʋa Zeluzalɛme. Davide kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ mɔinmɔin kɛɛni pɛlɛi lo fai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 28:1-29:30">1DS 28:1—29:30</ref></char>), naa ʋoluma ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ɠa é pɛlɛi loni niina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 2:1-7:22">2DS 2:1—7:22</ref></char>). Sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛ nui ɓɔɛʋɛ ɓalaa é lo GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠolo pelei ʋa ta ʋelei bu zɔɔlaiti seɠeai la, ti li ga tiye (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 36:15-21">2DS 36:15-21</ref></char>). Gaaɓelagi ɠa ga Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi Velesiɛi puuzu ɠaaɓelagi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 36:23">2DS 36:23</ref></char>) ɠa kulazu kɛlɛma ʋelei GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ʋaazu losu da ʋolu ga niina.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Nu wɔlɔzaɠagiti daaseigi ta zɛʋɛʋɛ, é zo Adama ma, é zeeli Izilayɛle nuiti gaaɠalema ziɛgi ma, ti ɠula duɔlai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 1:1-9:44">1:1—9:44</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Davide ná-eteai ta ná-masa fai Izilayɛle unda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CH 10:1-29:30">10:1—29:30</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1"/>
  <para style="s">É zo Adama ma, é ʋa Sɛme ʋɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1"/>Adama ɠɛni ga Sɛte kɛɛɠɛ, Sɛte ɠɛ ga Enɔse kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2"/>Enɔse ɠɛ ga Kenan kɛɛɠɛ, Kenan ɠɛ ga Maɠalaleyɛle kɛɛɠɛ, Maɠalaleyɛle ɠɛ ga Yelɛde kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3"/>Yelɛde ɠɛ ga Enɔke kɛɛɠɛ, Enɔke ɠɛ ga Matuzalɛme kɛɛɠɛ, Matuzalɛme ɠɛ ga Lemɛke kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4"/>Lemɛke ɠɛ ga Nowe kɛɛɠɛ, Nowe ɠɛ ga Sɛme, Same ta Zafɛte ti-ɠɛɛ.<verse eid="1CH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5"/>Zafɛte mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Gomɛɛl, Magɔge, Madayi, Yavan, Tuɓale, Mesɛke ta Tilase. <verse eid="1CH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6"/>Gomɛɛl mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Asakenaze, Difate, ta Togaalema. <verse eid="1CH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7"/>Yavan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Elisa, Taalasise, Kitime, ta Lodanime.<verse eid="1CH 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8"/>Same mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Kuse, Miselayime, Pute, ta Kanaan. <verse eid="1CH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9"/>Kuse mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Seɓa, Ɠavila, Saɓata, Layema, ta Saɓeteka. Layema mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Saɓa ta Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10"/>Kuse Nimelɔde zɔlɔɔni, naa ɠa é ɠɛɛni ga zɛbɛsu nu wola mɔungi zooi ɠa.<verse eid="1CH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11"/>Miselayime mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Lude nuiti, Aname nuiti, Leɠaɓe nuiti, Nafatu nuiti, <verse eid="1CH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12"/>Patɔlɔse nuiti, Kasulu nuiti, ta Kafatɔɔl nuiti. (Kasulu nui naati ka Filisiti nuiti kulaai ti zu.)<verse eid="1CH 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13"/>Kanaan ná-doun zunu mɔungi é sɔlɔɔni, naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga Sidɔn, naa ʋolu gelei ɠɛ ga Ɠɛte. <verse eid="1CH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14"/>Kanaan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yeɓuse nuiti, Amool nuiti, Giilegase nuiti, <verse eid="1CH 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15"/>Ɠeve nuiti, Aaleke nuiti, Sine nuiti, <verse eid="1CH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16"/>Aalevade nuiti, Semaal nuiti, ta Ɠamate nuiti.<verse eid="1CH 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17"/>Sɛme mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Elame, Asuul, Aalapakasade, Lude, ta Alame. Alame mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Use, Ɠule, Getɛɛl ta Mesɛke. <verse eid="1CH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18"/>Aalapakasade Sela zɔlɔɔni, ta Sela Eɓɛɛl zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19"/>Eɓɛɛl zunu loun felegɔ zɔlɔɔni: Gilagi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Pelɛge, tɔɔzei ná-siɛgi zu ɠa zooi ɠa nuɓusɛiti zeeɠaaɠwɛɛni la, ta kɛɛɠɛloin laaseigi ɠɛni ga Yoketan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20"/>Yoketan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Alamodade, Selɛfe, Ɠasaalemavɛte, Yela, <verse eid="1CH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21"/>Ɠadolame, Uzale, Dikila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22"/>Eɓale, Aɓimayɛle, Saɓa, <verse eid="1CH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23"/>Wofiil, Ɠavila ta Yoɓaɓe. Niima nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Yoketan mavofodaiti.<verse eid="1CH 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɛɛɠɛ wola puugɔiti é zo Sɛme ma, <optbreak/> é zeeli Abalaame ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24"/>Sɛme ɠa é ɠɛni ga Aalapakasade kɛɛɠɛ, Aalapakasade ɠɛ ga Sela kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25"/>Sela ɠɛ ga Eɓɛɛl kɛɛɠɛ, Eɓɛɛl ɠɛ ga Pelɛge kɛɛɠɛ, Pelɛge ɠɛ ga Leyu kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26"/>Leyu ɠɛ ga Seluge kɛɛɠɛ, Seluge ɠɛ ga Naɠɔɔl kɛɛɠɛ, Naɠɔɔl ɠɛ ga Tela kɛɛɠɛ, <verse eid="1CH 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27"/>Tela ɠɛ ga Abalame kɛɛɠɛ nii é ga Abalaame.<verse eid="1CH 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Abalaame ná-dointi ta ti-mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28"/>Abalaame ná-dointi ti ɠɛni ga: Izaake ta Isemayɛle. <verse eid="1CH 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29"/>Wɛlɛ ti-mavofodaiti ba: Neɓayɔte, Isemayɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi, ta Kedaal, Adaɓeyɛle, Miɓisame, <verse eid="1CH 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30"/>Misema, Duma, Masa, Ɠadade, Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31"/>Yetuul, Nafise ta Kedema. Naati ka ti ɠɛni ga Isemayɛle ná-doun zunuiti. <verse eid="1CH 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32"/>Ketula Abalaame anzai nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, naa ná-dointi ti ɠɛni ga: Zimelan, Yokesan, Medan, Madiyan, Yisiɓake, ta Suwa. Yokesan ná-dointi ti ɠɛni ga: Saɓa ta Dedan. <verse eid="1CH 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33"/>Madiyan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Efa, Efɛɛl, Enɔke, Aɓida ta Eledaa. Niima nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Ketula mavofodaiti.<verse eid="1CH 1:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ezawu mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34"/>Abalaame ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Izaake, Izaake ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛ ga Ezawu ta Izilayɛle. <verse eid="1CH 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35"/>Ezawu ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Elifaze, Leyuwɛle, Yeyuse, Yalame ta Kola. <verse eid="1CH 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36"/>Elifaze ná-dointi ti ɠɛni ga: Teman, Womaal, Sefi, Gayetame, Kenaze, Timina, ta Amalɛke. <verse eid="1CH 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37"/>Leyuwɛle ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Naɠate, Zela, Sama ta Miza. <verse eid="1CH 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38"/>Seyiil mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Lotan, Sɔɓale, Siɓeyon, Ana, Dison, Esɛɛl, Disan. <verse eid="1CH 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39"/>Lotan mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Woli ta Womame. Lotan baazeelai laaseigi ɠɛni ga: Timina. <verse eid="1CH 1:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40"/>Sɔɓale mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Aliyan, Manaɠate, Eɓale, Sefi, ta Woname. Siɓeyon ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Aya ta Ana. <verse eid="1CH 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41"/>Ana ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga: Dison. Dison ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Amalan, Eseɓan, Yitilan ta Kelan. <verse eid="1CH 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42"/>Esɛɛl ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɓiliɠan, Zaavan ta Yaakan. Disan ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Use ta Alan.<verse eid="1CH 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Edɔme masagiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Zenɛze 36:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43"/>Masagiti daaseigiti kaa, niiti ti masadai ɠɛɛni Edɔme yooi unda, aisa masa ge ʋa zei Izilayɛle unda: Ɓeyɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓela, ná-taai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Dinaɓa. <verse eid="1CH 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44"/>Ɓela zaai ma, Ɓosela nui Zela ná-doun zunui Yoɓaɓe masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. <verse eid="1CH 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45"/>Yoɓaɓe zaai ma, Teman nuiti ta-you zu nui Ɠusame masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. <verse eid="1CH 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46"/>Ɠusame zaai ma, Ɓedade ná-doun zunui Ɠadade masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. Tɔun ka é vɔnini Madiyan nuiti ma Moaɓe yooi zu. Ná-taai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Avite. <verse eid="1CH 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47"/>Ɠadade zaai ma, Maseleka nui Samala masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. <verse eid="1CH 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48"/>Samala zaai ma, Sayile masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. É ɠɛni ga Leɠoɓɔte taa wolai zunu, ziɛ wolai laaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49"/>Sayile zaai ma, Akaɓɔɔl ná-doun zunui Ɓaale-Ɠanan masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. <verse eid="1CH 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50"/>Ɓaale-Ɠanan zaai ma, Ɠadade masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu. Ná-taai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Pau. Matelede ná-doun anzanui ɠa é ɠɛni ga anzai, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Meɠetaɓeyɛle, Mezaɠaɓe ná-dounloin. <verse eid="1CH 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51"/>Ɠadade zaai ma, pɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠii tanigaa ɠa ti ɠɛni Edɔme unda, ti-laaseigiti kaa: Timina, Alava, Yetete, <verse eid="1CH 1:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52"/>Woɠoliɓama, Ela, Pinon, <verse eid="1CH 1:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53"/>Kenaze, Teman, Miɓisaal, <verse eid="1CH 1:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54"/>Magadiyɛle ta Iilame. Edɔme ɠundiɠiiti kana.<verse eid="1CH 1:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Zakɔɓe ná-doun zunuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1"/>Izilayɛle ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Luɓɛn, Simiyɔn, Levi, Zuda, Isakaal, Zaɓulɔn, <verse eid="1CH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2"/>Dan, Zozɛfe, Ɓɛnzamɛn, Nɛfɛtali, Gade, ta Asɛɛl.<verse eid="1CH 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zuda mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3"/>Doun zunu saʋagɔ ɠa Zuda sɔlɔɔni, anzai ʋa Kanaan nui, Suwa ná-doun anzanui, naama lointi daaseigiti kaa: Ɛɛl, Wonan, Sela. Zuda ná-doun zunu mɔungi Ɛɛl zɔgi ɲɔi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, tama é paa. <verse eid="1CH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4"/>Zuda ná-doun anzai Tamaal, doun zunua zɔlɔɔni Zuda ɓɔɠɔi ʋɛ, naati daaseigiti kaa: Pelɛze ta Zela. Naati pɛ ta ɓɔna su, zunu loun lɔɔlugɔ ɠa Zuda sɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="1CH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5"/>Pelɛze ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠɛsɛlon ta Ɠamule. <verse eid="1CH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6"/>Zela doun zunu lɔɔlugɔ zɔlɔɔni: Zimili, Etan, Ɠeman, Kalakɔle ta Dala. <verse eid="1CH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7"/>Kaalemi ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga: Akaal. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ga nimizai ma ungi Izilayɛle ʋɛ, siɛgi zu é kɔɔzogani ta makɛni la ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ, nii makɛga ɠɛni de Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nɔ ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8"/>Etan ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga: Azalia. <verse eid="1CH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9"/>Ɠɛsɛlon ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yelameyɛle, Lame ta Keluɓayi.<verse eid="1CH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10"/>Lame Aminadaɓe zɔlɔɔni, Aminadaɓe Naason zɔlɔɔ, nii é ɠɛni ga Zuda ʋɛlɛyeɠei ma lotuɠɔi, <verse eid="1CH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11"/>Naason Salema zɔlɔɔ, Salema Ɓoaze zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12"/>Ɓoaze Woɓɛde zɔlɔɔ, Woɓɛde Izayi zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13"/>Izayi ná-doun zunu mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Eliyaɓe, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Aɓinadaɓe, saʋasiɛi ɠɛ ga Simeya, <verse eid="1CH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14"/>naanisiɛi ɠɛ ga Netaneyɛle, dɔɔlusiɛi ɠɛ ga Ladayi, <verse eid="1CH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15"/>dɔzitasiɛi ɠɛ ga Wosɛme, naati pɛ poluma dɔfelasiɛi ɠa é ɠɛni ga Davide. <verse eid="1CH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16"/>Ti-ʋaazeelaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Seluya ta Aɓigayile. Doun zunu saʋagɔ ɠa Seluya sɔlɔɔni: Aɓisayi, Zoaɓe ta Azayɛle. <verse eid="1CH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17"/>Aɓigayile zunu loun ɠila sɔlɔɔni Yetɛɛl ʋɛ, Isemayɛle nui, ná-doun zunui naa laasei ge ɠɛni ga Amasa.<verse eid="1CH 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18"/>Zunu loun saʋagɔ ɠa Ɠɛsɛlon ná-doun zunui Kalɛɓe sɔlɔɔni anzai Azuɓa ʋa, ta Yeliyɔte, naati ti laaseigiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yesɛɛl, Soɓaɓe ta Aaladon. <verse eid="1CH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19"/>Azuɓa zaani, Kalɛɓe zɛba é Efalate zeɠe ga anza, naa doun zunu ɠila sɔlɔɔ bɛ, daaseigi ga Ɠuul. <verse eid="1CH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20"/>Ɠuul Uli zɔlɔɔni, Uli Ɓɛsaleyɛle zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21"/>Naa ʋoluma, Ɠɛsɛlon kona ʋuulɔzitai (60) zɔlɔɔgai ma, é ʋilɛni Galaade kɛɛɠɛ Makiil ná-doun anzanui ʋolu, é fulu ga anza. Naa doun zɔlɔɔ bɛ daaseigi ga Seguɓe. <verse eid="1CH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22"/>Seguɓe ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Yayiil, nii é taa wola ʋuufelegɔ maazu saʋagɔ (23) ɠɛni zea Galaade yooi zu. <verse eid="1CH 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23"/>Kɛlɛ Gesuul masagiti ta Alame geleiti ti Yayiil ná-taaiti kulani mavofodaiti zea, naa ʋɛɛ Kenate taa wolai ʋa, ta taa wolai niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni koba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɗa ɠɛ ga taa wola ʋuulɔzita (60). Niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni zeini taai naati su, ti ɠɛni ga Makiil mavofodaiti, nii é ɠɛni ga Galaade kɛɛɠɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24"/>Ɠɛsɛlon zaai ma, nii anzai ɠɛni ga Aɓiya, Kalɛɓe ʋilɛni Efelata ʋolu, naa doun zunu zɔlɔɔ bɛ nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Asuul, nii é Tekoa laaɠulani.<verse eid="1CH 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25"/>Ɠɛsɛlon ná-doun zunu mɔungi Yelameyɛle ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Lame, ma mɔungi ɠana, naa ʋoluma Ɓuna, Wolɛn, Wosɛme ta Ayiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26"/>Yelameyɛle anza ɠili sɔlɔɔni, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Atala, naa doun zunu zɔlɔɔ bɛ, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Woname. <verse eid="1CH 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27"/>Yelameyɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi Lame ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Maase, Yamin ta Ekɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28"/>Woname ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Samayi ta Yada. Samayi ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Nadaɓe ta Aɓisuul. <verse eid="1CH 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29"/>Aɓisuul anzai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Aɓiyayile, naa doun zunu felegɔ zɔlɔɔni bɛ: Aaɓan ta Molide. <verse eid="1CH 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30"/>Nadaɓe ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Selɛde ta Apayime. Selɛde zaani, é la doun zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 2:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31"/>Apayime ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Yiseyi, Yiseyi Sesan zɔlɔɔ, Sesan Aalayi zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32"/>Samayi kɛɛɠɛloin Yada ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yetɛɛl ta Zonatan. Yetɛɛl zaani, é la doun zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33"/>Zonatan ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Pelɛte ta Zaza. Yelameyɛle mavofodaiti kana.<verse eid="1CH 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34"/>Sesan la ɠɛni zunu loun zɔlɔɔni, anzanu lointi nɔ ɠa ti ɠɛni zea. Ezipete nu ɠɛni zea ga duɔi, daaseigi ga Yalaɠa. <verse eid="1CH 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35"/>É ná-doun anzanui gila feeni naa ya ga anza. Naa doun zunu zɔlɔɔni, é daasei pɛɛ ga Atayi. <verse eid="1CH 2:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36"/>Atayi Natan zɔlɔɔni, Natan Zaɓade zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37"/>Zaɓade Efelale zɔlɔɔ, Efelale Woɓɛde zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38"/>Woɓɛde Zewu zɔlɔɔ, Zewu Azalia zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39"/>Azalia Ɠelɛse zɔlɔɔ, Ɠelɛse Elasa zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40"/>Elasa Sisimayi zɔlɔɔ, Sisimayi Salume zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41"/>Salume Yekamia zɔlɔɔ, Yekamia Elisama zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="1CH 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42"/>Yelameyɛle kɛɛɠɛloin Kalɛɓe nɔnɔ ma lointi ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Ná-doun zunu mɔungi ɠɛni ga Mesa nii é Zife laaɠulani, felesiɛi ɠɛni ga Malesa, naa ɠa é Eɓelɔn laaɠulani. <verse eid="1CH 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43"/>Eɓelɔn ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Kola, Tapua, Lekɛme ta Sema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44"/>Sema Laɠame zɔlɔɔni, Laɠame Yolokɛyame zɔlɔɔ. Lekɛme Samayi zɔlɔɔni, <verse eid="1CH 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45"/>Samayi Maon zɔlɔɔ, Maon Ɓɛte-Suul zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46"/>Kalɛɓe anzai nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔi ɠɛʋele, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Efa, naa doun zunua zɔlɔɔni Kalɛɓe ʋɛ: Ɠalan, Mosa ta Gazɛze. Ɠalan Gazɛze zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 2:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47"/>Yadayi ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Legeme, Yotame, Gesan, Pelɛte, Efa ta Saafe. <verse eid="1CH 2:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48"/>Kalɛɓe anzai nii é la vuluni ga zɔi ɠɛʋele, daaseigi ga Maaka, naa doun zunua zɔlɔɔni bɛ: Seɓɛɛl ta Tilana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49"/>Naa ʋoluma, é Mademana kɛɛɠɛ Saafe zɔlɔɔ, naa ʋɛɛ Makaɓena ta Giɓea ti-ɠɛɛ Seva ʋa. Doun anzanu ɠɛni Kalɛɓe ya ɓalaa, daaseigi ga Akasa. <verse eid="1CH 2:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50"/>Kalɛɓe mavofodaiti kana. Kalɛɓe anzai Efelata, nɔnɔ ma loun zunu mɔungi Ɠuul ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Sɔɓale, nii é Kiliyate-Yeyalime laaɠulani, <verse eid="1CH 2:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51"/>Salema, nii é Ɓɛteleyɛme laaɠulani, naa ʋɛɛ Ɠalɛfe ʋa, nii é Ɓɛte-Gadeel laaɠulani. <verse eid="1CH 2:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52"/>Sɔɓale nii é Kiliyate-Yeyalime laaɠulani, naa vofodaa zɔlɔɔni: Naati ka ti ga Alowe nuiti ta Menuɠote nuiti gilazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 2:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53"/>Kiliyate-Yeyalime ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yetɛɛl nuiti, Pute nuiti, Sumate nuiti, ta Misala nuiti. Naama ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ka Sɔla nuiti ta Esetawɔle nuiti ti ɠulaai ti zu. <verse eid="1CH 2:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54"/>Salema mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɓɛteleyɛme nuiti, Netofa nuiti, Atalɔte-Ɓɛte-Zoaɓe nuiti, ta Manati nuiti gilazuʋɛ, ta Sɔla nuiti, <verse eid="1CH 2:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55"/>naa ʋɛɛ faaɠwɛ nuiti ta ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ba ti ɠɛni zeini Yaɓese: Tileya nuiti, Simeyate nuiti, ta Sukate nuiti. Naati ka ti ga Ken nuiti, Lekaɓe ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔi Ɠamate mavofodaiti.<verse eid="1CH 2:55"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Davide mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1"/>Wɛlɛ Davide ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti ba, niiti é ti zɔlɔɔni Eɓelɔn: Ma mɔungi laa ɠɛni ga Amenɔn, Zizeleyɛle nui Ayinoame ná-doun zunui. Felesiɛi laa ɠɛni ga Daniyɛle, Kaalamɛle nui Aɓigayile ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1CH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2"/>Saʋasiɛi laa ɠɛni ga Aɓasalɔme, Maaka ná-doun zunui, Gesuul masagi Talamayi ná-doun anzanui. Naanisiɛi laa ɠɛni ga Adoniya, Ɠagite ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1CH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3"/>Dɔɔlusiɛi laa ɠɛni ga Sefatia, Aɓitale ná-doun zunui, ta dɔzitasiɛi laa ɠɛ ga Yitileyame, Egela ná-doun zunui, Egela naa ɓalaa ɠɛni ga Davide anzai ta. <verse eid="1CH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4"/>Doun zunu lɔzitai naati ti zɔlɔɔni bɛ Eɓelɔn, ʋɛ é kona dɔfela ta alu dɔzita ɠɛni ná masadai zu. É kɛ ga kona ʋuusaʋa maazu saʋa (33) masadai zu Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5"/>Niiti é ti zɔlɔɔni Zeluzalɛme, naati kaa: Simeya, Soɓaɓe, Natan, Salomɔn, naati naanigɔ pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Ɓate-Seɓa ná-dointi, Amiyɛle ná-doun anzanui. <verse eid="1CH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6"/>Naa ʋoluma doun zunu taaʋuugɔ ɠiligaa ti zɔlɔɔni Davide ʋɛ ʋolu: Yiɓaal, Elisama, Elifelɛte, <verse eid="1CH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7"/>Nɔga, Nefɛge, Yafia, <verse eid="1CH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8"/>Elisama, Eliada, ta Elifelɛte. Doun zunu taaʋuugɔ ɠiligaa ɠana ti zɔlɔɔni Davide ʋɛ ʋolu. <verse eid="1CH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9"/>Davide ná-doun zunuiti pɛ kana, naa pɛ poluma, anzai niiti é la ɠɛni ti vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, naati ɓalaa ti zunu lointi sɔlɔɔni bɛ. Ti pɛ ti-ʋaazeelai ɠɛni ga Tamaal.<verse eid="1CH 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10"/>Salomɔn mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Loɓoame, Aɓiya, Aza, Zozafate, <verse eid="1CH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11"/>Yolame, Aɠazia, Zoase, <verse eid="1CH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12"/>Amasia, Azalia, Yotame, <verse eid="1CH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13"/>Aɠaze, Ezekiase, Manasé, <verse eid="1CH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14"/>Amon, ta Zoziase. <verse eid="1CH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15"/>Zoziase ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ma mɔungi ɠɛni ga Yoɠanan, felesiɛi Yeɠoyakime, saʋasiɛi Sedesiyase, ta naanisiɛi Salume. <verse eid="1CH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16"/>Yeɠoyakime ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Yekonia ta Sedesiyase. <verse eid="1CH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17"/>Yekonia nii ti liini la duɔlai zu, fofodaiti ti ɠɛni ga: Seyalitiyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18"/>naa ʋoluma, Malikilame, Pedaya, Sɛnasaal, Yekamia, Wosama, ta Nedaɓia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19"/>Pedaya ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zoloɓaɓɛle ta Simeyi. Zoloɓaɓɛle zunu loun felegɔ zɔlɔɔni: Mesulame ta Ɠanania, Selomite ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-zeelai, <verse eid="1CH 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20"/>naa ʋoluma, zunu loun lɔɔlugɔ ɠiligaa ti zɔlɔɔni bɛ: Asuɓa, Woɠɛle, Ɓelekia, Ɠasadia, ta Yusaɓe-Ɠesɛde. <verse eid="1CH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21"/>Ɠanania ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Pelatiya ta Yesaya. Lefaya ná-doun zunuiti ta Aalanane nɔnɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ Aɓediyase nɔnɔiti ba ta Sekania nɔnɔiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: <verse eid="1CH 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22"/>Doun zunu lɔzita ɠa Sekania sɔlɔɔni: Semaya, Ɠatuse, Yigeyale, Ɓalia, Nɛyalia, ta Safate. <verse eid="1CH 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23"/>Doun zunu saʋagɔ ɠa Nɛyalia sɔlɔɔni: Eliyɔyenayi, Ezekiase, ta Azilikame. <verse eid="1CH 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24"/>Doun zunu lɔfela ɠa Eliyɔyenayi sɔlɔɔni: Wodavia, Eliasiɓe, Pelaya, Akuɓe, Yoɠanan, Delaya, ta Anani.<verse eid="1CH 3:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Zuda mavofodai taɠiligaa laaseigiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1"/>Zuda mavofodaiti kaa: Pelɛze, Ɠɛsɛlon, Kaalemi, Ɠuul, ta Sɔɓale. <verse eid="1CH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2"/>Sɔɓale ná-doun zunui Leaya ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Yaɠate, Yaɠate Aɠumayi ta Laɠade zɔlɔɔ. Naati ka ti ɠɛni ga Sɔla ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti-mɛmɛwolani. <verse eid="1CH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3"/>Etame ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zizeleyɛle, Yisima, ta Yideɓase, ti-ʋaazeelai ɠɛni ga Aselɛleponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4"/>Penuwele Gedɔɔl zɔlɔɔni, Ezɛɛl Ɠusa zɔlɔɔ. Ɠuul mavofodaiti kana, nii é ɠɛni ga Efelata ná-doun zunu mɔungi, Ɓɛteleyɛme laaɠula nui.<verse eid="1CH 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5"/>Anza felegɔ ɠa é ɠɛni Tekoa kɛɛɠɛ Asuul ya: Ɠeleya ta Naala. <verse eid="1CH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6"/>Naala doun zunua zɔlɔɔni bɛ: Aɠuzame, Ɠefɛɛl, Temeni, ta Aɠasetali. <verse eid="1CH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7"/>Ɠeleya ɓalaa doun zunua zɔlɔɔni bɛ: Selete, Soɠaal, ta Etenan. <verse eid="1CH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8"/>Kɔse Anuɓe ta Ɠasoɓeɓa zɔlɔɔni, naa ʋɛɛ Aɠaleɠeel ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ba, nii é ɠɛni ga Ɠalume ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1CH 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9"/>Ɠaazu unfegi ɠɛni Yaeɓɛse ʋɛ é leʋe kɛɛɠɛlointi ba. Dee daaseigi ʋɛɛni ga Yaeɓɛse, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ma: «Gè doin nii zɔlɔɔgɛ soolɛi zu.» <verse eid="1CH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10"/>Yaeɓɛse wooɠulani Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɗa-luyai loo bɛ̀ ga ɠiteɠite, è nà-zooi zuwɔɔlɔ, ɗa-ɓaa maazu yeei zɛlɛ màazu, maanɔɠɔi ta soolɛi maaɠooza bà!» GALA ma ge naa veeni zea, nii é falini naa ma.<verse eid="1CH 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11"/>Suɠa kɛɛɠɛloin Keluɓe ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Meyiil, nii é ɠɛni ga Eseton kɛɛɠɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12"/>Eseton ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɓɛte-Lafa, Paseya, ta Teyina, nii é Naɠase taai laaɠulani. Niima nuiti ka ti ɠɛni zeini Leka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13"/>Kenaze ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Woteniyɛle ta Selaya. Woteniyɛle ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠatate <verse eid="1CH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14"/>ta Meyonotayi, nii é Wofela zɔlɔɔni. Selaya Zoaɓe zɔlɔɔni, ɲɛɛliɠi nuiti ti-ɠɛwola, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛ nuiti ta-ʋɛtugi zu.<verse eid="1CH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15"/>Yefuné ná-doun zunui Kalɛɓe nɔnɔ ma loun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Ilu, Ela, ta Naame. Ela ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Kenaze.<verse eid="1CH 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16"/>Yeɠalelɛle ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zife, Zifa, Tilia, ta Azaleyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17"/>Ɛsedalase ná-doun zunuiti: Yetɛɛl, Melɛde, Efɛɛl, ta Yalɔn. Melɛde anzai dointi sɔlɔɔni: Miliyame, Samayi, ta Yisiɓa, nii é ɠɛni ga Esetemoa kɛɛɠɛ. <verse eid="1CH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18"/>(Anzai nii é ɠɛni ga Zuifui ta, naa ɓalaa dointi sɔlɔɔni: Yelɛde nii é Gedɔɔl laaɠulani, Ɠeɓɛɛl nii é Soko laaɠulani, naa ʋɛɛ Yekutiyɛle ʋa, nii é Zanoa laaɠulani.) Ɓitiya ná-doun zunuiti kana, Falaɠɔn ná-doun anzanui nii Melɛde seɠeni ga anza. <verse eid="1CH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19"/>Naɠame baazeelai, nii é ɠɛni ga Wodiya anzai, ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Keyila kɛɛɠɛ Galame nui, ta Esetemoa Maakate nui.<verse eid="1CH 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20"/>Simon ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Amenɔn, Lina, Ɓɛne-Ɠanan, ta Tilɔn. Yiseyi ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Zoɠɛte ta Ɓɛne-Zoɠɛte. <verse eid="1CH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21"/>Zuda ná-doun zunui Sela mavofodaiti kaa: Ɛɛl nii é ɠɛni ga Leka kɛɛɠɛ, Layeda nii é ɠɛni ga Malesa kɛɛɠɛ, naa ʋɛɛ pɛlɛyeɠeiti ba niiti ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu geze ʋagɔi ma ti ɠɛni zeini Ɓɛte-Asaɓea, <verse eid="1CH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22"/>Yokime, Kozeɓa nuiti, Zoase, ta Salafe, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Moaɓe unda, ta Yasuɓi-Leɠɛme. Niima aniiti ta ga faa wɔlɔma. <verse eid="1CH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23"/>Ti ɠɛni ga pɔlɔ liɠi lo nuiti niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Netayime ta Gedela masagi ɠoba, ti ɗa boti ɠɛ bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Simiyɔn mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24"/>Simiyɔn ná-doun zunuiti: Nemuwɛle, Yamin, Yaliɓe, Zela, ta Sayile. <verse eid="1CH 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25"/>Sayile mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛi ma, é li lointi pɔ: Salume, Miɓisame, ta Misema. <verse eid="1CH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26"/>Misema ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠamuwɛle, Zakuul, ta Simeyi. <verse eid="1CH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27"/>Doun zunu puugɔ maazu lɔzita (16) ta anzanu loun lɔzita ɠa Simeyi sɔlɔɔni. Kɛɛɠɛlointi ti la ɠɛni doun mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔni. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Simiyɔn wolodamai ma ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti la ɠɛni wola ɓuɠuzu ga Zuda geleiti kɛʋele. <verse eid="1CH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28"/>Ti ɠɛni zeini taai wolai niiti su: Ɓeel-Seɓa, Molada, Ɠasaal-Suale, <verse eid="1CH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29"/>Ɓiliɠa, Esɛme, Tolade, <verse eid="1CH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30"/>Ɓetuwɛle, Ɠɔɔlema, Sikilage, <verse eid="1CH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31"/>Ɓɛte-Maalekaɓɔte, Ɠasaal-Susime, Ɓɛte-Ɓileyi, ta Saalayime. Naati ka ti ɠɛni ga ta-laa wolaiti, eyɛsu Davide ɗa masadai zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32"/>Ma laa goiti ti ɠɛni ga dɔɔlugɔ: Etame, Ayɛn, Limon, Tokɛn, ta Asan. <verse eid="1CH 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33"/>Naati ka ti ʋɛɛzu zɔɔma laa goiti ba, niiti ti taa wolai naati maaɠoolii zu, eyɛsu é zeeli Ɓaale. Ti-zeizuʋɛti kana, ta ti-mavofodaiti kana ɓalaa.<verse eid="1CH 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34"/>Mesoɓade, Yamelɛke, Amasia ná-doun zunui Yosa, <verse eid="1CH 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35"/>Zowɛle, Zewu, Yosiɓia ná-doun zunui, nii kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ga Selaya, naa kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛ ga Aziyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36"/>Eliyɔyenayi, Yaakoɓa, Yesoɠaya, Azaya, Adiyɛle, Yesimiyɛle, Ɓenaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37"/>Ziza, Sifeyi ná-doun zunui, é lati é ɠɛ ga Alon ná-dounloin, naa ɓɔɠɔi mu ge ɠɛni ga Yedaya, ta Simili, naa ʋɛɛ Semaya ʋa ti-mavofodai ta, <verse eid="1CH 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38"/>zunui niiti ti-laaseigiti bogai, naati ka ti ɠɛni ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti gola ɠaa yɛni wɔɔlɔzu. <verse eid="1CH 4:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39"/>Ti liini ga Gedɔɔl taa lɔa ʋelei, folo ɠulazu ʋelei pɛtugi letemaʋɛ, nii a kɛ ti ta-ʋaalagiti daamiizu zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40"/>Ti tufa lɛnu papagi zɔlɔɔni, zooi ta zu ʋɛ ná zuwɔɔlɔai, ná ɠaalɛiɗai ga pagɔ, ziilɛigi ɓalaa ge ná, ʋɛ Same mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni zeini ná wɔlɔwɔlɔi zu. <verse eid="1CH 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41"/>Siɛgi zu Ezekiase ɠɛni la ga Zuda masagi, pɛlɛ ungi niiti ti laaseigi wogai, naati ti wuzeɠeni, ti li naama yooi zu, ti Same mavofodaiti ta-zeɠe ɠotaiti golo, ti ma nuɓusɛiti paa tɛtɛ, nu la mɔ vɔlɔ naati po kaazu za logi zu. Ti zeini naati ta-yooi ná zu, tɔɔzei ti ta-loganiiti daamiizu ʋagɔ zɔlɔɔni ná. <verse eid="1CH 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42"/>Simiyɔn mavofodaiti su, nu undɔɔlugɔ (500) liini, ti zei Seyiil ɠize yooi zu, ta-lotuɠɔiti ti ɠɛni Yiseyi ná-doun zunui niiti: Pelatiya, Neyalia, Lefaya, naa ʋɛɛ Uziyɛle ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 4:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43"/>Ti Amalɛke ɠɔɔ looɠobai mɔta goiti paani, ti zei miná, naa ɠa dɛ ti ná zaaɠaza.<verse eid="1CH 4:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Luɓɛn mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1"/>Luɓɛn ɠa é ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi, kɛlɛ tɛi é laani kɛɛɠɛ anzai gila koba, nii é la ɠɛni vuluni ga zɔiti kɛʋele, ná-doun mɔun tosuʋɛ ɠulani zea, é ve Izilayɛle ná-doun Zozɛfe ná-doun zunuiti zea. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Luɓɛn laaseigi la mɔ ɠɛni zɛʋɛni doun mɔun tosuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2"/>Zuda ɠɛɛni ga zɛbɛsu nu wola kɛɛɠɛlointi saama, mavofodaiti saama ɠa masa ge zɔlɔɔni ná, kɛlɛ doun mɔun tosuʋɛ veeni Zozɛfe ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3"/>Izilayɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi Luɓɛn ná-dointi daaseigiti kaa: Enɔke, Palu, Ɠɛsɛlon ta Kaalemi. <verse eid="1CH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4"/>Zowɛle nɔnɔ mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Semaya, Gɔge, Simeyi, <verse eid="1CH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5"/>Misé, Leaya, Ɓaale, <verse eid="1CH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6"/>Ɓeyela. Ɓeyela ɠɛni ga totuɠɔ wola Luɓɛnni mavofodaiti saama. Tɔ ɠa Asiili masagi Tigilate-Pilezɛɛl seɠeni, é lii la duɔlai zu. <verse eid="1CH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7"/>Ɓeela kɛɛɠɛlointi pɛtɛ, ti laaseigiti ti zɛʋɛai, eɠɛʋelei ta-wolodamaiti ti la, ta ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti: Ma mɔungi ɠɛni ga Yeiyɛle, naa ʋoluma Zakali, <verse eid="1CH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8"/>ti-ɠaaɓelagi ɠɛni ga Zowɛle ná-dounloin Sema nɔnɔ ma lounloin Azaze ná-doun zunui Ɓela. Niima nuiti ti ɠɛni zeini Alowɛɛl ɠoʋii ma ta zooi nii diai é zei Neɓo gizei ʋa ta taai nii zu daa ga Ɓaale-Meyon. <verse eid="1CH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9"/>Ti ɠɛni zeini teʋebai laawu folo ɠulazu ʋelei, eyɛsu é zeeli ziɛ wolai Efelate ma, tɔɔzei ta-logani ɓulugiti suwɔɔlɔni Galaade yooi zu. <verse eid="1CH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10"/>Sayile ná-siɛgi zu, ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Ɠagaal nuiti ba, ti vɔni naati ma, ti naati ta-ʋɛlɛiti seɠe ga ti-ɲiizuʋɛti Galaade yooi zu folo ɠulazu ʋelei.<verse eid="1CH 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gade mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11"/>Gade mavofodaiti ti ɠɛni zeini ti ɠoba lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei Ɓasan nɛmɛi zu, eyɛsu ti zei Saleka ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12"/>Naati saama, pɛlɛyeɠe wolai ɠɛni ga Zowɛle nɔnɔi, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Safame nɔnɔi, naa ʋoluma Yayenayi ta Safate ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti. <verse eid="1CH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe lɔfela ɠili ge ɠɛni ti ɠoba, naama ʋɛlɛyeɠe ungiti kaa: Mikayɛle, Mesulame, Seɓa, Yolayi, Yayekan, Ziya, ta Eɓɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14"/>Naati pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Aɓiyayile ná-doun zunuiti, Aɓiyayile mɛmɛwolani daaseigiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Ɠuli, Yaloa, Galaade, Mikayɛle, Yesisayi, Yado, ta Ɓuze. <verse eid="1CH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15"/>Guni ná-doin Aɓidiyɛle ná-doun zunui Ayi ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti pɛ ma lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16"/>Ti ɠɛni zeini Galaade yooi zu, ta Ɓasan, naa ʋɛɛ ná maaɠoolii zu yooi pɛ ba, ta togani losuʋɛti kpein ti ɠɛni Salon, eyɛsu ti zeeli kwɛpelemaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17"/>Niima nuiti pɛ daaseigi zɛʋɛni daasei sɛʋɛ zɛʋɛ wolai zu, siɛgi zu Yotame ɠɛni la ga Zuda masagi, Zeloɓoame ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi.<verse eid="1CH 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18"/>Luɓɛn ta Gade ti-mavofodaiti, naa ʋɛɛ Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ʋa, kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti ti ɠɛni naati zea, niiti ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuunaani maazu naanigɔ undɔfela puulɔzita (44.760), ti zoogai kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi zosu, naa ʋɛɛ boɠa zɔkpɔi ʋa, ti zoogai ɓalaa mɛɛin ʋilisu, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ga ti li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19"/>Ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Ɠagaal nuiti ba, ti pɛɛ Yetuul ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ Nafise ta Nodaɓe ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20"/>GALA ge ɓɔni ti ʋa, é zobogi ve ti ya, ti vɔni Ɠagaal nuiti ma ta niiti kpein ti kpɔni su, tɔɔzei siɛgi zu ti ɠɛni kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu la, ti wooɠulani GALA ma. GALA ge ti wooɠaaʋoteni, tɔɔzei ti laani da. <verse eid="1CH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21"/>Ti naati ta-loganiiti pɛ seɠeni: ɲɔmɛ waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50.000), baalagi ta bolii naati ti ɠɛni ga waaunfelegɔ waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ (250.000), soovalegi ɠɛni waafelegɔ (2.000). Ti nu waaungila (100.000) soni ɓalaa ga duɔiti. <verse eid="1CH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22"/>Ti zili nui ma mɔinmɔin ge zaani, tɔɔzei GALA ɓɔɠɔgoi ɠa kɔɔi naa ɠɛni zeezu. Ti zeini naati ta-yooi zu, eyɛsu ti lii ziɛgi zeeli duɔlai zu.<verse eid="1CH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manasé mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23"/>Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ zeini zooi naa zu, nii sogai Ɓasan ʋa, é zei Ɓaale-Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn ʋa, é zo Seniil ʋa, é zei Ɠɛɛlɛmɔn gizei ʋa. Ta-nuɓusɛiti gola ɠaawɔɔlɔni. <verse eid="1CH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24"/>Ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti daaseigiti kaa: Efɛɛl, Yiseyi, Eliyɛle, Azaliyɛle, Zelemi, Wodavia ta Yadiyɛle. Ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔi niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, ti ɠɛ ɓalaa ga tɔɠɔɠulagiti.<verse eid="1CH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25"/>Kɛlɛ bolodamai niiti ti-mavofodai ti gaaɓela kɛɛni ga ti ɠɛ ga wooʋalada nuiti ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, ti ɠɛlɛ naa ʋa, ti ɗa zooi naa zu nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠalagi dɛbi, zii ɠiligi niiti GALA ge ti zuɠoloɠoloni ti ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26"/>Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, GALA ge Asiili masagi niiti buzeɠeni ti laalɔɠɔma: Pule ta Tigilate-Pilezɛɛl, ga ti li ga bolodamai niiti ma nuɓusɛiti: Luɓɛn ta Gade, naa ʋɛɛ Manasé wolodamai ɠilazuʋɛ, ti ti ʋu taai niiti su: Ɠala, Ɠaɓɔɔl, ta Ɠala, naa ʋɛɛ Gozan ɗɛi maaɠoolii ʋa, zaaɠaza mináti ka ti zeini náti.<verse eid="1CH 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 5:27"/>Levi ná-doun zunuiti: Gɛɛlɛson, Keɠate, ta Melali. <verse eid="1CH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 5:28"/>Keɠate ná-doun zunuiti: Amalame, Yiseɠaal, Eɓelɔn, ta Uziyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 5:29"/>Amalame ná-dointi: Aalɔn, Moize, ta Miliyame. Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti: Nadaɓe, Aɓiyu, Eleazaal, ta Itamaal. <verse eid="1CH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 5:30"/>Eleazaal ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Fineyase, naa mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Aɓisua, <verse eid="1CH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 5:31"/>Ɓuki, Uzi, <verse eid="1CH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 5:32"/>Zelayia, Melayɔte, <verse eid="1CH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 5:33"/>Amalia, Ayituɓe, <verse eid="1CH 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 5:34"/>Sadɔke, Ayimaase, <verse eid="1CH 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 5:35"/>Azalia, Yoɠanan, <verse eid="1CH 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 5:36"/>Azalia, nii é zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛɛni GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu, nii Salomɔn toni Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CH 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 5:37"/>Azalia Amalia zɔlɔɔni, Amalia Ayituɓe zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 5:38"/>Ayituɓe Sadɔke zɔlɔɔ, Sadɔke Salume zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 5:39"/>Salume Yilikiya zɔlɔɔ, Yilikiya Azalia zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="1CH 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 5:40"/>Azalia Selaya zɔlɔɔ, Selaya Yewosadake zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 5:41"/>Yewosadake liini duɔlai zu, siɛgi zu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Zuda ta Zeluzalɛme nuɓusɛiti teʋeni da duɔlai zu ga Neɓukadenɛzaal maaʋele.<verse eid="1CH 5:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1"/>Levi mavofodaiti kaa: Gɛɛlɛson, Keɠate ta Melali. <verse eid="1CH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2"/>Gɛɛlɛson ná-dointi kaa: Liɓini ta Simeyi. <verse eid="1CH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3"/>Keɠate ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Amalame, Yiseɠaal, Eɓelɔn, ta Uziyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4"/>Melali ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Maali ta Musi. Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti kaa, ti laaseigiti sɛʋɛai ti-ɠɛɛni tɔɠɔiti bu.<verse eid="1CH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Liɓini, Yaɠate, Zima, <verse eid="1CH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6"/>Yoa, Ido, Zela, Yeatalayi.<verse eid="1CH 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7"/>Keɠate mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Aminadaɓe, Kolé, Asiil, <verse eid="1CH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8"/>Ɛlɛkana, Eɓiyasafe, Asiil, <verse eid="1CH 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9"/>Taɠate, Uliyɛle, Uziya, Sayile. <verse eid="1CH 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10"/>Ɛlɛkana ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Amasayi ta Ayimɔte. <verse eid="1CH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11"/>Ɛlɛkana mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Sofayi, Naɠate, <verse eid="1CH 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12"/>Eliyaɓe, Yeloɠame, Ɛlɛkana, ta Samiyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13"/>Samiyɛle ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ma mɔungi ɠɛni ga Zowɛle, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Aɓiya.<verse eid="1CH 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14"/>Melali mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma é li lointi pɔ: Maali, Liɓini, Simeyi, Uza, <verse eid="1CH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15"/>Simeya, Ɠagiya, ta Azaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16"/>Levi mavofodaiti daaseigiti pɛtɛ, niiti Davide guye loo vai veeni ti ya Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, siɛgi zu ti minazeɠe kesui laani la ná. <verse eid="1CH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17"/>Ti ɠɛni niina ta-wuye loo wotii ɠɛɛzu seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai laaʋɛ, nii é ga GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi, eyɛsu Salomɔn pɛlɛi lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ Zeluzalɛme. Ti ɠɛni ta-wotii ɠɛɛzu, é zoloo devei naa ma, nii é veeni ti ya. <verse eid="1CH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18"/>Pɛtɛ niiti ka ti ɠɛni naama wotii ɠɛɛzu ta ti-loun zunuiti. Keɠate mavofodaiti saama: Ɠeman, nii é ɠɛni ga gɛingɛin gani gɛin nui, fofodaiti kaa, é zo lointi ma, é li ɠɛɛɠɛiti pɔ: Zowɛle, Samiyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19"/>Ɛlɛkana, Yeloɠame, Eliyɛle, Toa, <verse eid="1CH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20"/>Sufe, Ɛlɛkana, Maɠate, Amasayi, <verse eid="1CH 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21"/>Ɛlɛkana, Zowɛle, Azalia, Sofoni, <verse eid="1CH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22"/>Taɠate, Asiil, Eɓiyasafe, Kolé, <verse eid="1CH 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23"/>Yiseɠaal, Keɠate, Levi, Izilayɛle ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="1CH 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24"/>Kɛɛɠɛloin Azafe ɠɛni loni zeezazuʋɛ, ta nii ti ɠɛni ga bolodamai. Naa mavofodaiti kaa, é zo lointi ma, é li ɠɛɛɠɛiti pɔ: Ɓelekia, Simeya, <verse eid="1CH 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25"/>Mikayɛle, Ɓaazeya, Malikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26"/>Eteni, Zela, Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27"/>Etan, Zima, Simeyi, <verse eid="1CH 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28"/>Yaɠate, Gɛɛlɛson, Levi ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="1CH 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29"/>Etan ɠɛni loni ga kɔʋɛzu ʋelei, Melali mavofodaiti saama, ta niiti ti ɠɛni ga bolodamai. Etan mavofoda ɠitei kaa, é zo lointi ma, é li ɠɛɛɠɛiti pɔ: Kisi, Aɓidi, Maluke, <verse eid="1CH 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30"/>Ɠasaɓiya, Amasia, Yilikiya, <verse eid="1CH 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31"/>Amesi, Ɓani, Semɛɛl, <verse eid="1CH 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32"/>Maali, Musi, Melali, Levi ná-doun zunui. <verse eid="1CH 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33"/>Levi wolodamai zɔiti kpein ti ɠɛni boti ɠiligiti ma GALA ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai.<verse eid="1CH 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34"/>Aalɔn ta fofodaiti ti ɠɛni zalaɠaiti kulazu gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ, ti ɗa ansansegiti gala naama zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ. Botii kpein maanɛɛni ga é ɠɛ ada ɲadega wolai, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni naati kɛɛzu. Tiya nɔ ɠa ɓalaa ti ɠɛni losu Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ, naati ta-ɠotoiti gba vai ma zalaɠa ɠula vaiti su, eɠɛʋelei nɔ GALA ná-botiɠɛ nui Moize deveni la. <verse eid="1CH 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35"/>Aalɔn mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Eleazaal, Fineyase, Aɓisua, <verse eid="1CH 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36"/>Ɓuki, Uzi, Zelayia, <verse eid="1CH 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37"/>Melayɔte, Amalia, Ayituɓe, <verse eid="1CH 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38"/>Sadɔke, ta Ayimaase.<verse eid="1CH 6:38"/></para>
  <para style="s">Taai niiti ti veeni Levi mavofodaiti zea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39"/>Pɛtɛ taaiti daaseigiti ba, niiti ti veeni Aalɔn mavofodaiti zea, niiti ti ga Keɠate mavofodaiti saama. Ti taaiti feeni ti ya ga kpakutoomai: <verse eid="1CH 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40"/>Zuda yooi zu laai Eɓelɔn, ta maaɠoolii. <verse eid="1CH 6:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41"/>Kɛlɛ kpalagiti ta taa goiti ti ɠilini ma laai ʋa, ti naati feeni Yefuné ná-doun zunui Kalɛɓe ya.<verse eid="1CH 6:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42"/>Taa wolai niiti ka ti veeni Aalɔn mavofodaiti zea ga maaʋela laaiti, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Eɓelɔn, Liɓina, Yatiil, Esetemoa, <verse eid="1CH 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43"/>Yilɛn, Deɓiil, <verse eid="1CH 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44"/>Asan, ta Ɓɛte-Semɛse. <verse eid="1CH 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Geɓa, Alemɛte, ta Anatɔte. Ti pɛ kpɔga taa puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13) ɠa ti sɔlɔɔni, ti gaaɠwɛ ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ba.<verse eid="1CH 6:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46"/>Keɠate mavofodai zɔiti ti taa wola puugɔ zɔlɔɔni ga kpakutoomai Efelayime ta Dan ta-wolodaiti ta-yooiti su, naa ʋɛɛ Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ná-zooi zu. <verse eid="1CH 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti ti sɔlɔɔni ga taa wola puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13), ti naati sɔlɔɔni Isakaal, Asɛɛl, Nɛfɛtalini ti-mavofodaiti ta-yooiti su, ta Manasé mavofodaiti ta-yooi zu Ɓasan. <verse eid="1CH 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48"/>Melali mavofodaiti ti taa wola puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) zɔlɔɔni ga kpakutoomai, Luɓɛn, Gade, ta Zaɓulɔnni ta-wolodaiti ta-yooiti su. <verse eid="1CH 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49"/>Izilayɛle nuiti ti niima laa wolaiti ta ti-maaɠooliiti feeni Levi mavofodaiti bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50"/>Taai niiti ti-laaseigiti bogai maazu ʋelei, ti naati feeni ti ya ɓalaa ga kpakutoomai, Zuda, Simiyɔn, ta Ɓɛnzamɛnni ta-wolodaiti ta-yooiti su.<verse eid="1CH 6:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51"/>Keɠate mavofodai zɔiti, taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni, Efelayime ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: <verse eid="1CH 6:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52"/>Sikɛme, nii é ɠɛni ga maaʋela laai ta Efelayime ɠize yooi zu, Gezɛɛl, <verse eid="1CH 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53"/>Yokemeyame, Ɓɛte-Ɠolon, <verse eid="1CH 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54"/>Ayalon, ta Gate-Limon. <verse eid="1CH 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Anɛɛl, ta Ɓileame. Mináti ka Keɠate mavofodai zɔiti ti sɔlɔɔni.<verse eid="1CH 6:55"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56"/>Gɛɛlɛson mavofodaiti, taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Golan, nii é Ɓasan yooi zu, ta Asatalɔte. <verse eid="1CH 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Isakaal ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Kedɛse, Daɓelate, <verse eid="1CH 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58"/>Lamɔte, ta Anɛme. <verse eid="1CH 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Asɛɛl ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Masale, ta Aɓedon, <verse eid="1CH 6:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60"/>Ɠukɔke, ta Leɠɔɓe. <verse eid="1CH 6:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Kedɛse, nii é Galilé yooi zu, Ɠamon, ta Kiliyatayime.<verse eid="1CH 6:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62"/>Melali mavofodai zɔiti, taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni, Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodamai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Limono, ta Taɓɔɔl. <verse eid="1CH 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Zuludɛn ziɛ ʋoluʋelei, Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, Zeliko letemaʋɛ, Luɓɛn ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Ɓesɛɛl, nii é teʋebai zu, Yasa, <verse eid="1CH 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64"/>Kedemɔte, ta Mefaate. <verse eid="1CH 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65"/>Taai niiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni Gade ná-bolodai ná-zooi zu, ta ti-maaɠooliiti, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Lamɔte, nii é Galaade yooi zu, Maɠanayime, <verse eid="1CH 6:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66"/>Ɠɛsɛɓon, ta Yazɛɛl.<verse eid="1CH 6:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isakaal mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1"/>Doun zunu naanigɔ ɠa Isakaal sɔlɔɔni: Tola, Pua, Yasuɓe ta Similon. <verse eid="1CH 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2"/>Tola ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Uzi, Lefaya, Yeliyɛle, Yamayi, Yiɓisame, ta Samiyɛle, naati kpein ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti Tola mavofodaiti su. Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu. Davide ɠɛai ma ga masagi, ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuufele maazu felegɔ undɔzita (22.600). <verse eid="1CH 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3"/>Uzi mavofodaiti kaa: Yizalaya, naa ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Mikayɛle, Aɓediyase, Zowɛle, Yizalayia. Ti nu lɔɔlugɔ pɛ ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4"/>Salaʋusuiti ti ɠɛni ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti zea, naati ti-liegɔi ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔzita (36.000), tɔɔzei ti-anzaiti ta ti-lointi mɔin ʋelei ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5"/>Isakaal mavofodaiti ta-nuɓusɛi pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga waaʋuulɔsaʋa maazu lɔfela (87.000), ti ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti niiti ti-laaseigiti sɛʋɛai.<verse eid="1CH 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6"/>Doun zunu saʋagɔ ɠa Ɓɛnzamɛn sɔlɔɔni: Ɓela, Ɓekɛɛl, ta Yediayɛle. <verse eid="1CH 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7"/>Ɓela sɔlɔɔni ga zunu loun lɔɔlugɔ: Ɛsɛɓon, Uzi, Uziyɛle, Yelimɔte, ta Ili, naati ka ti ɠɛni ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, ti ɠɛ ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, tɛiti kpein ti laaseigi zɛʋɛni, ti ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufele maazu felegɔ puusaʋagɔ maazu naanigɔ (22.034). <verse eid="1CH 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8"/>Ɓekɛɛl mavofodaiti kaa: Zemila, Yoase, Eliyezɛɛl, Eliyɔyenayi, Womeli, Yelemɔte, Aɓiya, Anatɔte, ta Alemɛte. Ɓekɛɛl mavofodaiti kana. <verse eid="1CH 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9"/>Ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛai ma, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga zunu waaʋuufelegɔ unfelegɔ (20.200), ti ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, ti ɠɛ kɔɔɠuluɓaiti. <verse eid="1CH 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10"/>Yediayɛle mavofodaiti kaa: Ɓiliɠan, nii ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Yeyuse, Ɓɛnzamɛn, Eɠude, Kenaana, Zetan, Taalasise, Ayisaɠaal. <verse eid="1CH 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11"/>Yediayɛle mavofodai niiti kpein ti ɠɛni ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ma lotuɠɔiti, niiti zunu waapuugɔ maazu lɔfela unfelegɔ (17.200) ɠɛni ti zaama ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga ti li kɔɔɠɔzu. <verse eid="1CH 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12"/>Supime ta Ɠupime ti ɠɛni ga Iil ná-doun zunuiti, Ɠusime ɠɛ ga Aɠɛɛl ná-doun zunui.<verse eid="1CH 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13"/>Nɛfɛtali mavofodaiti kaa: Yasiyɛle, Guni, Yesɛɛl ta Salume. Nɛfɛtali dee ɠɛni ga Ɓiliɠa.<verse eid="1CH 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Manasé mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14"/>Manasé mavofodaiti kaa: É doun zunu felegɔ zɔlɔɔni Siili anzanui ʋa, nii é la vuluni ga zɔi ɠɛʋele, naama loun mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Asaliyɛle, felesiɛi laaseigi ɠɛ ga Makiil, naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga Galaade kɛɛɠɛ. <verse eid="1CH 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15"/>Makiil anza ɠila fuluni Ɠupime ʋɛ, é gila fulu Supime ʋɛ. Baazeelai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Maaka. Doun zunui velesiɛi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Selofeɠade, anzanu letele nɔ ɠa naa sɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16"/>Makiil anzai Maaka doun zunu ɠili sɔlɔɔni bɛ, é daasei pɛɛ ga Pelɛse, é taɠili sɔlɔɔ, é naa laasei pɛɛ ga Selɛse. Selɛse ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Ulame, Lekɛme. <verse eid="1CH 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17"/>Ulame ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga: Ɓedan. Galaade mavofodaiti kana, Makiil ná-doun zunui, é ga Manasé ná-dounloin. <verse eid="1CH 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18"/>Galaade baazeelai Yamolekɛte zunu loun zɔlɔɔni: Yisɔde, Aɓiyezɛɛl, ta Maala. <verse eid="1CH 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19"/>Semida ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Ayiyan, Sikɛme, Liki, ta Aniame.<verse eid="1CH 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Efelayime mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20"/>Efelayime mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Sutela, Ɓelɛde, Taɠate, Eleyada, Taɠate, <verse eid="1CH 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21"/>Zaɓade, Sutela. Ezɛɛl ta Eleyade, Gate nui niiti ti ɠɛni ga zooi naa zu nuiti, ti naati felegɔ ʋaani, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti naati ta-logani ɓulugiti seɠe ga tɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CH 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22"/>Ti-ɠɛɛ Efelayime folo mɔinmɔin kɛɛni ti zaa wɔlɔi ɠa. Baalobaiti ti ʋaani ga ti gaanɛɛnɛ. <verse eid="1CH 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23"/>Naa ʋoluma Efelayime laani anzai ɠoba, naa kogi zeɠe, é doun zunu zɔlɔɔ, é daasei pɛɛ ga Ɓelia (nii poluʋɛ ga «kpɔlɔi zu»), tɔɔzei ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛni kpɔlɔi zu. <verse eid="1CH 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24"/>Efelayime anzanu loun zɔlɔɔni ɓalaa, nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Seyela. Tɔ ɠa é Ɓɛte-Ɠolon taai maazu ʋelei ta buu ʋelei loni, naa ʋɛɛ Uzɛn-Seyela ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25"/>Ɓelia mavofodaiti kaa, é zo ɠɛɛɠɛiti ma, é li lointi pɔ: Lefa, Lesɛfe, Tela, Taɠan, <verse eid="1CH 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26"/>Layedan, Amiyude, Elisama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27"/>Nun, ta ná-doun zunui Zozuwe. <verse eid="1CH 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28"/>Taai niiti Efelayime nuiti ti ti zɔlɔɔni ga ti zei ná, mináti kaa: Ɓetɛle ta koba laaiti, Naalan ɠa é ɠɛni ga folo ɠulazu ʋelei, folo liizu ʋelei Gezɛɛl ɠa é ɠɛni miná ta koba laaiti: Sikɛme, ta taa wola felegɔi naati koba laa goiti, naa ʋɛɛ Sikɛme ta Aya ti yɔɠɔzu yooi ma laaiti pɛ ba. <verse eid="1CH 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29"/>Manasé mavofodaiti taa wolai niiti sɔlɔɔni: Ɓɛte-Seyan, Taanake, Megido, Dɔɔl, ta ti ɠoba laa goiti pɛ. Taa wolai naati su ɠa Izilayɛle ná-doun zunui Zozɛfe vofodaiti ti ɠɛni zeini ná.<verse eid="1CH 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Asɛɛl mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30"/>Asɛɛl ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Yimina, Yisiva, Yisivi ta Ɓelia, naa ʋɛɛ ti-ʋaazeelai Sela ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31"/>Ɓelia ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ɠeɓɛɛl, ta Malekiyɛle. Malekiyɛle naa ɠa é Ɓilizavite laaɠulani. <verse eid="1CH 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32"/>Ɠeɓɛɛl nɔnɔ ma loun zunuiti kaa: Yafilɛte, Somɛɛl, Wotame, ta ti-ʋaazeelai Suwa. <verse eid="1CH 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33"/>Yafilɛte ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Pasake, Ɓimiɠale, ta Asavate. Yafilɛte ná-doun zunuiti kana. <verse eid="1CH 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34"/>Semɛɛl ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ayi, Loyega, Ɠuɓa, ta Alame. <verse eid="1CH 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35"/>Kɛɛɠɛloin Ɠelɛme ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Sofa, Yimina, Selɛke, ta Amale. <verse eid="1CH 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36"/>Sofa ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Suwa, Ɠaalenefɛɛl, Suale, Ɓeli, Yimila, <verse eid="1CH 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37"/>Ɓesɛɛl, Wode, Sama, Silisa, Yitilan, ta Ɓeyela. <verse eid="1CH 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38"/>Yetɛɛl ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Yefuné, Pisipa, ta Ala. <verse eid="1CH 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39"/>Ula ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ala, Ɠaniyɛle, Lisia. <verse eid="1CH 7:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40"/>Niima nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Asɛɛl mavofodaiti, ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔ ʋagɔiti, ti ɠɛni ga nu ɓiigiti kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, ta totuɠɔ nu wolaiti. Zunui niiti ti-laaseigiti ti zɛʋɛni niiti ta zoo liizu kɔɔɠɔzu, naati ti ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuufele maazu lɔzita (26.000).<verse eid="1CH 7:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8"/>
  <para style="s">Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-doun zunuiti ti-laaseigiti kaa: Ɓela ɠa é ɠɛni ga doun mɔungi, Asaɓɛle ɠɛ ga felesiɛi, saʋasiɛi ɠɛ ga Aala, <verse eid="1CH 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2"/>naanisiɛi ɠɛni ga Noɠa, dɔɔlusiɛi ɠɛ ga Lafa. <verse eid="1CH 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3"/>Ɓela doun zunuiti sɔlɔɔni: Adaal, Gela, Aɓiyude, <verse eid="1CH 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4"/>Aɓisua, Naaman, Aɠoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5"/>Gela, Sefufan, ta Ɠulame.<verse eid="1CH 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6"/>Eɠude ná-doun zunuiti Geɓa nuɓusɛiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti ti ti zeɠeni zeizu, ti naati sei Manaɠate. Ti-laaseigiti kaa: <verse eid="1CH 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7"/>Naaman, Ayiya, ta Gela, nii é ɠɛni ga Uza ta Ayiyude ti-ɠɛɛ, naa ɠa é loni seɠeseizui luɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8"/>Saɠalayime anzaiti kpɛɛni, Ɠusime ta Ɓaala, naa ʋoluma é doun zunua zɔlɔɔni Moaɓe nɛmɛi zu. <verse eid="1CH 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9"/>É anzanu ɠili seini nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Wodɛse, é doun zunuiti sɔlɔɔ naa ʋa, naati daaseigiti kaa: Yoɓaɓe, Siɓia, Mesa, Malekame, <verse eid="1CH 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10"/>Yeyuse, Sakia ta Miilima. Saɠalayime ná-doun zunuiti ti-laaseigiti kana, niiti ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti.<verse eid="1CH 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11"/>Mɔunpa dɛ, é Aɓituɓe ta Ɛlɛpaale zɔlɔɔni anzai Ɠusime ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12"/>Ɛlɛpaale ná-doun zunuiti ti-laaseigiti kaa: Eɓɛɛl, Miseyame, ta Semɛde, nii é taa wola felegɔi niiti toni: Wono, ta Lode, é ʋɛɛ ti ɠoba laa goiti ba. <verse eid="1CH 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13"/>Ɓelia ta Sema, niiti ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti Ayalon nuiti saama, ti Gate nuiti kpɛɛni. <verse eid="1CH 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14"/>Naa ʋoluma, Ɓelia ná-doun zunuiti ti-laaseigiti kaa: Ayiyo, Sasake, Yelemɔte, <verse eid="1CH 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15"/>Zeɓadia, Alade, Edɛɛl, <verse eid="1CH 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16"/>Mikayɛle, Yisifa ta Yoɠa, <verse eid="1CH 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17"/>Ɛlɛpaale ná-doun zunuiti ti-laaseigiti kaa: Zeɓadia, Mesulame, Yiziki, Ɠeɓɛɛl, <verse eid="1CH 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18"/>Yisemelayi, Yiziliya ta Yoɓaɓe. <verse eid="1CH 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19"/>Simeyi ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Yakime, Zikili, Zaɓidi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20"/>Eliyenayi, Siletayi, Eliyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21"/>Adaya, Ɓelaya, ta Similate. <verse eid="1CH 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22"/>Naa ʋoluma, Sasake ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Yisipan, Eɓɛɛl, Eliyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23"/>Aɓadon, Zikili, Ɠanan, <verse eid="1CH 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24"/>Ɠanania, Elame, Antotiya, <verse eid="1CH 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25"/>Yifideya, ta Penuwele. <verse eid="1CH 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26"/>Yeloɠame ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Sameselai, Seɠalia, Atalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27"/>Yalesia, Eliya ta Zikili.<verse eid="1CH 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28"/>Naati ka ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la. Ti ɠɛni zeini Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 8:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29"/>Gaɓaɠɔn kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni zeini Gaɓaɠɔn taazuʋɛ, ta anzai nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30"/>Ná-doun zunu mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Aɓadon, naa ʋolu Suul, Kise, Ɓaale, Nadaɓe, <verse eid="1CH 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31"/>Gedɔɔl, Ayiyo, ta Zekɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32"/>Mikelɔte ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Simeya. Niima nuiti ɓalaa ti zeini Zeluzalɛme ti-ɠɛɛlointi koba.<verse eid="1CH 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sayile vofodaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 9:39-44">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 9:39-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33"/>Nɛɛl Kise zɔlɔɔni, Kise Sayile zɔlɔɔ. Sayile ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zonatan, Malekisua, Aɓinadaɓe, naa ʋɛɛ Eseɓaale ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34"/>Zonatan Meliɓe-Ɓaale zɔlɔɔni, Meliɓe-Ɓaale Misé zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35"/>Misé ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Piton, Melɛke, Taalea ta Aɠaze. <verse eid="1CH 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36"/>Aɠaze Yewoada zɔlɔɔni, Yewoada ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Alemɛte, Azamavɛte, ta Zimili. Zimili Mosa zɔlɔɔni, <verse eid="1CH 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37"/>Mosa Ɓineya zɔlɔɔ, Ɓineya Lafa zɔlɔɔ, Lafa Eleyasa zɔlɔɔ, Eleyasa Asɛle zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38"/>Doun zunu lɔzita ɠa Asɛle sɔlɔɔni, ti laaseigiti kaa: Azilikame, Ɓokelu, Isemayɛle, Sealia, Aɓediyase naa ʋɛɛ Ɠanan ʋa. Asɛle ná-doun zunuiti kana. <verse eid="1CH 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39"/>Asɛle kɛɛɠɛloin ɠɛni ga Esɛke. Esɛke ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa: Ulame ɠa é ɠɛni ga doun mɔungi, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Yeyuse, saʋasiɛi ɠɛ ga Elifelɛte. <verse eid="1CH 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40"/>Ulame ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔ nu wolaiti, ti zoogai mɛɛin ʋilisu. Ti wola ɓuɠuni, ti-lointi ta ti-lounlointi gola mɔinni. Ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu ungila nu ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (150). Niima nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodaiti.<verse eid="1CH 8:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9"/>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme zei wo nuiti <optbreak/> ti ɠulaa ʋoluma duɔlai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ daaseigi zɛʋɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe ʋelei, daasei sɛʋɛ zɛʋɛ wolai zu, nii é ɠɛni masagiti zea. Zuda nuɓusɛiti ti liini Ɓaɓilɔne duɔlai zu, tɔɔzei ta-wooʋaladai ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2"/>Niiti ti ɠɛni ga nu mɔun ti ɠale ma ʋolu ta-yooiti su, ti zei ta-laaiti su, naati ti ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nuiti, zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Levi mavofodaiti, ta niiti ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1CH 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3"/>Naa ʋoluma, Zuda, Ɓɛnzamɛn, Efelayime ta Manasé wolodamaiti su nuiti ti ʋaani, ti zei Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4"/>Zuda wolodamaiti su, zɔiti ti ʋaani, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Utayi, nii é ɠɛni ga Amiyude ná-doun zunui, Amiyude naa ɠɛni ga Womeli ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ga Imili ná-dounloin, Imili naa ɓalaa kɛɛɠɛ ɠɛni ga Ɓani, nii é ɠɛni ga Pelɛze ná-bolodai zu nui ta. <verse eid="1CH 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5"/>Silo nuiti su, niiti ti ʋaani, ti zei, ti ɠɛni ga: ná-doun zunu mɔungi Azaya ta ná-doun zunuiti. <verse eid="1CH 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6"/>Zela mavofodaiti su, zɔi é ʋaani, é zei, naa ɠɛni ga: Yeyuwɛle. Zuda wolodamaiti su nuiti niiti ti zeini Zeluzalɛme ti ɠɛni ga nu undɔzita nu ʋuutaaʋuugɔ (690).<verse eid="1CH 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodai zu niiti ti ʋaani, ti zei, naati ti ɠɛni ga: Salu, Mesulame ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ga Wodavia ná-dounloin, é ɓalaa ga Ɠasenua ná-dounloun loin. <verse eid="1CH 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8"/>Naa ʋolumai ɠɛni ga Yiɓeneya, Yeloɠame ná-doun zunui, Ela, Uzi ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ga Mikili ná-dounloin, Mesulame, Sefatia ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ga Leyuwɛle ná-dounloin, é ɓalaa ga Yiɓiniya ná-dounloun loin. <verse eid="1CH 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodai zu niiti ti ʋaani, ti zei, naati ti ɠɛni ga nu untaaʋuugɔ puulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔzita (956), naama nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti.<verse eid="1CH 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10"/>Zɔiti ti ʋaani zalaɠa ɠula nuiti saama, naati kaa, é zo lointi ma, é li ɠɛɛɠɛiti pɔ: Yedaya, Yeɠoyaliɓe, Yakin, <verse eid="1CH 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11"/>Azalia, Yilikiya, Mesulame, Sadɔke, Melayɔte, Ayituɓe, naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12"/>Adaya ɓalaa ge ɠɛni ná, Yeloɠame ná-doun zunui, nii mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni ga: Pasuul ta Malikiya. Mayesayi ɓalaa ʋaani, Adiyɛle ná-doun zunui, nii mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni ga: Yazela, Mesulame, Mesilemite, naa ʋɛɛ Imɛɛl ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13"/>Naati ti ʋɛɛ zɔɔma zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ba, ti ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu waagila undɔfela puulɔzita (1.760), ti ɠɛni ga zɛbɛsu nuiti ta nu ɓiigiti, ti ɗa botii ɠɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1CH 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14"/>Levi mavofodaiti saama, zɔiti ti ʋaani, ti zei, naati kaa é zo lointi ma, é li ɠɛɛɠɛiti pɔ: Semaya, Ɠasuɓe, Azilikame, ta Ɠasaɓiya, niiti ti ɠɛni ga Melali ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15"/>Ɓakeɓakaal ɓalaa ɠɛni ná, naa ʋɛɛ Ɠelɛse ʋa, ta Galale, naa ʋɛɛ Matania ʋa, nii é ɠɛni ga Misé ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ga Zikili ná-dounloin ta Azafe mavofodai. <verse eid="1CH 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16"/>Aɓediyase ɠɛni ná, Semaya ná-doun zunui, Galale ta Yedutun ti-mavofodai. Ɓelekia ɠɛni ná ɓalaa, Aza ná-doun zunui, é ga Ɛlɛkana ná-dounloin, nii é ɠɛni ɲii wosu Netofa nuiti ta-laaiti su.<verse eid="1CH 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ná: Salume, Akuɓe, Talamɔn, Ayiman, ta ti-ɠɛɛlointi. Salume ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18"/>Zaaɠaza mavofodaiti ka dɛ ti botii ɠɛɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ folo ɠulazu ʋelei, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ʋɛai ga masagi ná-siɠidaʋɛ. Siɠida makɛ nuiti ka ti ɠɛni Levi mavofodaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19"/>Salume, Kolé ná-doun zunui, Eɓiyasafe ta Kolé ti-mavofodai, ta Kolé ʋɛlɛyeɠei zɔiti pɛ bu nuiti, ti ɠɛni ga GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ makɛ nuiti, eɠɛʋelei ti-mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ makɛsu la. <verse eid="1CH 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20"/>Mɔungi Eleazaal ná-doun zunui Fineyase ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni ba. <verse eid="1CH 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21"/>Meselemia ná-doun zunui Zakali ɓalaa ɠɛni ga GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ makɛ nui ta.<verse eid="1CH 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22"/>Niiti kpein ti yeeloni ti ʋa ga ti ɠɛ ga siɠida makɛ nuiti, ti ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ nu puu maazu felegɔ (212). Ti-laaseigiti ti zɛʋɛni ga taa ʋelei. Davide ta GALA goo wo nui Samiyɛle ti naama losuʋɛ veeni ti ya eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23"/>Tiya-o, ti-mavofodaiti-yo, ta-wotii ɠa ga ti ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ makɛ, seɠe ʋɛlɛi laaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋepema naanigɔiti pɛ su: folo ɠulazu ʋelei, folo liizu ʋelei, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei ta lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei. <verse eid="1CH 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25"/>Siɠida makɛ nui zɔi niiti ti ɠɛni ti ɓɔɠɔ laaiti su, naati ti ɓena ʋa, ti ɗa dɔɔɠɔ ɠilagilagi ɠɛ ti ɠoba. <verse eid="1CH 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26"/>Kɛlɛ siɠida makɛ nu ɓii naanigɔi niiti ti ɠɛni ná nɔ ɠɔ, Levi mavofodaiti ge ɠɛni ga tiye, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu ɲii wosuʋɛti ma, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma naavolo makɛsuʋɛ ma. <verse eid="1CH 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27"/>Ti ɠɛni ɲiizu piin GALA sei ʋɛlɛ maaɠoolii zu, tɔɔzei tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu ma, naa ʋoluma, kɛni sobu-o-sobu ti ma ʋɛlɛlaʋɛti daalao.<verse eid="1CH 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28"/>Tanigaa ta-wotii ɠɛni ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu zɔɔlaiti ma, siɛgi zu ta la ɠɛna ɠulaa la ga tiye, ta la ɠɛna ɓalaa ti lɛa pɛlɛi wu, ti ɓena ti ɠaalu. <verse eid="1CH 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29"/>Taɠiligaa tɔnɔi ɠɛni ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ aniɲakai mɔtaiti ma ta zalaɠa ɠula zɔɔlaiti, naa ʋɛɛ ɓulu vukɔ ʋagɔi, dɔɔi, gulɔi, ansansegi, ta tufa maku nɛɛnɛgiti ba. <verse eid="1CH 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30"/>Kɛlɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ɓɔɠɔgo ti ɓena tufa maku nɛɛnɛgi naati kpɛtɛ. <verse eid="1CH 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31"/>Levi nu ɠila ge ɠɛni ná, é ga Kolé mavofodai Salume ná-doun zunu mɔungi, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Matitia, naa ná-botii ɠɛni ga é ɗa ɓului ɓɛtɛ, nii é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga vebɛ zalaɠai. <verse eid="1CH 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32"/>Levi mavofodai taɠiligaa niiti ti ɠɛni ga Keɠate ʋaalobaiti ta, naati ta-wotii ɠɛni ga ti ɗa ɓului ɓɛtɛ, nii é ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ dooɠo folo ɠilagila.<verse eid="1CH 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33"/>Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔi niiti ti ɠɛni guye loo vai unda, naati ti ɲii ʋɛlɛiti ti ɠɛni ná, ti-ʋɔ ge la ɠɛni zɔɔma wotii tanɔpɛ ba, tɔɔzei kpidi ʋɛɛ folo ʋa botii ɠɛni nɔ ti ya. <verse eid="1CH 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34"/>Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti kana, eɠɛʋelei ti-mavofodaiti ti la. Ti ɠɛni zeini Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sayile vofodaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35"/>Gaɓaɠɔn kɛɛɠɛ Yeiyɛle ɠɛni zeini Gaɓaɠɔn taazuʋɛ, ta anzai nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36"/>Ná-doun zunu mɔungi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Aɓadon, naa ʋolu Suul, Kise, Ɓaale, Nɛɛl, Nadaɓe, <verse eid="1CH 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37"/>Gedɔɔl, Ayiyo, Zakali, ta Mikelɔte. <verse eid="1CH 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38"/>Mikelɔte ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga Simeyame. Niima nuiti ɓalaa ti zeini Zeluzalɛme, ti-ɠɛɛlointi koba. <verse eid="1CH 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39"/>Nɛɛl Kise zɔlɔɔni, Kise Sayile zɔlɔɔ. Sayile ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zonatan, Malekisua, Aɓinadaɓe, naa ʋɛɛ Eseɓaale ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 9:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40"/>Zonatan Meliɓe-Ɓaale zɔlɔɔni, Meliɓe-Ɓaale Misé zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41"/>Misé ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Piton, Melɛke, ta Taalea. <verse eid="1CH 9:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42"/>Aɠaze Yayela zɔlɔɔni, Yayela ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Alemɛte, Azamavɛte, ta Zimili. Zimili Mosa zɔlɔɔni, <verse eid="1CH 9:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43"/>Mosa Ɓineya zɔlɔɔ, Ɓineya Lefaya zɔlɔɔ, Lefaya Eleyasa zɔlɔɔ, Asɛle zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="1CH 9:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44"/>Doun zunu lɔzita ɠa Asɛle sɔlɔɔni, ti laaseigiti kaa: Azilikame, Ɓokelu, Isemayɛle, Sealia, Aɓediyase naa ʋɛɛ Ɠanan ʋa. Asɛle ná-doun zunuiti kana.<verse eid="1CH 9:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10"/>
  <para style="s">Sayile zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Samiyɛle 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1"/>Filisiti nuiti ti kɔɔi ʋɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti ba. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋelani ti ʋa, ti-ma mɔinmɔin ge zaani ti zaama, Gileɓoa gizei ma. <verse eid="1CH 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2"/>Filisiti nuiti ti ɠaaʋoteni ga ɠiteɠite Sayile ma, ta ná-doun zunuiti. Ti ná-doun zunuiti paani: Zonatan, Aɓinadaɓe, naa ʋɛɛ Malekisua ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3"/>Kɔɔi ɠaaʋoteni Sayile nɔ ma niina. Mɛɛn ʋili nuiti ti kaani, é wola lua. <verse eid="1CH 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4"/>Sayile ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔla zeɠe nui ma: «Ɗa-woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠula ma laɠagi zu, è pàa, nii a kɛ tatipɛlɛʋolulala nui niiti ti mina ʋa pàazu, ti ʋa ɓaaɠula mà.» Kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛni kɛɛni, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni ɓalizu ga dualuagi. Sayile ɓɔɠɔi ɗa ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi zeɠe, é lɔ ga. <verse eid="1CH 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5"/>Ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔla zeɠe nui kaai ma ga é zaa, tɔ ɓalaa é lɔɔni nɔnɔ ma woɠa zɔkpɔi ɠa, é za. <verse eid="1CH 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6"/>Ʋele ɠana Sayile ta ná-doun zunu saʋagɔiti pɛ ti zaani la ʋɔɔma, naa ʋɛɛ ná-pɛlɛyeɠei pɛ ba. <verse eid="1CH 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7"/>Izilayɛle nui niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni pɛtugi zu, ti kaai ma ga Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛi ʋela, ta Sayile naa ʋɛɛ ná-doun zunuiti ba ti za, tiya ɓalaa ti ɠulani ta-laaiti su, ti ʋela. Filisiti nuiti ti ʋaani, ti zei naama laaiti su.<verse eid="1CH 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8"/>Poluma voloi Filisiti nuiti ti ʋaani kɔɔ lɔɓɔi zu, nii a kɛ ti poomaiti kɔligiti seɠe. Ti Sayile ta ná-doun zunuiti ma ʋoomaiti kaani Gileɓoa gizei ma. <verse eid="1CH 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9"/>Ti Sayile ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠe, ti nɔungi leʋe ba, ti li ga ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti ta nɔungi. Naa ʋolu ti ta-vɔnifaamai ma wooi laazeeli Filisiti yooi ná pɛ su, daazeeli nuɓusɛiti ta ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti ma. <verse eid="1CH 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10"/>Ti Sayile ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti daani ta-ɠalagiti ta-ʋɛlɛi wu, ti Sayile nɔungi zɛlɛ ta-ɠalagi Dagon ná-pɛlɛi wu.<verse eid="1CH 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11"/>Siɛgi zu Galaade yooi zu Yaɓese nuiti ti naa pɛ mɛnini da, nii Filisiti nuiti ti kɛai ga Sayile, <verse eid="1CH 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12"/>kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti ti ʋilɛni pelei ma, ti Sayile ta ná-doun zunuiti ma ʋoomaiti seɠe, ti ʋa ga tiye Yaɓese. Ti naati ma ɠaeiti maaɠulu, sɛne gului wu Yaɓese, naa ʋoluma ti zugi zoni folo lɔfela laawu.<verse eid="1CH 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13"/>Sayile saai zɔlɔɔni, tɔɔzei kololalai ʋa, nii é kɛɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI. É la ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa ɠolo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ʋɛ, naa ʋoluma é liini gɔvɛ laawooleʋe nui ta ʋɔ, é ɠɛ naa gɔvɛi ta ɠaazaɠa bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14"/>aisa tɔun é ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠa. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaani bu é za, tama é masadai zeɠe, é fe Izayi ná-doun zunui Davide ya.<verse eid="1CH 10:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11"/>
  <para style="s">Izilayɛle masagi Davide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-3">2 Samiyɛle 5:1-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1"/>Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti ʋaani Davide ʋɔ bɛ Eɓelɔn, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ada ga zii ɠila, ta ɲama ɠila. <verse eid="1CH 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2"/>Kaite Sayile ná-masadai ma ziɛgi zu, ɗa ɠa è ɠɛni losu Izilayɛle ná-kɔɔiti tuɠɔ. Tama ɗa-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠeni è ʋɛ, é ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɗa ɠa è ɠɛɛzu ga nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle maaɓɛɛ nui, è ɠɛ ga ná-totuɠɔi.› » <verse eid="1CH 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3"/>Izilayɛle ɠɛwolaiti pɛ ti ʋaani masagi Davide ʋɔ bɛ Eɓelɔn. Miná ɠa ti minazeɠe kɛɛni ná yɔɠɔzu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Ti gulɔi ziɛni ma, kɛɛ vai zu ga Izilayɛle pɛ ma masagi, é zoloo naa ma, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni, é ɠula Samiyɛle la.<verse eid="1CH 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zeluzalɛme zo fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:6-10">2 Samiyɛle 5:6-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4"/>Davide ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti liini Zeluzalɛme laalɔɠɔma, ʋɛ ná laaseigi ga Yeɓuse, naa ɠa Yeɓuse nuiti ti ɠɛni zeini ná, zooi naa zu zei wo nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5"/>Naati ti ɠɛni Davide ma: «È la lɛa taai nii zu pɛ!» Kɛlɛ Davide Siyɔn zoni, taai nii makɛgai ga siɠi gaaɠoozagiti, ti ná laasei pɛɛ ga: «Davide ná-taa wolai».<verse eid="1CH 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6"/>Davide ɠɛni ná-nuiti ma: «Zɔi nɔpɛ a ɠɛ ga nu mɔungi, é vɔni Yeɓuse nuiti ma, nà kɛ ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi.» Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe ese ka é lɛɛni ti laalɔɠɔma, tama, é ɠɛ ga kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7"/>Davide zeini taazuʋɛ, naa ɠa é kɛa ti ná laaseigi ʋɛɛni la ga: «Davide ná-taa wolai». <verse eid="1CH 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8"/>É ta ɓɔni taai zɛbɛi ʋa ga pɛlɛiti ta siɠigiti, niiti é ti loni pɛtugi maaɠoolii zu nii é daaveni, daa ga Milo. Naama ziɛgi zu, Zoaɓe ɗa taai mɔtai niinɛ. <verse eid="1CH 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9"/>Davide zɛbɛi ɠɛni liizu ga wɔɔlɔa, tama Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠɛni ba.<verse eid="1CH 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti daaseigiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Samiyɛle 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10"/>Davide ná-kɔɔɠuluɓaiti daaseigiti pɛtɛ, niiti ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti yeezeini bu ga zɛbɛi, yeeɠɛɠalai pɛ su é kɛɛni masadai zu, é zoloo naa ma nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni é ʋilɛ Izilayɛle ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11"/>Wɛlɛ Davide ná-kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti daaseigiti ba: Ɠakamoni mavofodai Yasoɓeyame, é ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti ta-lotuɠɔi. Tɔ ɠa é nu unsaʋagɔ (300) ʋaani ga ná-kpɛɛin, é ti pɛ paa ʋɔɔma kɔɔɠɔ laa ɠila su.<verse eid="1CH 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12"/>Tɔun polumai ɠɛni ga Dodo ná-doun zunui Eleazaal, Aɠoa nui. É ɠɛni kɔɔɠuluɓa saʋagɔiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13"/>Tɔ ɠa é Davide maazaani Pa-Damime, ʋɛ Filisiti nuiti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ná kɔɔɠɔ vai ma. Kpalagi ta ɠɛni miná, sulaavegai kpe ga moloi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi. Izilayɛle nuiti ti ʋelani Filisiti nuiti ba. <verse eid="1CH 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14"/>Ti lopele ɓɛtɛni kpalagi zu, ti ná zo ʋolu, ti vɔni Filisiti nuiti ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI fɔnifaama wola veeni Izilayɛle ya.<verse eid="1CH 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15"/>Yeeta, kɔɔɠuluɓa ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) saama, nu saʋagɔ yeini Davide ɠoba fasai ma Adulame ʋugi zu, siɛgi zu Filisiti ɠɔɔɓɔgi gila ge ɠɛni ɠaalɛɛzu la ba Lefayime ʋɛtugi zu. <verse eid="1CH 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16"/>Davide ɠɛni názu ná-dɔɔɠu wosuʋɛ, siɛgi zu Filisiti ɠɔɔɓɔgi gila ge zeini la Ɓɛteleyɛme. <verse eid="1CH 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17"/>Ani wɔin ta Davide zoni nɔ sa, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa a ʋa bɛ̀ ga Ɓɛteleyɛme taa loaʋɛ ma ziɛyeɠei zu ɗɛi ta pɔ̀, gè kpɔle?» <verse eid="1CH 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓa saʋagɔiti ti lɔɔni Filisiti ɠɔɔlaaɠai zu, ti ziɛi zaɠa ziɛyeɠei zu, é Ɓɛteleyɛme taa loaʋɛ. Ti ʋaani la, ti fe Davide ya, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni kɛɛni, é ʋa kpɔle. É feeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é pu ya zooi ma. <verse eid="1CH 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Nà-GALAGI kìzo nii ɠɛɠala vai ɠɛɛ vai ma! Kulaʋɛ eɠɛ nà ɠɛ naama nuiti ma ɲamai ɓɔlezu, niiti ti ɠikulaai ti-yɛnvuiti su, ti li. Tɔɔzei ti ɠikulaʋɛ ti-yɛnvuiti su pɛ, ti ʋa ʋa ga ziɛi nii.» É ɠɛlɛni kpɔle vai ʋa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 11:19">Lɔɠɔɠula faa wolai ɠana kɔɔɠuluɓa wola saʋagɔi naati ti kɛɛni.<verse eid="1CH 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20"/>Zoaɓe kɛɛɠɛloin Aɓisayi ɠa é ɠɛni ga nu saʋagɔiti ta-ɠundiɠii. Tɔ ɠa é nu unsaʋagɔ (300) ʋaani ga ná-kpɛɛin. É lɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔni naazu nu saʋagɔiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21"/>Tɔɠɔɠulani ti saʋagɔ zaama, é ɠɛ ga ta-ɠundiɠii, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni zeelini nu saʋagɔ mɔungiti su.<verse eid="1CH 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22"/>Ɓenaya, Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolai ta ná-dounloun, nii é ɠɛni ga Kaɓeseyɛle nu, é lɔɠɔɠula faa wolaiti kɛɛni. Ɓenaya naa ɠa é Moaɓe ɠɔɔɠuluɓa wola felegɔ ʋaani. Tɔ ɠa ɓalaa, kɔɔlɛ vukɔi yɛni ʋuuzu foloi ta, é yeini ziɛyeɠei ɓomaʋɛ, é zalai ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23"/>Tɔ ɠa mɔnɔ é Ezipete nui ta ʋaani, nii sɔligɔi ɠɛni ga mɛtɛlɛ felegɔ ta tukpɛ (2,5) kɛɠala, kpɛɛin é ɠɛni zea, é wɔɔlɔni ga seɠe vɛlɛ nui ná-gba gului ɠɛɠala. Tukpɔ nɔ ɠa é ɠɛni zoni Ɓenaya ya, é ʋili Ezipete nui naa ma, é naa ná-kpɛɛin ɠula zea, é paa la. <verse eid="1CH 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24"/>Lɔɠɔɠula faa wolaiti kana Ɓenaya kɛɛni, Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui, é lɔɠɔ wola zɔlɔɔni kɔɔɠuluɓa wola saʋagɔ ɠiligi niiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25"/>É lɛbiya wola zɔlɔɔni nu ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) pɛ ba, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni zeelini nu saʋagɔ mɔungiti su. Davide seini tɔ ɓɔɠɔi makɛ zalaʋusuiti unda.<verse eid="1CH 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai taɠiligaa laaseigiti kaa: Zoaɓe kɛɛɠɛloin Azayɛle, Ɓɛteleyɛme nui Dodo ná-doun zunui Ɛlɛɠanan, <verse eid="1CH 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27"/>Ɠalɔɔl nui Samɔte, Palon nui Ɠelɛse, <verse eid="1CH 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28"/>Tekoa nui Ikese ná-doun zunui Ila, Anatɔte nui Aɓiyezɛɛl, <verse eid="1CH 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29"/>Ɠusa nui Siɓekayi, Aɠoa nui Ilayi, <verse eid="1CH 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30"/>Netofa nui Maɠalayi, Netofa nui Ɓaana ná-doun zunui Ɠelɛde, <verse eid="1CH 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31"/>Liɓayi ná-doun zunui Itayi, Giɓea nui Ɓɛnzamɛn yooi zu, Pilaton nui Ɓenaya, <verse eid="1CH 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32"/>Naɠalé-Gaase nui Ɠulayi, Aalaɓa nui Aɓiyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33"/>Ɓaɠalime nui Azamavɛte, Saaleɓon nui Eliaɓa, <verse eid="1CH 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34"/>Gizon nui Ɓené-Ɠasɛme, Ɠalaal nui Sage ná-doun zunui Zonatan, <verse eid="1CH 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35"/>Ɠalaal nui Sakaal ná-doun zunui Ayiyame, Uul ná-doun zunui Elifale, <verse eid="1CH 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36"/>Mekela nui Ɠefɛɛl, Palon nui Ayiya, <verse eid="1CH 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37"/>Kaalamɛle nui Ɠɛsɛlo, Ezeɓayi ná-doun zunui Naalayi, <verse eid="1CH 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38"/>Natan kɛɛɠɛloin Zowɛle, Ɠageli ná-doun zunui Miɓaal, <verse eid="1CH 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39"/>Amɔn nui Selɛke, Ɓeyelɔte nui Naalayi, nii é ɠɛni Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe ná-kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlaiti seɠezu, <verse eid="1CH 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40"/>Ila ta Galɛɓe, Yetɛɛl nu felegɔiti, <verse eid="1CH 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41"/>Ɠɛte nui Ilii, Aalayi ná-doun zunui Zaɓade, <verse eid="1CH 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42"/>Siza ná-doun zunui Adina, é ɠɛni ga Luɓɛn wolodamai zu nu, é ɠɛni ga Luɓɛn wolodamai zu nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi, é ɠɛni zeini ɓalaa salaʋusu ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) unda, <verse eid="1CH 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43"/>Maaka ná-doun zunui Ɠanan, Miteni nui Zozafate, <verse eid="1CH 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44"/>Asatelɔte nui Uziya, Alowɛɛl nui Wotame ná-doun zunuiti, Sama ta Yeiyɛle, <verse eid="1CH 11:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45"/>Simili ná-doun zunui Yediayɛle, kɛɛɠɛloin ɓalaa Yoɠa, Tise nui, <verse eid="1CH 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46"/>Maɠava nui Eliyɛle, Ɛlɛname ná-doun zunuiti Yeliɓayi ta Yosavia, Moaɓe nui Yitima, <verse eid="1CH 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47"/>ta Metesoɓaya nuiti Eliyɛle, Woɓɛde, naa ʋɛɛ Yasiyɛle ʋa.<verse eid="1CH 11:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔɠɔ nui niiti ti ɠɛni Davide ʋa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1"/>Siɛgi zu Davide ɠɛni lɔɔɠuzu la Sikilage, nii a kɛ é maaɠooza Kise ná-doun zunui Sayile ʋa, kɔɔɠɔ nui tanigaa ti ʋaani pɔ bɛ. Naati ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti ti ɠɛni yeeveezu bɛ kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2"/>Mɛɛinti ti ɠɛni ti ya, ti zooni kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu ga ti-yeezaiti ta ti-ɠɔʋɛiti kɔtu ʋili fai zu ɓaa mɛɛn ɠae ʋili fai zu. Ti pɛ ti ɠɛni boloda ɠilagi nɔ zu ta Sayileni, Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai. <verse eid="1CH 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3"/>Ti laaseigiti kaa: ta-ɠundiɠii Ayiyezɛɛl ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zoase, Giɓea nui Sema ná-doun zunuiti, Azamavɛte ná-doun zunu felegɔiti, Yeziyɛle ta Pelɛte, Ɓelaka, Anatɔte nui Zewu, <verse eid="1CH 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4"/>Gaɓaɠɔn nui Yisemaya, naa ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔ nu ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) saama, tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-ɠundiɠii. <verse eid="1CH 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5"/>Zelemi, Yaɠaziyɛle, Yoɠanan, Gedeela nui Yozaɓade, <verse eid="1CH 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6"/>Eluzayi, Yelimɔte, Ɓealiya, Semalia, Ɠalɔfe nui Sefatia, <verse eid="1CH 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7"/>Ɛlɛkana, Yisiya, Azalɛle, Yowezɛɛl, Yasoɓeyame, niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Kolé mavofodaiti, <verse eid="1CH 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8"/>Gedɔɔl nui Yeloɠame ná-doun zunuiti Yowela ta Zeɓadia.<verse eid="1CH 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9"/>Gade wolodamaiti ti ɠɛni zeɠezu Sayile ʋa, ti ɗa ʋilɛ Davide ʋolu teʋebai zu. Ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti, ti ga salaʋusuiti ti ɠalagai ga kɔɔɠɔ vai, ti zoogai ɠɔɔzu ga kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgi ta kpɛɛin. Ti maayikini eɠɛ zalai, ti zuvilɛ eɠɛ goegiti ti ɓizɛzu gizei ma. <verse eid="1CH 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10"/>Ezɛɛl ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, naa ʋoluma Aɓediyase ɠa é ɠɛni ga felesiɛi, Eliyaɓe ɠɛ ga saʋasiɛi, <verse eid="1CH 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11"/>Misamana ɠɛ ga naanisiɛi, Zelemi ɠɛ ga dɔɔlusiɛi, <verse eid="1CH 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12"/>Atayi ɠɛ ga dɔzitasiɛi, Eliyɛle ɠɛ ga dɔfelasiɛi, <verse eid="1CH 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13"/>Yoɠanan ɠɛ ga dɔsaʋasiɛi, Ɛlɛzaɓade ɠɛ ga taaʋuusiɛi, <verse eid="1CH 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14"/>Zelemi ɠɛ ga puusiɛi, Makeɓanayi ɠɛ ga puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11). <verse eid="1CH 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15"/>Gade wolodamai zu nui naati pɛ ti ɠɛni ga salaʋusu lotuɠɔiti, zɔi zeemaalɔiɗai ti zaama, naa ɠila kpe a la zoo vɔnisu nu ungila (100) ma, zɔi zeeɠaaɓaai ti zaama, naa a la zoo vɔnisu nu waagila (1.000) ma. <verse eid="1CH 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16"/>Tiya ɠa ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛni konagi ma alu mɔungi ma ziɛve siɛgi zu, ti ziɛɠoba nuiti pɛ kpɛ, niiti ti ɠɛni folo ɠulazu ʋelei ta niiti ti ɠɛni folo liizu ʋelei.<verse eid="1CH 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodamaiti ta Zuda wolodamaiti su nui tanigaa ɓalaa ti liini Davide, ʋɛ naa lɔɔɠuni ná. <verse eid="1CH 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18"/>Davide ti laaɠomini, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni wa ʋaazu pɔ̀ ga ziilɛigi, kisiɛ ʋagɔi zu ga wo ɓɔ bà, naazu ada ɠili ɓɔɠɔ ʋa. Kɛlɛ ni wa ʋaazu ga wo yàava, wo fè sìli nuiti zea, tama gè la faa ɲɔu ɠɛɛni, ade-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI ná ɠa é tukpɔɠaaleʋe ade yɔɠɔzu.» <verse eid="1CH 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19"/>Naama ziɛgi zu GALA Zɛnvui yeini Amasayi ma, nii é ɠɛni ga nu ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) ta-ɠundiɠii, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">«Gá è ʋa, Davide, Izayi ná-doun zunui, gá è ɠoba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">Ziilɛigi ɠɛ è ʋɛ, ziilɛigi ɠɛ naati bɛ ti ɓɔsu è ʋa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:19">tɔɔzei GALA ge ɓɔga è ʋa!»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:19">Davide yeezeini ti wu, é ti ɠɛ ga ná-kɔɔɓɔgi tanigaa ma ɠundiɠiiti.<verse eid="1CH 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20"/>Manasé wolodai zu nui tanigaa ɓalaa ti ɠilini Davide ʋa, siɛgi zu naa ʋɛɛni la Filisiti nuiti ba, ga ti kɔɔi ɠɔ Sayile laalɔɠɔma. Kɛlɛ de bo ga gaama, Davide ta ná-nuiti ti la ɠɛni kɔɔɠɔni Filisiti nuiti bɛ, tɔɔzei naati ta-ɠundiɠiiti ti Davideni kpɛɛni ʋolu, ti ɠɛni ma: «Davide ta maliɠi wɔlɔmai ta yɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛna, toɠa ade ve naa ya.» <verse eid="1CH 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21"/>Siɛgi zu niina Davide ɠɛni liizu la Sikilage, názu ɠa Manasé nui niiti ti ʋilɛni la polu, ti laaseigiti kaa: Adana, Yozaɓade, Yediayɛle, Mikayɛle, Yozaɓade, Eliyu ta Siletayi. Ti ɠilagilagi pɛ ti ɠɛni ga salaʋusu waagilagila kundiɠiiti Manasé wolodamaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22"/>Naa ɠɛni ga kpɔba wola Davide ta ná-nuiti bɛ, tɔɔzei ti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti, Davide ti ɠɛɛni ga kundiɠiiti ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi zu. <verse eid="1CH 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23"/>Folo-o-folo, nuiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu, ti ɗa ʋɛɛ Davide ʋa ga ti ɓɔ ba, gaamanɔ ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi zuwɔɔlɔni, é ɠɛni eɠɛ GALA ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi.<verse eid="1CH 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi wɔɔlɔ vai gola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24"/>Salaʋusuiti tiegɔi ɠaa, niiti ti ʋaani Eɓelɔn ga ti ɓɔ Davide ʋa, ga ti Sayile ná-masadai ve zea, ʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI boni la.<verse eid="1CH 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25"/>Zuda wolodai zu nu waadɔzita nu undɔsaʋa (6.800) kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti ta kpɛɛinti ti ti ya.<verse eid="1CH 12:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26"/>Simiyɔn wolodai zu nu waadɔfela nu ungila (7.100), ti ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti.<verse eid="1CH 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27"/>Levi wolodai zu nu waanaanigɔ nu undɔzita (4.600), <verse eid="1CH 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28"/>naa ʋɛɛ Yeɠoyada ʋa, nii é ɠɛni ga Aalɔn mavofodaiti ta-ɠundiɠii, nu waasaʋagɔ nu undɔfela (3.700) ɠa é ʋɛɛni naa ʋolu. <verse eid="1CH 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29"/>Sadɔke ɠɛni ga zunu loungo nii é ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wola, ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu totuɠɔ ʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22) ɠa é ɠɛni polu.<verse eid="1CH 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30"/>Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodai zu nuiti, niiti ti ɠɛni ga Sayile kɛɛɠɛlointi, naati ti ɠɛni ga nu waasaʋagɔ (3.000), ti bɔɔlɔzu, ti ɠɛni botii ɠɛɛzu Sayile ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 12:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31"/>Nu waaʋuufelegɔ nu undɔsaʋa (20.800) ɠa é zeɠeni Efelayime wolodai zu, ti ga kɔɔɠuluɓaiti, ti pɛ ti ga lɔɠɔba nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu.<verse eid="1CH 12:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32"/>Manasé wolodai ɠilazuʋɛ zu nu waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18.000) ɠa daaseigi zɛʋɛni ga ti li, ti Davide zei ga masagi.<verse eid="1CH 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33"/>Isakaal wolodai zu totuɠɔ unfelegɔ (200) ɠa é ʋaani ta niiti ti ɠɛni ta-levei wu, ti pɛ ti ɠɛni kwɛɛ ʋelei ta yeeɠɛɠalai nii Izilayɛle ɠa faa ɠɛɛzu la.<verse eid="1CH 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34"/>Zaɓulɔn wolodai zu salaʋusu waaʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50.000) ɠa é ʋaani, ti pɛ ti ɠalagai ga kɔɔɠɔi, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga ti li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ma zii pɛ ge ti ya. Ti zooni ɓalaa kɔɔi ɠɔɔzu gilibalai zu.<verse eid="1CH 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35"/>Nɛfɛtali wolodai zu kɔɔɠuluɓa waagila (1.000) ka é zeɠeni miná, ti ʋaani ga salaʋusu waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu lɔfela (37.000), kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti ta kpɛɛinti ti ti ya.<verse eid="1CH 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36"/>Salaʋusu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu lɔsaʋa undɔzita (28.600) ɠa é zeɠeni Dan wolodai zu, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga ti li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37"/>Salaʋusu waaʋuunaanigɔ (40.000) ɠa é zeɠeni Asɛɛl wolodai zu, ti ɠalagai ga kɔɔɠɔi, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga ti li kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38"/>Bolodai niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Zuludɛn ʋoluʋelei, folo ɠulazu ʋelei, niiti ti ga Luɓɛn, Gade, ta Manasé wolodai ɠilazuʋɛ, naati ti nu waaungila waaʋuufelegɔ (120.000) leʋeni, kɔɔɠɔ zɔɔlai ma zii pɛ ge ti ya.<verse eid="1CH 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39"/>Salaʋusui niiti pɛ ti ʋaani Eɓelɔn, ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ga ti kɔɔi ɠɔ, ti pɛ ti zolooni ɠi gila ma ga ti Davide ɠɛ ga masagi Izilayɛle pɛ unda. Izilayɛle nui mɔtai zɔiti pɛ ti zolooni ma ga ti masadai ve Davide ya Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ maazu. <verse eid="1CH 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40"/>Ti kɛɛni ná Davide ɠoba ga folo saʋagɔ, ti-ɠɔnɔgi ta ti ɓɔɔle ani ɠɛni ga nii ti-ɠɛɛlointi ti ɠɛni feezu ti ya. <verse eid="1CH 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 12:41"/>Ná ɠoba yooiti su nuiti ɓalaa, eyɛsu é zeeli Isakaal, Zaɓulɔn ta Nɛfɛtali wolodamaiti su nuɓusɛiti ti daamianigiti daani soovalegiti kɔma, ta ɲɔmɛiti, soovale fuuluiti ta nikɛiti kɔma, ti ʋa ga tiye, daamianigi naati ti ɠɛni ga: ɓulu vukɔiti, kooleɠoole fɔɔi ma liʋɛiti, leezɛn vɔɔi, dɔɔi, gulɔi, nikɛiti ta baala mɔinmɔin, tɔɔzei koozunɛɛi wɔɔlɔni Izilayɛle yooi zu.<verse eid="1CH 12:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13"/>
  <para style="s">Davide lii vai <optbreak/> ga minazeɠe kesui Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Samiyɛle 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1"/>Davide salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, niiti ti ɠɛni nu waagilagilagiti ta nu ungilagilagiti unda, naa ʋɛɛ seizumaanɛgi zɔiti ba. <verse eid="1CH 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2"/>Naa ʋoluma, é ɓɔɛni Izilayɛle ʋɛbɛi pɛ pɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni wa kaana ga faa ʋagɔ ʋe, ni toɠa ɓalaa ada-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faazeikpasui zu, ade keelaiti teʋena ade-ɠɛɛlointi pɛ ma, niiti ti yɛgai ʋoluzu Izilayɛle you zɛʋɛi ɠilagilagiti pɛ su, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi mavofodaiti ba ti ta-laaiti su ta ná ɠoba yooi zu, nii a kɛ ti pɛ ti ɠaalɛ ba ade zaama. <verse eid="1CH 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3"/>Naa ʋoluma, ada ʋa niina ga ada-ƓALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ade ɠoba. Tɔɔzei siɛgi zu Sayile ɠɛa la masadai zu ade unda, ade la yiizoolɛni ga ade ʋa li kalama.» <verse eid="1CH 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4"/>Bɛbɛi pɛ ge zolooni naama ɠigi ma, ti deveni ga ti naa ɠɛ.<verse eid="1CH 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5"/>Davide Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, é zo Ezipete ɠɔtuɗɛi ma, é zeeli Leɓo-Ɠamate, nii a kɛ ti GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠe Kiliyate-Yeyalime, ti ʋaa la Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CH 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6"/>Davide ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti liini Ɓaala, nii é Kiliyate-Yeyalime, Zuda yooi zu, ga ti ʋa ga GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui, nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi maalolisu ma, nii é zeini seeluɓɛinti unda. <verse eid="1CH 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7"/>Ti GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠulani Aɓinadaɓe ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti da wotolo niinɛi zu. Uza ta Ayiyo ɠa ti ɠɛni ziɛzu wotoloi luɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8"/>Davide ta Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ɠoozunɛɛzu GALA gaazu, ti ɗa guyeiti too ga zɛbɛi pɛ, ti ɗa gɛingɛin ganigiti gɛin: kɔnigiti, papaiti, tamadegiti, kɔtɛgiti, ta puʋugiti.<verse eid="1CH 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9"/>Ti zeeliai ma Kidon ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ, nikɛiti ti ɓunɛni, ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ti minazeɠe kesui loo. Uza yeemaaleni, é so. <verse eid="1CH 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Uza ma, é doɠa, tɔɔzei é yeevɔɔɠuni minazeɠe kesui ʋa. Uza zaani miná, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. <verse eid="1CH 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11"/>Davide yiiɠaawanani, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nii ɠɛɠala loɠai woni ga Uza. Ná laasei ge ʋɛɛni ga Pelɛze-Uza (nii poluʋɛ ga «é ɠulaʋɛ Uza ma»), naama laaseigi ɠa dɛ é ba zaaɠaza. <verse eid="1CH 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12"/>Naama voloi Davide wola luani GALA ba, é ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ɠaazaɠa ga: «Nà zoo ɠale gè lɛ ga GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui pɔ̀ bɛ?» <verse eid="1CH 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13"/>Davide la ɠɛni liini ga minazeɠe kesui pɔ bɛ, Davide ná-taa wolai zu. Ti liini la Gate nui Woɓɛde-Edɔme ná-pɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="1CH 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14"/>GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui yɛni ná alu saʋagɔ laawu. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya looni Woɓɛde-Edɔme ʋɛ ta nɔnɔiti pɛ.<verse eid="1CH 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14"/>
  <para style="s">Tiil masagi Yilame ná-keelaiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-12">2 Samiyɛle 5:11-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1"/>Tiil masagi Yilame keelaiti teʋeni Davide ma, é sɛdele guluiti teʋe ma, ta kɔtu zaɠa nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ pɛlɛ maalɛɛ nuiti ba, nii a kɛ ti masa pɛlɛi lo Davide ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2"/>Davide kwɛɛni naazu ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tɔun toga ga Izilayɛle masagi, ta é ɠɛni ná-masadai ɠaawɔɔlɔzu, ná-nuɓusɛiti maaʋele ma, Izilayɛle nuiti.<verse eid="1CH 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-doun zunuiti <optbreak/> ti zɔlɔɔni Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:13-16">2 Samiyɛle 5:13-16</ref>; <optbreak/> <ref loc="1CH 3:5-9">1 Dɔlɔ Sɛʋɛi 3:5-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3"/>Davide zeiɗai ma Zeluzalɛme, é anza ɠiligaa vuluni, é doun zunuiti ta doun anzanuiti sɔlɔɔni naati ba. <verse eid="1CH 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4"/>Davide ná-doun zunuiti daaseigiti kaa, niiti ti zɔlɔɔni Zeluzalɛme: Samua, Soɓaɓe, Natan, Salomɔn. <verse eid="1CH 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5"/>Yiɓaal, Elisua, Ɛlɛpelɛte, <verse eid="1CH 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6"/>Nɔga, Nefɛge, Yafia <verse eid="1CH 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7"/>Elisama, Ɓeyeliyada, ta Elifelɛte.<verse eid="1CH 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-fɔnifaamaiti Filisiti nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Samiyɛle 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8"/>Siɛgi zu Filisiti nuiti ti mɛnini la ga ti gulɔi ziaa Davide ma ga é ɠɛ ga Izilayɛle masagi, ti lɛɛni gaiziɛ vai ma. Davide ma wooi mɛnini, é liini ti laaɠomisu. <verse eid="1CH 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9"/>Filisiti nuiti ti ʋaani ga kɔɔi, ti loo Lefayime ʋɛtugi zu nuiti ma. <verse eid="1CH 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10"/>Davide GALA gaazaɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà zoo nɛi gè li Filisiti nuiti daalɔɠɔma? Ɗa ti lɔ nɛi zèezu ɓaa?» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Li, nà ti lɔɔzu è yeezu.»<verse eid="1CH 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11"/>Filisiti nuiti ti zeelini Ɓaale-Pelasime, Davide vɔni ti ma miná. É ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeɠe wɔɔʋɛ sìli nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɓɔgi ʋa ga zèe, eɠɛʋelei ziɛi a ɗa kaaɠai ɠolo la.» Naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti ná laasei pɛɛni ga Ɓaale-Pelasime (nii poluʋɛ ga «Maliɠii nii é zeɠe wɔɔzu»). <verse eid="1CH 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12"/>Filisiti nuiti ti ta-ɠɔɔɠɔ ganigiti tooni ya miná, Davide devei veeni ná-nuiti zea ga ti naati gala.<verse eid="1CH 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13"/>Filisiti nuiti ti ɠaleni ma ʋolu ga kɔɔi, ti loo pɛtugi zu nuiti ma. <verse eid="1CH 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14"/>Davide GALA gaazaɠani ʋolu. Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Mina ti laaɠomi. Ɠula ga ti ʋoluʋelei, ɗa zeelizu ti ma guluiti tetemaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15"/>Siɛgi zu è nu ɠɔɠɔ lugi mɛnisu da guluiti unsuʋɛ, zuvilɛ, è ʋa, è vala ti ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ názu ɠa gè losu da è luɠɔ, nii a kɛ gè vɔni Filisiti nuiti ma.» <verse eid="1CH 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16"/>Davide naa ɠɛɛni, nii GALA boni ma. Ná-nuiti ti vɔnini Filisiti nuiti ta-ɠɔɔɓɔgi ma, ti ɗa ti ɓɛ, é zo Gaɓaɠɔn, é zeeli Gezɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17"/>Naa ɠɛɛni nɛi feya, Davide lɔɠɔi ɠula, ma wooi vazani zooiti pɛ su, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Davide maayikini zooiti pɛ gaazu.<verse eid="1CH 14:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15"/>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠe kesui lii vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1"/>Davide pɛlɛiti toni ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ Davide ná-taa wolai zu. É ada ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui ʋɛ, é seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɠila to bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ma: «Levi nuiti gila kpe nɔ ɠa ti GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠezu, tɔɔzei tiya ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimazeɠeai ga tiye ga ti ɗa naa ɠɛ, ta ti ɗa botii ɠɛ bɛ yeenɔpɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3"/>Davide Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba Zeluzalɛme, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ʋaa vai zu, ga ti da ʋɛ é ná ɓɛtɛai bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4"/>Davide Aalɔn mavofodaiti ta Levi wolodamaiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, Levi nui naati kaa: <verse eid="1CH 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5"/>Keɠate ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Uliyɛle ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu ungila nu ʋuufelegɔ (120). <verse eid="1CH 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6"/>Melali ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Azaya ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ puufelegɔ (220). <verse eid="1CH 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7"/>Gɛɛlɛson ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Zowɛle ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu ungila nu ʋuusaʋagɔ (130). <verse eid="1CH 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8"/>Elisafan ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Semaya ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ (200). <verse eid="1CH 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9"/>Eɓelɔn ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Eliyɛle ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu ʋuulɔsaʋa (80). <verse eid="1CH 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10"/>Uziyɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti tetegi zu, Aminadaɓe ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-lotuɠɔi, ti ɠɛni ga nu ungila nu puu maazu felegɔ (112).<verse eid="1CH 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11"/>Davide zalaɠa ɠula nuiti Sadɔke ta Aɓiataal lolini, naa ʋɛɛ Levi nuiti ba Uliyɛle, Azaya, Zowɛle, Semaya, Eliyɛle ta Aminadaɓe. <verse eid="1CH 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa ɠa wo ga Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ta-lotuɠɔiti, à ɓɔɠɔ ɲadena, wa wo-ɠɛɛlointi, wo lɛ ga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui, wo da ʋɛ gè ná ɓɛtɛai bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13"/>Tɔɔzei tɛi wo la ɠɛni ná ma mɔungi zu, naa ɠa é kɛɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gá-ƓALAGI gi loɠani la, mazɔlɔɔ gi la ɠɛni gaiziɛni ga ʋelei tɔgi bosu la.»<verse eid="1CH 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ɲadeni, nii a kɛ ti ʋa ga Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, nii é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, naa nà-minazeɠe kesui. <verse eid="1CH 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15"/>Levi nuiti ti kesui zeɠeni ga gulu zɔkpɔiti, ti da ɠɔma, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-devei la, nii Moize feeni.<verse eid="1CH 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gɛingɛin gani nuiti ta ada makɛ nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16"/>Davide ɠɛni Levi nuiti ta-lotuɠɔiti ma, ti guye loo nuiti kɛʋele ɓɛtɛ niiti ti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu, naa ʋɛɛ ta-ɠɛingɛin ganiiti ba: kɔnigiti, papaiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɔtɛgiti ba, nii a kɛ ti ɗa koozunɛ vaiti gaanɛ ga gɛingɛin ganigiti goo wolai. <verse eid="1CH 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17"/>Levi nuiti ti yeeloni niima nuiti ba naama wotii vaa zu: Zowɛle ná-doun zunui Ɠeman, Ɓelekia ná-doun zunui Azafe, ta nii ti ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠe ɠila bu nu, naa ʋɛɛ Kusaya ná-doun zunui Etan ʋa, Melali ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu. <verse eid="1CH 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18"/>Naa ʋolu ti Levi nui taɠiligaa zeɠeni ti ʋɛɛ ti ʋa, naati ti-laaseigiti kaa: Siɠida makɛ nuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Zakali, Ɓɛn, Yaziyɛle, Semilamɔte, Yeiyɛle, Uni, Eliyaɓe, Ɓenaya, Maaseya, Matitia, Elifeleɠu, Mikineya, Woɓɛde-Edɔme naa ʋɛɛ Yeɠiyɛle ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19"/>Gɛingɛin gani gɛin nuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Ɠeman, Azafe ta Etan, naati ka ti ɠɛni kɔlu ɓɔi kɔtɛgi ɠɛinsu. <verse eid="1CH 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20"/>Zakali, Aziyɛle, Semilamɔte, Yeɠiyɛle, Uni, Eliyaɓe, Maaseya ta Ɓenaya naati ka ti ɠɛni kɔnigi ɠɛinsu ga goo ɠaaɓaingai. <verse eid="1CH 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21"/>Matitia, Elifeleɠu, Mikineya, Woɓɛde-Edɔme, Yeiyɛle, ta Azazia, naati ka ti ɠɛni kɔnigi ɠɛinsu nii galui ga lɔsaʋa, ti ɗa sei guyei wu. <verse eid="1CH 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22"/>Levi nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi Kenania ɠa é ɠɛni losu guyei luɠɔ, tɔɔzei é zooni gola naa la. <verse eid="1CH 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23"/>Ɓelekia ta Ɛlɛkana, naati ka ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu minazeɠe kesui ma. <verse eid="1CH 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti Seɓania, Zozafate, Netaneyɛle, Amasayi, Zakali, Ɓenaya, naa ʋɛɛ Eliyezɛɛl ʋa, naati ka ti ɠɛni puʋugi vɛɛzu, ti ɗa ziɛ GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠakala. Woɓɛde-Edɔme ta Yeɠiya, naati ka ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu minazeɠe kesui ma ɓalaa.<verse eid="1CH 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠe kesui zeeli vai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:12-19">2 Samiyɛle 6:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25"/>Davide ta Izilayɛle nu wolaiti, naa ʋɛɛ salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti ba, ti liini ga ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠe Woɓɛde-Edɔme ná-pɛlɛi wu, ti ʋaa la, koozunɛ wolai zaama. <verse eid="1CH 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26"/>GALA ná-kpɔbai ɠa é kɛɛni Levi mavofodaiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui zeɠeni la. Nikɛ zinɛ lɔfela ta baala sinɛ lɔfela ɠa ti kulani ga zalaɠai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27"/>Davide ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilini ga geze ʋagɔ zeɠe wolai, ga Levi nuiti kɛʋele, niiti ti ɠɛni minazeɠe kesui zeɠezu, naa ʋɛɛ guye loo nuiti ba, ta Kenania, gɛingɛin gani ɠɛin nuiti ta-ɠundiɠii. Naa ʋoluma, Davide seɠewuzeɠei ɓalaa tooni kɔba, nii é ɠɛni ga geze zeɠei, kulaai ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-zeɠei. <verse eid="1CH 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28"/>Ʋele ɠana Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti liini la ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui Zeluzalɛme, ga koozunɛ wooiti, ta kooleiti, naa ʋɛɛ puʋugiti ba, ta kɔtɛgiti, ti ɗa kɔnigiti ta papaiti gɛin. <verse eid="1CH 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29"/>Tɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠɛni lɛɛzu Davide ná-taa wolai zu, Sayile ná-doun anzanui Mikale loni, é ɗa wɛlɛ fenɛtɛlɛ laaʋɛ. É masagi Davide ɠaani, é ɗa ʋili, é ɗa kuai wo. É Davide ʋɛlɛʋɛlɛni yiimaʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 15:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1"/>Ti ʋaani ga GALA ná-minazeɠe kesui, ti da seɠe ɠotai wu, nii Davide toni bɛ. Ti gala zalaɠaiti ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti kulani GALA bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2"/>Davide ɓegai ma ga zalaɠai naati kula, é tuya looni nuɓusɛiti bɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu. <verse eid="1CH 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3"/>É zɛba é daamianigi ɠaaɠwɛ Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ba, zunuiti ta anzanuiti, ɛsɛ gilagilagi ɓulu ɠilagila sɔlɔɔni, ta sua mɔgai, é ʋɛɛ leezɛn vɔɔi ma ɓuun gilagila ba.<verse eid="1CH 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ vai <optbreak/> Levi nuiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4"/>É Levi nui tanigaa zeɠeni, naati ta-wotii ɠɛni ga ti yɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠoba, ti ɗa wooɠula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, ti ɗa guyeiti too bɛ, ti ɗa maamusɛ. <verse eid="1CH 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5"/>Naama nuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Azafe naa ɠa é ɠɛni ga ta-ɠundiɠii, ná-seikobai ɠɛ ga Zakali, naa ʋolu geleiti ti ɠɛ ga Yeiyɛle, Semilamɔte, Yeɠiyɛle, Matitia, Eliyaɓe, Ɓenaya, Woɓɛde-Edɔme ta Yeiyɛle. Gɛingɛin ganiiti ti ɠɛni ti ya: papaiti ta kɔnigiti. Azafe ɠɛni kɔtɛgiti gɛinsu. <verse eid="1CH 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nu felegɔiti, Ɓenaya ta Yaɠaziyɛle, naati ti ɠɛni puʋugi vɛɛzu siɛgi pɛ su Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠakalaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7"/>Ma mɔun ge ɠɛni ga naa, ga Davide yeelo Azafe ta ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti ba, ga ti ɗa maamusɛ wuyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Guyei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Guyeiti 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106:1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, wo wooɠula, wo dɛɛ ga toɠa ga GALA,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">wo kɛɛ vaa wolaiti dɛɛ ziiti saama!<verse eid="1CH 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9"/>À guyei loo tɔun bɛ, wo maamusɛ ga gɛingɛin ganigiti!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">À kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti kpein dɛɛ!<verse eid="1CH 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10"/>À ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛ ga GALA daasei ɲadegai!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">Niiti ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛzu, naati ti ɠoozunɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaiziɛ ta ná-zɛbɛi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">wɔin ɠɛ wo ma ga wo ɠɛ gaazu yeenɔpɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12"/>À ɠizɛ kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti su, é ti ɠɛɛni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">maaɓɛlɛ vaiti, ta ná-tukpɔɠaaleʋeiti,<verse eid="1CH 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13"/>wɔiti wo ga ná-botiɠɛ nui Izilayɛle mavofodaiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">wɔi wo ga Zakɔɓe ná-dointi, wɔi é yiimazeɠeai ga woye!<verse eid="1CH 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14"/>Ada-ƓALAGI ɠa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">toɠa deve eteai pɛ ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15"/>À ɠizɛ ná-minazeɠegi zu yeenɔpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">wooi nii é fea yamani waagila (1.000) su nuɓusɛiti zea,<verse eid="1CH 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16"/>minazeɠegi é boni Abalaame ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">ta ná-kona wooi ɠɛ de Izaake ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17"/>É kɛ ga devei Zakɔɓe ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">é ɠɛ ga ɠɔoɠɔ minazeɠegi Izilayɛle ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18"/>É ɠɛni ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">«Nà Kanaan yooi veezu è ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">toɠa ɠɛ ga wɔnɔi wo sɔlɔɔsu.»<verse eid="1CH 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19"/>Wo lɔini gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">wo goa nɔ ɠɛni de, wo ga wɛɛinti wo seikɔɠɔmai zu ná,<verse eid="1CH 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20"/>ti ɠɛni leʋeteʋesu, ziiti pɔ bɛti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">ta masadaiti pɔ bɛti.<verse eid="1CH 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21"/>Kɛlɛ GALA ge la ɠɛni ti yɛni na, nu nɔpɛ ge ʋa ti maanɔɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">ti makɛ vai ɠa é masagiti doɠani la.<verse eid="1CH 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22"/>É ɠɛni ti ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">«À mina naati sopele ɲɔu, niiti gè yiimazeɠeai ga tiye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">à mina faa ɲɔu ɠɛ ga dàawoo laazeeli nuiti.»<verse eid="1CH 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23"/>Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein, à guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Folo-o-folo, à ná-kizo fai ma woo niinɛ ʋagɔi laazeeli!<verse eid="1CH 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24"/>À ná-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma ziiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">ta kɛɛwoti maayikiaiti nuɓusɛiti saama!<verse eid="1CH 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɔɔlɔʋɛ, tɔ ɠa maamusɛi kpein soloogai ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">maayikiʋɛ é leʋe gala kiligiti ba.<verse eid="1CH 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠalagiti pɛ ta ga zɛɛ ɠalagiti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é geeɠɔlɔgi ɓɛtɛni.<verse eid="1CH 16:26"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27"/>Toɠa volozu ná-bɔɔlɔi ta ná-maayikii zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">zobogi ta koozunɛɛi ta seizu ɲadegai.<verse eid="1CH 16:27"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28"/>Nuɓusɛiti kpein zooi ɠa, à Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">wo ná-lɛbiyai ta ná-zɛbɛi ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="1CH 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29"/>À lɛbiyai ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laasei golai ʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">À ʋa ga vebɛaniiti, wo lo kakalaʋɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">À ʋilɛ ɲiibiɠa, wo nɔkɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wu, ná-ɲadedai ma voloi zu.<verse eid="1CH 16:29"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30"/>Eteai zu nuɓusɛiti kpein, à ɓali gaazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Eteai ɠa loni kpaan, é la ɲiikpiga.<verse eid="1CH 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31"/>Geeɠɔlɔgiti ti ɠoozunɛ, eteai ɠɛ koozunɛ wolai zu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">Ti dɛɛ ga zii ɠiligiti pɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa masadai ɠɛɛzu.<verse eid="1CH 16:31"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32"/>Kpoloɗɛi zikɔ, ta bu aniiti kpein.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">Dɔɓɔi ɠoozunɛ, ta su aniiti kpein.<verse eid="1CH 16:32"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33"/>Dɔɓɔzu wuluiti kpein ti wooɠula ga koozunɛɛi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">Mazɔlɔɔ toɠa ʋaazu é eteai lukpɔɠaaleʋe.<verse eid="1CH 16:33"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34"/>À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ pagɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ!<verse eid="1CH 16:34"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35"/>À ɠɛ ma: «Ee, GALAGI, gi Ɠizo Nui, gi ɠizo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">Gi ɠaalɛ ba, è gi ɠula zii ɠiligiti saama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">naa ɠa a kɛ gi è maamusɛ, ɗɛigi è ɲadegai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">gá-ɠoozunɛɛi ɠɛ ga gi ɗa è lɛbi!<verse eid="1CH 16:35"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36"/>Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, ɠɔoɠɔ ta ɠɔoɠɔ!»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 16:36">Nuɓusɛiti kpein ti ɠɛni ma: «Amina!» Ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛni.<verse eid="1CH 16:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37"/>Davide Azafe ta kɛɛɠɛlointi zɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ɠoba, ti ɗa ta-wotii ɠɛ miná yeenɔpɛ, eɠɛʋelei deveai la folo ɠilagilagi vaa ma. <verse eid="1CH 16:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti é yeeloni ti ʋa, naati ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Yedutun ná-doun zunui Woɓɛde-Edɔme, naa ʋɛɛ Woza ʋa, ta ti-ɠɛɛlointi nu ʋuulɔzita maazu lɔsaʋa (68). <verse eid="1CH 16:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39"/>É devei veeni zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke ya ta zalaɠa ɠula nui zɔiti, ga ti ɗa ta-wotii ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai ɠakalaʋɛ, nii é zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛ ma Gaɓaɠɔn, <verse eid="1CH 16:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40"/>nii a kɛ ti ɗa gala zalaɠai ɠula folo ʋɛɛ kpɔkɔ ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ maazu, eɠɛʋelei sɛʋɛai la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-tɔgi zu, nii é feeni Izilayɛle ya. <verse eid="1CH 16:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41"/>Zɔiti ti ɠɛni ti ɠoba, naati ti ɠɛni ga niiti: Ɠeman ta Yedutun, naa ʋɛɛ zɔiti ba, niiti ziimazeɠegi woni ga tiye, ti yeelo ti ʋa ga ti ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ná-wooɠɛɠiladai ɠa yɛsu ná ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 16:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42"/>Ɠeman ta Yedutun tɔnɔ ma wotii ɠɛni ga ti ɗa puʋugi vɛ, naa ʋɛɛ kɔtɛgi ɠɛin fai ʋa, ta gɛingɛin gani zɔiti niiti ti maanɛɛni ga ti ɗa ɠɛ guyei wu GALA dɛbi vai ma. Yedutun ná-doun zunuiti ta wotii ɠɛni ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ siɠidaʋɛti ma.<verse eid="1CH 16:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43"/>Naa ʋoluma, nuɓusɛiti pɛ ti ɠaleni ma ta-ɠoizuʋɛti. Davide ɓalaa ge ɠaleni ma ná-koizu ga é tuya loo ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 16:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17"/>
  <para style="s">GALA ná-minazeɠegi <optbreak/> Davide ta mavofodaiti bɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Samiyɛle 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1"/>Tɛi masagi Davide zeini ná-pɛlɛi wu, é ɠɛni GALA goo wo nui Natan ma: «Wɛlɛ! Nà ɲiizu masa pɛlɛi wu, nii togai ga sɛdele gului, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ma ge ɗa ɲi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu.» <verse eid="1CH 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2"/>Natan Davide wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nii nɔpɛ é è yiima, è kɛ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka è ʋa.»<verse eid="1CH 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3"/>Kɛlɛ naama ɓidii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni Natan ʋɔ ɠani: <verse eid="1CH 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4"/>«Li, è ɠɛ nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Ɗa laade è ʋa ɠɛ pɛlɛ losu bɛ̀, ʋɛ nà zei ná. <verse eid="1CH 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5"/>É lɔɔzei Izilayɛle nuiti kula yee ma bɛ̀ Ezipete yooi zu, é zeeli za ma, kaipa sèizu la ɠɛni ga pɛlɛ wu. Kɛlɛ gè ɠɛni ti ʋa ʋɛ nɔpɛ ta la ɠɛ ná, tama gè ɠɛni seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu, GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="1CH 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6"/>Yeeɠɛɠalai nii pɛ gè kɛɛni Izilayɛle nuiti polu, gè ɠɛni totuɠɔiti seizu ga ti lo ná-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti tuɠɔ, kɛlɛ ti zaama ɓɛ ɠa gè ɠɛni ma: Lee vaa zu wo la pɛlɛ losu bɛ̀ ga sɛdele gului?<verse eid="1CH 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7"/>« ‹Pɛtɛ, nii ɠa è liizu niina, è bo nà-botiɠɛ nui Davide ma: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: Nà ɠa gè è zeɠeni baala makɛsuʋɛ tufa lɛnugiti su, gè è ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti Izilayɛle nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8"/>Nii pɛ è yeeʋua bu, zɛ̀gɛ è ʋa naati pɛ su, gè è zili nuiti pɛ suwuɠaaleʋe. Nà lɛbiya laasei feezu è ya, ga etea nu wolaiti tɔnɔi ɠɛʋele. <verse eid="1CH 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9"/>Nà seizu veezu nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti zea, ʋɛ ta zei ná, ti la luaa ani nɔpɛ ba, telebotala nuiti ti la mɔ tɔɔzeiɗa ga ti ʋa ɗa ti zopele ɲɔu ga ma mɔungi zu ɠɛʋele, <verse eid="1CH 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10"/>eɠɛʋelei tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta-ziɛgi ɠɛni la, niiti gè ti zeini nà-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti unda. Nà è zili nuiti dɔ è yeezu. Naa ʋoluma, nɔ̀un nà, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà dɛɛzu ga ɗe ga ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga masa pɛlɛyeɠei.<verse eid="1CH 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11"/>« ‹Siɛgi zu è lii voloi zeelizu la è-mɛmɛwolani pɔ, nà è-mavofodai ta ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ sei ga è-ʋotogi masadai zu, gè ná-masadai zei. <verse eid="1CH 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12"/>Tɔ ɠa é ʋaazu pɛlɛ losu bɛ̀, nà ɓaa ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi maazu eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13"/>Nà ɓɔɠɔi nà ɠɛ bɛ ga ɠɛɛɠɛi, tɔun ge ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga doun zunu. Kɛlɛ gè la nà-nuɓɔɠɔlai maaɠoozaa ba pɛ, eɠɛʋelei gè maaɠoozani la naama nui ʋa, nii é ɠɛni ná è luɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14"/>Nà sei nà-pɛlɛyeɠei ta nà-masadai zu eyɛsu ɠɔ, ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi la ɲiikpiga eyɛsu ɠɔ.› »<verse eid="1CH 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15"/>Natan liini, é niima ɓɔɛiti pɛ ta ma ɠulakɛlɛmaiti pɛ daazeeli ga pagɔ Davide ma.<verse eid="1CH 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-maanɛɛnɛi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Samiyɛle 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16"/>Naa ɠɛai ma, Davide liini, é zei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu, é GALA fali ɠani: «Màliɠii, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà ga leeni, nà-pɛlɛyeɠei ɓalaa ka ga leeni, è liizu dàazeelizu ʋɛ gè ná? <verse eid="1CH 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17"/>È la mɔ naa ɠaani ga faa wola, ee, GALAGI. È minazeɠea ʋolu bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, ga ʋelela ʋele vaiti ti maaɠoozaai, é ʋilɛ nà-masa pɛlɛyeɠei ʋa. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗɔun ɗa sòsu eɠɛ nà ɠɛ ga nu ɓii. <verse eid="1CH 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18"/>Lee ɠili ka nà bo è ma é ʋilɛ niima lɛbiyai ʋa, nii é feezu ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui ʋɛ? Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi è kwɛ̀ɛ, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="1CH 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, tɛi ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui nɛai è ʋɛ, ta è devea ga è kɛ ɠani, naa ɠa è niima vaa wolaiti kɛa, è lati, è ti ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="1CH 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20"/>«Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nu nɔpɛ ge la ga è ɠɛʋele, gala kili nɔpɛ ge la ná, é ɠula è ʋolu, eɠɛʋelei nɔ gi mɛnigai la ga gi-woiyeɠeiti. <verse eid="1CH 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21"/>Eteai zu, zii ɓɛgele ɠa é ga ɗa-nuiti Izilayɛle nuiti kɛʋele, nii è liai, è ti unmɔɔ, ti ɠɛ ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti? È lɔɠɔɠula faa ɠɛa, tɔɔzei faa wolaiti ta faa maayiki golaiti ba, è ti ɠɛai Izilayɛle ʋɛ, è zii ɠiligiti kpɛɛʋɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti tuɠɔ, è ti unmɔɔni, è ti ɠula Ezipete yooi ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22"/>È ɗa-nuɓusɛi Izilayɛle nuiti kɛa ga ɗa-nuɓusɛiti eyɛsu ɠɔ. Ɗa ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, è ɠɛa ga ta-ƓALAGI.<verse eid="1CH 17:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23"/>«Niizu niina, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, soma kae yeenɔpɛ su, è ɓaa ɗa-minazeɠegi maazu, nii kɛa bɛ̀, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, ta nà-masa pɛlɛyeɠei ʋɛ. Kɛ eɠɛʋelei è boga la. <verse eid="1CH 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24"/>Naama minazeɠegi laazeeli kae. Naazu ɗa lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ eyɛsu ɠɔ, ta nuiti ti ɠɛ ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ɠa ga GALA kiteɠite Izilayɛle ʋɛ!› Nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui Davide, nà-masa pɛlɛyeɠei mina ɲiikpi pɛ è ɠaazu. <verse eid="1CH 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25"/>Mazɔlɔɔ, ee, nà-GALAGI, ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ɠa è dɛa ga ze, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, ga ɗa masa pɛlɛyeɠei losu bɛ̀, naa ɠa é kɛa gè gaaɓaa zɔlɔɔga, gè niima maanɛɛnɛ wooi laazeeli è ma.<verse eid="1CH 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26"/>«Niizu niina, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è ga GALA, ɗa ma ka, è minazeɠea bɛ̀ ga undaanɛɛi nii, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui. <verse eid="1CH 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27"/>Soma mu niina, è tuya loo nà-masa pɛlɛyeɠei ma, nii a kɛ é yɛ ná ɠɔ è ɠaazu. Mazɔlɔɔ, nii nɔpɛ ɗa tuya loo bɛ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, tuyai ɠa naa ma eyɛsu ɠɔ.»<verse eid="1CH 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18"/>
  <para style="s">Davide zobo sɔlɔɔ fai <optbreak/> zɔɔma ziiti ma, ti maaɠoolii zu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-14">2 Samiyɛle 8:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1"/>Naa ʋoluma Davide vɔnini Filisiti nuiti ma, é ti ɠaazu unfe seɠe, é ta-laa wolai Gate ɠula ti ya, naa ʋɛɛ koba laaiti pɛ ba.<verse eid="1CH 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2"/>É vɔnini ɓalaa Moaɓe nuiti ma. Naati ti ɠoloni bɛ, ti ɗa mului zala ma.<verse eid="1CH 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3"/>Naa ʋoluma Davide vɔnini Soɓa masagi Ɠadadezɛɛl ma Ɠamate ʋele, siɛgi zu é ɠɛni liizu la ga ná-masadai zeiɗa ziɛ wolai Efelate maaʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4"/>Davide kɔɔɠɔ wotolo waagila (1.000) kulani zea, naa ʋɛɛ soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusu waadɔfela (7.000) ʋa, ta siɛ kɔɠɔa zalaʋusu waaʋuufelegɔ (20.000). É wotolo ɓizɛ zoo ungila (100) makɛni. É mɔtaiti kɔɠɔʋolu ɲataiti teʋeni.<verse eid="1CH 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5"/>Siili yooi zu nuiti ti ɠɛni Damase, naati ti ʋaani ɓɔsu Soɓa masagi Ɠadadezɛɛl ʋa. Davide nu waaʋuufelegɔ maazu felegɔ (22.000) ʋaani ti ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6"/>Naa ʋoluma, Davide kundiɠiiti seini Damase yooi zu Siili nuiti saama. Siili nuiti ti ɠoloni Davide ʋɛ, ti ɗa mului zala ma. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni fɔnifaamai veezu Davide ʋɛ, ʋɛ kpein é ɠɛni liizu ná ga kɔɔi. <verse eid="1CH 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7"/>Davide zanu kɔɔɠɔ zɛpɛgiti seɠeni, niiti ti ɠɛni Ɠadadezɛɛl ná-salaʋusuiti zea, é li ga tiye Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CH 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8"/>Davide kɔlu ɓɔi mɔinmɔin seɠeni masagi Ɠadadezɛɛl ná-taa wolaiti su Tiɓate, ta Kun. Suɠoozaai ma, naama ɠɔlu ɓɔigiti ka Salomɔn ti zeɠeni, é ziɛ liɠi wolai ɓɛtɛ la ta kɔlu ɓɔi kpɛdɛgiti, naa ʋɛɛ sɔɔlai mɔtaiti pɛ ba, niiti é ti ɓɛtɛni ga kɔlu ɓɔigi.<verse eid="1CH 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9"/>Siɛgi zu Ɠamate masagi Towu mɛnini da ga Davide vɔnigɛ Soɓa masagi Ɠadadezɛɛl ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ ma, <verse eid="1CH 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10"/>é ná-doun zunui Ɠadolame leʋeni Davide ma ga é tuʋɔ, ta é mama, fala vai zu Ɠadadezɛɛl ʋa, é vɔni ma, tɔɔzei Towu ta Ɠadadezɛɛl ti ɠɛni kɔɔi ɠa nɔ ɠɔ. É sɔɔlai ma zii pɛ teʋeni ɓalaa, niiti ti ɠɛni ga walii, zanugi, ta kɔlu ɓɔigi. <verse eid="1CH 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11"/>Masagi Davide ti veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei é kɛɛni la niina ga walii ta zanugi nii é kulani zɔɔma zii ɠiligiti zea, naati ka ti ga: Edɔme nuiti, Moaɓe nuiti, Amɔn nuiti, Filisiti nuiti, ta Amalɛke nuiti.<verse eid="1CH 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12"/>Seluya ná-doun zunui Aɓisayi vɔnini Edɔme nu waapuugɔ maazu lɔsaʋai (18.000) ma, Kpolo Ʋɛtugi zu. <verse eid="1CH 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13"/>Naa ʋoluma, é kundiɠiiti seini Edɔme yooi zu. Edɔme nuiti pɛ ti ɠoloni Davide ʋɛ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛni fɔnifaamai veezu Davide ʋɛ, ʋɛ kpein é ɠɛni liizu ná ga kɔɔi.<verse eid="1CH 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti daaseigiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:15-18">2 Samiyɛle 8:15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14"/>Davide masadai ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle pɛ unda, é ɠɛni tukpɔi ɠaaleʋezu ga sɔledai ná-nuɓusɛiti pɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15"/>Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi unda, Ayilude ná-doun zunui Zozafate ɠɛ ga laavaawogi, <verse eid="1CH 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16"/>Ayituɓe ná-doun zunui Sadɔke, ta Aɓiataal ná-doun zunui Aɓimelɛke, ti ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, Savɔɠa ɠɛ ga sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui. <verse eid="1CH 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17"/>Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya ɠa é ɠɛni Kelɛte nuiti ta Pelɛte nuiti unda, niiti ti ɠɛni ga masa makɛ nuiti. Davide ná-doun zunuiti ka ti ɠɛni ga ná-seikobaiti.<verse eid="1CH 18:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19"/>
  <para style="s">Amɔn masagi Davide ná-keelaiti unfe fai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-5">2 Samiyɛle 10:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1"/>Naa ʋoluma, Amɔn masagi Naɠase zaani, ná-doun zunui zei potogi zu ga masagi. <verse eid="1CH 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2"/>Davide ɠɛni ma: «Nà wooɠɛɠilada ɠɛɛzu Ɠanun ʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei kɛɛɠɛ Naɠase wooɠɛɠiladai ɠɛni la bɛ̀.» Davide keelai tanigaa leʋeni ga ti ɓena fe bɛ kɛɛɠɛ zaa vai zu. Siɛgi zu Davide ná-botiɠɛ nuiti ti zeelini la Amɔn yooi zu Ɠanun ʋɔ bɛ ga ti ɓena fe bɛ, <verse eid="1CH 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3"/>Amɔn ɠundiɠiiti ti ɠɛni Ɠanun ma: «Ɗa kaazu ga è-ɠɛɛ ná-lɛbiya ɠa é kɛɛzu Davide gaanɛɛnɛ nua leʋesu la è ma ɓaa? Zooi ɠwɛɛ fai ta pɛtɛ fai laade ɓaa, nii a kɛ ti ʋa koloɠolo yeeta?»<verse eid="1CH 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4"/>Ɠanun zɛba é Davide ná-keelaiti so, ti ti-ɓɛlɛiti bo, ti ti ɠɔba zeɠeiti teʋe ga ti-ʋunɔgi letemaʋɛ, naa ʋoluma ti ɓe ti ʋa, <verse eid="1CH 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5"/>ti ɗa li. Davide mɛnini nii kɛai. É keela leʋeni ti luɠɔ, mazɔlɔɔ naati ti wola unfeni. É ɠɛ ti ma: «À yɛ Zeliko eyɛsu wo-ɓɛlɛiti ti lɛ ʋolu, wa ʋa niina.»<verse eid="1CH 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide vɔni fai <optbreak/> Amɔn ta Siili nuiti ma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:6-19">2 Samiyɛle 10:6-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6"/>Amɔn nuiti ti kaani ga ti ɓɔɠɔ wɔinzeɠea Davide ma. Ɠanun ta Amɔn nuiti ti walii kilo waaʋuusaʋagɔ (30.000) teʋeni Siili nuiti ma, niiti ti Mezopotami ʋele, ta Maaka ʋele, naa ʋɛɛ Soɓa ʋele ʋa, nii a kɛ ti soo ɓizɛ zalaʋusuiti seɠe ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7"/>Ʋele ɠana ti kɔɔɠɔ wotolo waaʋuusaʋagɔ maazu felegɔ (32.000) zɔlɔɔni da, naa ʋɛɛ Maaka masagi ʋa ta ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi. Naati ti ʋaa, ti ta-ɠɔɔlaaɠai ʋu Medeɓa ɠobaʋɛ. Amɔn nuiti ma, ti ɠula ta-laa wolaiti su, ti ɠaalɛ ba, ti ʋa kɔɔɠɔ vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8"/>Davide mɛnigai ma, é Zoaɓe leʋeni ti laalɔɠɔma, ta Izilayɛle ɠɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ.<verse eid="1CH 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9"/>Amɔn nuiti ti ɠulani, ti lo kɔɔɠɔ vai ma, ta-laa wolai laaʋɛ. Masagi niiti ti ʋaani ɓɔsu ti ʋa, naati ti ɠɛni loni yɛ kɔɔ lɔɓɔi zu. <verse eid="1CH 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10"/>Zoaɓe kaai ma ga kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ ɠa fele ʋɔɔma, ʋelelaʋɛ ta ʋoluzu ʋelei, é yeeloni kɔɔɠɔ nu ɠɛzɛɠɛzɛgiti ba, é ti ʋilɛ Siili nuiti daawu kɔɔɠɔ vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11"/>É kɔɔʋɛbɛi mɔtai ma lotuɠɔlai ɠalivaani kɛɛɠɛloin Aɓisayi ma, naati ti lo Amɔn nuiti daawu kɔɔɠɔ vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12"/>Zoaɓe ɠɛni kɛɛɠɛloin Aɓisayi ma: «Ni Siili nuiti zeevi ka mɔinna mà, ɗa ʋa è ɓɔ bà. Ni Amɔn nuiti zeevi ka mɔinna è ma, nà ʋa, gè ɓɔ è ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13"/>Zɛbɛzeɠe, ade kɔɔi ɠɔ, de da-nuɓusɛiti maalobo, ta da-ƓALAGI ná-taaiti. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI naa ɠɛ, nii pagai gaazu!»<verse eid="1CH 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14"/>Zoaɓe ta ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛi ti lopele ɓɛtɛni kɔɔɠɔ vai ma, Siili nuiti daalɔɠɔma, naati ti ʋelani ba. <verse eid="1CH 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15"/>Amɔn nuiti ti kaai ma ga Siili nuiti ti ʋela, tiya ɓalaa ti ʋelani Zoaɓe kɛɛɠɛloin Aɓisayi ʋa, ti li ta-laazu. Zoaɓe ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16"/>Siili nuiti ti kaai ma ga Izilayɛle nuiti ti vɔniga ti ma, ti keela leʋeni, ga ti Siili nui zɔiti gaalɛ ba, niiti ti ziɛ wolai Efelate ʋoluʋelei. Ɠadadezɛɛl ná-kɔɔɠuluɓai Sofake loni ti luɠɔ.<verse eid="1CH 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17"/>Davide faa ɠwɛɛgai ma su, é Izilayɛle ɠɔɔɠɔ nuiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba, ti Zuludɛn ɓudɛ, ti li Siili nuiti daalɔɠɔma. Ti ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛni, ti vala naati ba, naati mɔunpa ka ti kɔɔi lɔɔzeini. <verse eid="1CH 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18"/>Kɛlɛ ti ʋelani Izilayɛle nuiti ba. Davide kɔɔɠɔ wotolo waadɔfela (7.000) zu zalaʋusuiti paani, ta siɛ kɔɠɔa zalaʋusu waaʋuunaanigɔ (40.000). É ta-ɠɔɔɠuluɓai Sofake ʋaani ɓalaa. <verse eid="1CH 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19"/>Tɛi masagi niiti kpein ti ɓɔni Ɠadadezɛɛl ʋa, ti kaani ga Izilayɛle ziaa ti wu, ti ziilɛigi ɠaiziɛni Davide ya, ti ɠolo bɛ. Naa ʋoluma Siili nuiti ti la mɔ ɠɛni kɛɛzu, ti ʋa li ɓɔsu Amɔn nuiti ba.<verse eid="1CH 19:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20"/>
  <para style="s">Laɓa zo fai Zoaɓe ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 11:1">2 Samiyɛle 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1"/>Poluma ɠonagi, yeeɠɛɠalai nii masagiti ta ɗa lii la kɔɔɠɔzuʋɛ, Zoaɓe loni kɔɔʋɛbɛ wolaiti tuɠɔ. Ti Amɔn yooi zuɠoloɠoloni, é ta-laa wolai Laɓa zei kɛlɛ su. Kɛlɛ Davide yɛni Zeluzalɛme. Zoaɓe vɔnini Laɓa ma, é ná ɠoloɠolo. <verse eid="1CH 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2"/>Davide masa bɔɔlɔgi zeɠeni nii é ɠɛni ta-masagi unma. Bɔɔlɔgi naa ɠɛni ga zanu tetelegi, buɲɛgi ɠɛni ga kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30), kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ɠila ge ɠɛni ba. Ti dɔɔni Davide unma. É ɠulani taai naa zu ga ani mɔinmɔin, niiti é ti zoni kɔɔi zu. <verse eid="1CH 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3"/>Nuɓusɛi niiti ti ɠɛni zeini ná, é naa tanigaa ɠɛɛni ga sii ziɛ nuiti, kɔtu zaɠa nuiti, gulu ʋɔ nuiti. Ʋele ɠana Davide kɛɛni la ga nuɓusɛiti pɛ niiti ti ɠɛni Amɔn laaiti su. Naa ʋoluma, Davide ta kɔɔʋɛbɛiti pɛ ti ɠaleni ma Zeluzalɛme.<verse eid="1CH 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔi niiti ti ɠɔɔni <optbreak/> Filisiti nuiti daalɔɠɔma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:18-22">2 Samiyɛle 21:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4"/>Kɔɔi taɠili su mɔnɔ Filisiti nuiti daalɔɠɔma Gezɛɛl, Ɠusa nui Siɓekayi Sipayi ʋaani, naa ɓalaa ɠɛni ga Lefa mavofodai ta. Filisiti nuiti gaazu unfe ge zeɠeni naazu. <verse eid="1CH 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5"/>Naa ʋolu kɔɔi taɠili su mɔnɔ Filisiti nuiti daalɔɠɔma, Yayiil ná-doun zunui Ɛlɛɠanan Gate nui Lami ʋaani, Goliate kɛɛɠɛloin, nii ná-kpɛɛin ma wului wɔɔlɔni, eɠɛ seɠe vɛlɛ nui ná-gba gului. <verse eid="1CH 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6"/>Kɔɔi taɠili su mɔnɔ Gate, zunui ta ɠɛni ná, koozaai, zeeɓeɠaiti ta kɔɠɔɓeɠaiti ti ga dɔzitadɔzita, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛ ga puufele maazu naani (24). É ɠɛni ga Lafa mavofodai ta tɔ ɓalaa. <verse eid="1CH 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7"/>É malimasakɛɛi leʋeni ga Izilayɛle nuiti. Davide kɛɛɠɛloin Simeya ná-doun zunui Zonatan paani. <verse eid="1CH 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8"/>Lafa mavofodai niiti ti zɔlɔɔni Gate, ti pɛ ti zaani Davide ta ná-kɔɔɠɔ nuiti zeezu.<verse eid="1CH 20:8"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21"/>
  <para style="s">Davide Izilayɛle nuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Samiyɛle 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1"/>Yeeta Setana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Setana</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «maalɔɔ nui».</char></note> wuzeɠeni Izilayɛle nuiti daalɔɠɔma, é Davide li Izilayɛle nuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2"/>Davide zɛba é ɠɛ Zoaɓe ta kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma ɠundiɠiiti ma: «À Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ, é zo Ɓeel-Seɓa, é li Dan, wo ɠale ma, wo ʋoluvaawo mà, nii a kɛ gè ti-liegɔi ɠwɛɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3"/>Zoaɓe ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛ é ná-nuɓusɛiti mɔin su ga seizu ungila (100) faan! Kɛlɛ, ee, màliɠii masagi, za logi zu ti pɛ ti la ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nuiti ɓaa? Leeni ʋe mu màliɠii masagi pɔ ga é naa ɠɛɠala vai ɠɛ? Lee vaa zu é liizu Izilayɛle ɠɛɛzu ga sɔba nu?»<verse eid="1CH 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4"/>Kɛlɛ masagi la zeɠeni wooi ʋolu, nii é boni Zoaɓe ma. É liini Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ. Naa ʋoluma, é ɠale ma Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CH 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5"/>Zoaɓe daasei sɛʋɛi ma ʋoluvaawogi woni Davide ma: Izilayɛle zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga miliyɔn ɠila nu waaungila (1.100.000), niiti ta zoo liizu kɔɔ ma. Zuda geleiti ti ɠɛni ga zunu waaunnaanigɔ nu waaʋuulɔfela (470.000). <verse eid="1CH 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6"/>Masagi ná-devei naa wana ʋelei ma Zoaɓe ma, é la ɠɛni vɔlɔ Levi ta Ɓɛnzamɛn wolodamaiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛni zɔiti saama.<verse eid="1CH 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7"/>Naama laasei sɛʋɛ vai ɠɛni ga faa ɲɔu GALA gaazu, é ɠaaʋote Izilayɛle laalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="1CH 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8"/>Davide ɠɛni GALAGI ma: «Gè faaɠaaza gola ɠɛa ga nii ɠɛɛ vai! Naa ɠa é ba, sùvaayɛ ga nà-faa ɲɔi kae, nɛ̀i gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ nui, mazɔlɔɔ gè kwɛni ga gè nii ɠɛɛʋɛ eɠɛ ɠimalala nu.»<verse eid="1CH 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Gade ʋɔ, nii é ɠɛni Davide ɠoba, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="1CH 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10"/>«Li, è ɠɛ Davide ma: ‹Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: Nà faa saʋagɔi niiti gila seizu è ma, yiimazeɠe ga gila, gè sei è ma.› » <verse eid="1CH 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11"/>Gade liini Davide ʋɔ bɛ, é ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠaa: ‹Yiimazeɠe niima vaa saʋagɔiti su: <verse eid="1CH 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12"/>Ɗa-yooi kɛ pului zu ga kona saʋagɔ, ɓaa è loo bu alu saʋagɔ laawu, è ɗa ɓizɛ è zili nuiti ba, ti wuzeɠezu è laalɔɠɔma. Ni naa laade, folo saʋagɔ laawu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɗa-yooi loɠa ga ɗɔfɔi, naama volo saʋagɔiti daawu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛ Izilayɛle yooi zu ná pɛ.› Yiimazeɠe, è naa wo mà, nii nà li, gè bo tèʋe nui ma.» <verse eid="1CH 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13"/>Davide Gade wooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ziiɓɔlɔ wolai ɠa gè su! Ee, ɓɛ ʋɛ gè loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeezu, mazɔlɔɔ ná-gaazumaawɔinɠai zuwɔɔlɔʋɛ, kɛlɛ gè mina loo nuiti zeezu!»<verse eid="1CH 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɗɔfɔ zeeɓɛi leʋeni Izilayɛle yooi zu, é zunu waaʋuulɔfela (70.000) ʋaa. <verse eid="1CH 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI geezuɠeelai ta leʋeni ga é Zeluzalɛme ɠoloɠolo, kɛlɛ tɛi naa ɠɛni taai ɠoloɠolosu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wɛlɛni, naama vaa ɲɔi wɔinzeɠe ma, é zɛ ná. É ɠɛni geezuɠeelai ma, nii é ɠɛni faa zuɠoloɠologi ɠɛɛzu: «Yeei lɛɛna ba, naa kula ɠɛa su.» Geezuɠeelai ɠɛni niina Yeɓuse nui Wɔɔlenan ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ ɠobaʋɛ.<verse eid="1CH 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16"/>Davide Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠaani, é zɛlɛ zooiti zɔɠɔzuʋɛ ta geeɠɔlɔgi, ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi ɠulaai maalaɠagi zu, maalegai Zeluzalɛme ma. Gaamago Davide ʋɛɛ kundiɠiiti ba, ti ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilini ga saa wɔlɔ wo seɠei, ti laaʋɛ zooi ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17"/>Davide GALA falini ɠani, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ɠa gè devei veai ga ti nuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ, nà ɠa gè kotoi ɠɛai, nà ɠa gè faaɠaaza golaiti kɛai. Kɛlɛ nuɓusɛi niiti, leeni ɠa ti kɛa? Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, nà-GALAGI, dòɠa mu, nà ɠila, nà-o, nà-pɛlɛyeɠei-yo, kɛlɛ soma kae ɗɔfɔi nii ɓe yeizu ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ma!»<verse eid="1CH 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠɛni Gade ma: «Bo Davide ma, é lɛ Yeɓuse nui Wɔɔlenan ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ, é zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ ná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.» <verse eid="1CH 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19"/>Davide liini ná, eɠɛʋelei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI valini la Gade ma, ga é bo ma. <verse eid="1CH 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20"/>Wɔɔlenan ɠɛni moloi loɠazu, é latini, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ɠa. Ná-doun zunu naanigɔiti ti ɠɛni koba, naati ti lɔɔɠuni. <verse eid="1CH 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21"/>Davide maaɓuɠaai ma ba, Wɔɔlenan ɠaazuwuzeɠeni, é Davide ɠa. É ɠulani molo loɠazuʋɛ, é la Davide ɠɔɠɔwu. <verse eid="1CH 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22"/>Davide ɠɛ Wɔɔlenan ma: «Molo loɠazuʋɛ tɛi fe zèa, gè geya è ma, gè zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛ ná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Soma kae è ná ve zèa, gè geya ga sɔngɔ ɠiteɠitegi, nii a kɛ ɗɔfɔi nii maaɠooza nuɓusɛiti ba.»<verse eid="1CH 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23"/>Wɔɔlenan ɠɛni Davide ma: «Màliɠii masagi, molo loɠazuʋɛ zeɠe. Nii è pɔ è kɛ, è naa ɠɛ. Nikɛiti ɓalaa kaa, naati ta ɠɛ ga gala zalaɠai, kaʋa loɠa wulu zɛpɛgi ma wuluiti ta ɠɛ ga koʋii, naa ʋoluma moloi ɠa ɠɛ ga vebɛ zalaɠai. Gè ti pɛ fea è ya.»<verse eid="1CH 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24"/>Kɛlɛ masagi Davide ɠɛni Wɔɔlenan ma: «Ɓa-o, nà geyazu è ma ga sɔngɔi ɠiteɠitegi. Gè la ani nɔpɛ fea Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ya nii é ga ɗɔnɔ, gè ʋa kula ga gala zalaɠai bɛ, tama ge la ani nɔpɛ dɔɔni polu.» <verse eid="1CH 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25"/>Davide zanu kae undɔzita (600) veeni Wɔɔlenan ya ga zou zɔngɔi. <verse eid="1CH 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26"/>É zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni miná Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, é gala zalaɠaiti ta ziilɛi zalaɠaiti kula. É wooɠulani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, naama ge gooɠaaʋote ga abui zeɠe geeɠɔlɔgi zu, é zo zalaɠai ʋa, nii é ɠɛni gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27"/>Naa ʋoluma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI devei veeni geezuɠeelai ya ga naa ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi lɔ ma laɠagi zu.<verse eid="1CH 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28"/>Naama ziɛgi zu, tɛi Davide kaani ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI gooɠaaʋoteni Yeɓuse nui Wɔɔlenan ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ, é tɔɔzeini ga é ɗa zalaɠaiti kula miná. <verse eid="1CH 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai, nii Moize kpɛtɛni teʋebai zu, ta gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ, naati ti ɠɛni zalaɠa ɠula adaʋɛ ma Gaɓaɠɔn. <verse eid="1CH 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30"/>Kɛlɛ Davide la ɠɛni zoosu é ʋa li, é ʋa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazaɠa, tɔɔzei gola zu luani ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-geezuɠeelai ná-boɠa zɔkpɔi.<verse eid="1CH 21:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1"/>Davide ɠɛni ma: «Ʋɛ ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi losu ná, ʋɛ ɠa ná ɠɛɛzu ga Izilayɛle ná-gala zalaɠaiti kulazuʋɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2"/>É devei veeni ga ti wɛɛinti pɛ gaalɛ ba, niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Izilayɛle yooi zu, é naati kakala laani ga ti kɔtui ɠula, ti saɠa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu. <verse eid="1CH 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3"/>Davide kɔlu mɔinmɔin kɛʋele ɓɛtɛni ɓalaa kpogiti kpadɔ vai zu, ta kalagiti, é kɔlu ɓɔigi ma mɔinmɔin gaalɛɛni ba ɓalaa, nii nu la ɓena zoo gaalusu, <verse eid="1CH 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4"/>naa ʋɛɛ sɛdele gulu mɔinmɔingi ʋa, nii Sidɔn nuiti ta Tiil nuiti ti ɠɛni feezu. <verse eid="1CH 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5"/>É ɠisiɛni, é ɠɛ ma: «Dòun zunui Salomɔn ɠa ga zunu loungo, nii é la dɛ faa mɔinmɔin kwɛɛ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi niima maanɛai ga é lo, kɛni tɔɠɔi ɠula zooi pɛ su, tɔɔzei bɔɔlɔ ʋelei ʋa, ta gola ʋa pelei ʋa. Naa ɠa é ba, nà kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi lɔɔzeizu bɛ.» Ʋele ɠana Davide pɛlɛ lo sɔɔlai ma mɔinmɔin gaalɛɛni la ba, é ʋa ʋɛ zaazu.<verse eid="1CH 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6"/>Naa ʋoluma é ná-doin Salomɔn lolini, é devei ve naa ya ga naa GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI. <verse eid="1CH 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7"/>É ɠɛni naa ma: «Dòun zunu, wɔin ɠɛa mà ga nà ɓɔɠɔi gè GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo nà-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ dɛbi vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8"/>Kɛlɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni pɔ̀, é ɠɛ mà: ‹È ɲamai wola ʋuuʋɛ, è kɔɔ wolaiti kɔɔʋɛ. Ɲama mɔinmɔingi nii è pua gàazu zooi ma naa maaʋele ma, ɗa laade è ʋa ɠɛ pɛlɛi losu bɛ̀ dɛ̀bi vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9"/>Kɛlɛ doun zunu ɠa zɔlɔɔsu è ʋɛ, nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu ga ziilɛi nu. Nà ziilɛigi ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛ ti yɔɠɔzu ta sili nuiti pɛ, niiti ti maaɠoolii zu. Daaseigi ɠa ɠɛɛzu ga Salomɔn (nii poluʋɛ ga «ziilɛi nui»). Sii ma voloi pɛ su, nà ziilɛigi ta dooɠogi ve Izilayɛle ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10"/>Tɔ ɠa é ʋaazu pɛlɛi losu bɛ̀, toɠa ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga dòun zunui, gè ɠɛ bɛ ga kɛɛɠɛ. Nà ná-masadai makɛ kpaan Izilayɛle unda, é la ɲiikpiga pɛ.› »<verse eid="1CH 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11"/>Davide ɠɛni ma ʋolu: «Dòun zunu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛ è ʋa, nii a kɛ è zoo è GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo ɗa-ƓALAGI ʋɛ, nii é ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, eɠɛʋelei tɔ ɓɔɠɔi é bogai la é ʋilɛ è ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI soma kae siɛgi zu é è zeizu la Izilayɛle unda, é ɠimalai ta keleɠelegi ve è ʋɛ, nii a kɛ è ɠolo ná-tɔgi ʋɛ, tɛigi é ga ɗa-ƓALAGI. <verse eid="1CH 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13"/>Ɗa ʋaazu liizu luɠɔ, ni ɗa ɠaaɓaana kele è ɠolo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALA ná-deveiti ta ná-tɔgiti bɛ, niiti é ti veeni Moize ya Izilayɛle ʋɛ. Yiilɔɔ, è zɛbɛzeɠe, mina lua, è zasu mina ɓali pa. <verse eid="1CH 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14"/>Wɛlɛ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu, gè ɠaaɓaaʋɛ kele gè kilo miliyɔn saʋagɔ (3.000.000) ɠaalɛ ba zanugi zu, naa ʋɛɛ kilo miliyɔn ʋuusaʋagɔ (30.000.000) ʋa walii zu, ta kɔlu ɓɔigi, naa ʋɛɛ kɔlu ɠitei ʋa, niiti nu la zooga ti ɠaalusu. Gè gului ta kɔtui ɓalaa kɛʋele ɓɛtɛʋɛ, ɗa ta ɓɔ niina naati ba ʋolu. <verse eid="1CH 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15"/>Ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛ nu mɔinmɔin ka è ɠoba, kɔtu zaɠa nuiti, gului ta kɔtui maaʋɔnɛ nuiti, ta kala nu wolaiti botii pɛ su. <verse eid="1CH 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16"/>Zanugi, walii, kɔlu ɓɔigi, kɔlu ɠitei, naati ta è ya gaalu ge la ba. Tɔ ɠa é ba botii lɔɔzeina, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yɛ è ʋa kae!»<verse eid="1CH 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17"/>Naa ʋoluma Davide boni Izilayɛle lotuɠɔiti pɛ ma ga ti yeeve ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18"/>É ɠɛni ti ma: «Wa-ƓALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa wo ʋa. É dooɠogi vea wo ya wa-you ɠwɛmaʋɛti pɛ, mazɔlɔɔ é zooi zu nuɓusɛ wɔlɔmaiti dɔa nà-zobogi wu. Pɛtɛ naati ta niina Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ta ná-nuɓusɛiti ta-zobogi wu. <verse eid="1CH 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19"/>Naa ɠa é ba, à ɠili Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa ga wo-yii pɛ ta wo-yɛnvui pɛ. À botii lɔɔzeina, wo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zeizu ɲadegai lo, nii a kɛ wo ʋa ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui ta ani niiti kpein ti veai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, wo ti la pɛlɛi naa wu, nii togai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 22:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23"/>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti gaalu fai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1"/>Siɛgi zu Davide wola wɔlɔzaɠani da, sii ma voloi wola mɔinɗai, é ná-doun zunui Salomɔn zeɠeni, é sei Izilayɛle unda ga masagi.<verse eid="1CH 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2"/>É Izilayɛle lotuɠɔiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti, naa ʋɛɛ Levi nuiti ba. <verse eid="1CH 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3"/>Naama ziɛgi zu é Levi nuiti gaaluni, niiti ta-ɠonagi zeeliai na puusaʋagɔ (30) zu, ti ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuusaʋa maazu lɔsaʋa (38.000). <verse eid="1CH 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4"/>Ti zaama, masagi Davide yeeloni nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ʋa ga ti lo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ma wotiiti tuɠɔ. É yeelo nu waadɔzita (6.000) ʋa, naati ti ɠɛ ga kundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5"/>É yeelo nu waanaanigɔ (4.000) ʋa, naati ti ɠɛ ga siɠida makɛ nuiti, é nu waanaanigɔi (4.000) zɔiti kɛ ga guye loo nuiti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ vai zu ga gɛingɛin ganigiti niiti é ti ɓɛtɛni naama vai ma.<verse eid="1CH 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6"/>Davide Levi nuiti gaaɠwɛɛni su ga saʋagɔ, ʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti seiɗai la kpasu Levi ná-doun saʋagɔiti ba: Gɛɛlɛson, Keɠate, ta Melali.<verse eid="1CH 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7"/>Doun zunu felegɔ ɠa Gɛɛlɛson sɔlɔɔni: Layedan ta Simeyi. <verse eid="1CH 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8"/>Layedan doun zunu saʋagɔ zɔlɔɔni: Ma mɔungi ɠɛni ga Yeɠiyɛle, naa ʋolu Zetame ta Zowɛle. <verse eid="1CH 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9"/>Simeyi ɓalaa doun zunu saʋagɔ zɔlɔɔni: Selomite, Ɠaziyɛle ta Ɠalan. Pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti kana, niiti ti ɠulaai Layedan vofodai zu. <verse eid="1CH 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10"/>Simeyi zunu loun naanigɔ ɠiligaa zɔlɔɔni: Yaɠate, Zina, Yeyuse ta Ɓelia. <verse eid="1CH 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11"/>Yaɠate ɠa é ɠɛni ga doun mɔungi, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Ziza. Yeyuse ta Ɓelia ti la ɠɛni doun mɔinmɔin sɔlɔɔni, naa ɠa é kɛɛni ti ti felegɔ ɓɔni su, ti kɛ ga pɛlɛyeɠe ɠila gaalu bo siɛgi zu.<verse eid="1CH 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12"/>Doun naanigɔ ɠa Keɠate sɔlɔɔni: Amalame, Yiseɠaal, Eɓelɔn, ta Uziyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13"/>Amalame ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Aalɔn, ta Moize. Zeelogi woni Aalɔn ta mavofodaiti ba ɠɔoɠɔ faa ma ga ti ɗa botii ɠɛ yeenɔpɛ ada ɲadega wolai, nii a kɛ ti ɗa ansansegiti gala Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ti botii ɠɛ bɛ, ta ti ɗa tuyai loo daaseigi zu ɠɔ.<verse eid="1CH 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14"/>GALA botiɠɛ nui Moize mavofodaiti gaaluni Levi wolodamaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15"/>Moize ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Gɛɛlɛsome, ta Eliyezɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16"/>Gɛɛlɛsome ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga kundiɠii Seɓuwɛle. <verse eid="1CH 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17"/>Doun zunu ɠila nɔ ɠa Eliyezɛɛl sɔlɔɔni, kundiɠii nii daaseigi ɠɛni ga Leyaɓia. Kɛlɛ Leyaɓia mavofodaiti ti wola mɔinni. <verse eid="1CH 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18"/>Yiseɠaal ná-doun zunui ɠɛni ga kundiɠii Selomite. <verse eid="1CH 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19"/>Eɓelɔn ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Doun mɔungi ɠɛni ga Yeliya, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Amalia, saʋasiɛi ɠɛ ga Yaɠaziyɛle, naanisiɛi ɠɛ ga Yekameyame. <verse eid="1CH 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20"/>Uziyɛle ná-doun zunu mɔungi ɠɛni ga Misé, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Yisiya.<verse eid="1CH 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21"/>Melali ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Maali ta Musi. Maali ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga Eleazaal ta Kise. <verse eid="1CH 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22"/>Eleazaal zaani, é la doun zunu zɔlɔɔni, anzanu lointi nɔ ɠa é ti zɔlɔɔni. Naati ti zeini Kise ná-doun zunuiti bɛ, ta niiti ti ɠɛni ga bolodamaiti. <verse eid="1CH 23:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23"/>Zunu loun saʋagɔ ɠa Musi sɔlɔɔni: Maali, Edɛɛl ta Yelemɔte.<verse eid="1CH 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24"/>Levi mavofodaiti kana, ʋelei ti zeiɗai la su kpɛkpɛ ga pɛlɛyeɠe ʋelei, pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti ɓalaa kana ti laaseigiti sɛʋɛai ga gilagila daasei sɛʋɛ ziɛgi zu, ti ɠɛni lɔɔzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu wotii zu, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. <verse eid="1CH 23:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25"/>Tɔɔzei Davide ɠɛni ma: «Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI dooɠogi vea ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ, é zeizuʋɛ ɠɛa ga Zeluzalɛme eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26"/>Levi nuiti ti la mɔ seɠe ʋɛlɛ ɲadegai zeɠea, ti ʋa ɗa leʋe da, ta bu zɔɔlaiti pɛ.»<verse eid="1CH 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27"/>Davide ná-deve ɠaaɓelagi ɠa é kɛɛni ti Levi nuiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛni gaalu sɛʋɛi zu, é zo kona ʋuufelegɔ (20) ma, é lɛ zeemaazu. <verse eid="1CH 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28"/>Ta-wotii ɠɛni ga ti ɗa ɓɔ Aalɔn mavofodaiti ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu ma ɠoizuʋɛ ma, ta pɛɛ ba ʋɛlɛ goiti, ti ɗa aniiti maaɲade niiti ti veai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotii pɛ. <verse eid="1CH 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29"/>Ti ɗa ɓuluiti kpɛtɛ, niiti ti veai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ti ɓulu vukɔi ɓɛtɛ vebɛ zalaɠaiti kula vai zu, ti ɓulu lɛɛvɛiti kpɛtɛ, nii lɛʋɛ la su, ti vebɛ zalaɠaiti kpɛtɛ niiti ti mɔsu, ta niiti ti ɠaayɔgai ga gulɔi, ta ani ɠɔɠɔ ganii ma zii pɛ. <verse eid="1CH 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30"/>Naa ʋoluma, tanigaa ti maanɛɛni ga folo-o-folo ti ɗa li sobu ɠilagila ta kpɔkɔ ɠilagila, ti ɗa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ, ti dɛbi. <verse eid="1CH 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31"/>Ti ɗa gala zalaɠaiti kula Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, dooɠo foloiti, alu toga niinɛi ma vɛtiiti ma, ta gaalɛbaiti su, é zoloo naa liegɔi ma nii ma levei zɛʋɛni, é ve ti ya. <verse eid="1CH 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32"/>Ti maanɛɛni ga ti ɗa wɛlɛ GALA daaɠomi seɠe ʋɛlɛi ma ta seizu ɲadegai, ti ɓɔ ti-ɠɛɛlointi Aalɔn mavofodaiti ba Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu wotii pɛ su.<verse eid="1CH 23:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24"/>
  <para style="s">Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti <optbreak/> ta-ɓɔgiti gaaɠwɛ ʋeleiti su</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1"/>Aalɔn mavofodaiti gaaɠwɛɛni su ga Aalɔn ná-doun zunuiti tiegɔi: Nadaɓe, Aɓiyu, Eleazaal, ta Itamaal. <verse eid="1CH 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2"/>Nadaɓe ta Aɓiyu ti zaani ti-ɠɛɛ luɠɔ, ti la doun yɛni ga ʋoluʋelei. Eleazaal ta Itamaal ti zalaɠa ɠula wotii ɠɛɛni. <verse eid="1CH 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3"/>Suɠoozaai ma, Sadɔke nii é ɠɛni ga Eleazaal ná-dounloin ta, ta Ayimelɛke nii é ɠɛni ga Itamaal ná-dounloin ta, ti ɓɔni Davide ʋa, ti Aalɔn mavofodaiti gaaɠwɛsu kpɔgi gilagilagiti su, é zoloo botiiti ma niiti é veeni ti ya. <verse eid="1CH 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4"/>É ʋɛtɛni ga totuɠɔi mɔinni Eleazaal mavofodaiti saama, é leʋe Itamaal nɔnɔiti ba. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni Eleazaal mavofodaiti gaaɠwɛɛni su ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔ puugɔ maazu lɔzita (16), Itamaal nɔnɔiti gaaɠwɛsu ga pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔ lɔsaʋa. <verse eid="1CH 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5"/>Ti ɠaaɠwɛɛni su ga kpakutoomai, tɔɔzei seizu ɲadegai ma lotuɠɔi tanigaa ta GALA botii ma lotuɠɔi tanigaa ti ɠɛni Eleazaal mavofodaiti saama, ta ɠɛ Itamaal mavofodaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6"/>Sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui Semaya, Netaneyɛle ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni ga Levi mavofodai ta, naa ti-laaseigiti sɛʋɛni masagi ɠaazu, ta totuɠɔiti, naa ʋɛɛ zalaɠa ɠula nui Sadɔke, ta Aɓiataal ná-doun zunui Ayimelɛke ʋa, ta zalaɠa ɠula nui naa ʋɛɛ Levi nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti ba. Ti ɠɛni kɛɛzu ga seɠezeɠedai, ta la pɛlɛyeɠe ɠila seɠena Eleazaal nɔnɔiti saama, ti gila seɠe Itamaal nɔnɔiti saama.<verse eid="1CH 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti kaa, niiti zeelobai woni ga tiye ga seɠezeɠedai ga kpakutoomai: Ma mɔungi, Yeɠoyaliɓe. Felesiɛi, Yedaya. <verse eid="1CH 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8"/>Saʋasiɛi, Ɠalime. Naanisiɛi, Seyolime. <verse eid="1CH 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9"/>Dɔɔlusiɛi, Malikiya. Dɔzitasiɛi, Miyamine. <verse eid="1CH 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10"/>Dɔfelasiɛi, Akɔse. Dɔsaʋasiɛi, Aɓiya. <verse eid="1CH 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11"/>Taaʋuusiɛi, Zozuwe. Puusiɛi, Sekania. <verse eid="1CH 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12"/>Puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11), Eliasiɓe. Puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), Yakime. <verse eid="1CH 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13"/>Puugɔ maazu zaʋasiɛi (13), Ɠupa. Puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14), Yeseɓeyaɓe. <verse eid="1CH 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15), Ɓiliga. Puugɔ maazu lɔzitasiɛi (16), Imɛɛl. <verse eid="1CH 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔfelasiɛi (17), Eziil. Puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋasiɛi (18), Apisɛse. <verse eid="1CH 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16"/>Puugɔ maazu taaʋuusiɛi (19), Petayia. Puufelesiɛi (20), Ezekiyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17"/>Puufele maazu ɠilasiɛi (21), Yakin. Puufele maazu velesiɛi (22), Gamule. <verse eid="1CH 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18"/>Puufele maazu zaʋasiɛi (23), Delaya. Puufele maazu naanisiɛi (24), Maaziya. <verse eid="1CH 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19"/>Ʋele ɠana ti ɠaaɠwɛɛni la su, ga ti ɗa lɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti ɠɛni ta-wotiiti kɛɛzu, é zoloo devei naa ma nii Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feeni ti-mɛmɛwola Aalɔn ya, é daazeeli ti ma.<verse eid="1CH 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi mavofodai zɔiti daaseigiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20"/>Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠii zɔiti daaseigiti kaa: Suɓayɛle, Amalame mavofodaiti saama, Yedeya, Suɓayɛle nɔnɔiti saama, <verse eid="1CH 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21"/>Kundiɠii Yisiya, Leyaɓia mavofodaiti saama, <verse eid="1CH 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22"/>Selomɔte, Yiseɠaal mavofodaiti saama, Yaɠate, Selomɔte mavofodaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 24:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23"/>Eɓelɔn ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Ma mɔungi ɠɛni ga Yeliya, felesiɛi ɠɛ ga Amalia, saʋasiɛi ɠɛ ga Yaɠaziyɛle, naanisiɛi ɠa ga Yekameyame. <verse eid="1CH 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24"/>Samiil, Uziyɛle ná-doun zunui Misé mavofodaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25"/>Zakali, Misé kɛɛɠɛloin Yisiya mavofodaiti saama. <verse eid="1CH 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26"/>Melali ná-doun zunuiti kaa: Maali ta Musi, naa ʋɛɛ ná-doun zunui Yaziya nɔnɔ ma lointi ba. <verse eid="1CH 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27"/>Melali mavofodaiti kaa, ná-doun zunui Yaziya ma ʋele ma: Soɠame ta Zakuul naa ʋɛɛ Iɓili ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28"/>Maali mavofodaiti saama, Eleazaal, nii é la ɠɛni doun zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 24:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29"/>Kise ná-doun zunui Yelameyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30"/>Musi ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Maali, Edɛɛl ta Yelimɔte. Levi mavofodaiti kana, ʋelei ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ti zeini la su kpɛkpɛ. <verse eid="1CH 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31"/>Tiya ɓalaa ʋelei nɔ ti-ɠɛɛlointi ti kɛɛni la Aalɔn mavofodaiti, ti ta-wotii zeini su ga kpakutoomai, masagi Davide ɠaazu, ta Sadɔke, naa ʋɛɛ Ayimelɛke ʋa, ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti, ta Levi ʋɛlɛyeɠe ɠundiɠiiti. Ʋelei nɔ ɓakologi ná-pɛlɛyeɠei zosu da, ʋele nɔ ɠana loungoi nɔnɔ ma ʋɛlɛyeɠei zosu la.<verse eid="1CH 24:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25"/>
  <para style="s">Guye loo nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1"/>Davide ɓɔga kundiɠiiti niiti ti GALA dɛbi vai unda, ti yeeloni Azafe mavofodai tanigaa ʋa, naa ʋɛɛ Ɠeman mavofodai tanigaa, ta Yedutun mavofodai tanigaa ʋa, niiti ti ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu guyei zu, ti ɗa kɔnigi, papai ta kɔtɛgiti gɛin guyei wu. Nui niiti ti ti ʋilɛni naama wotii laawu, ti-laaseigiti kaa: <verse eid="1CH 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2"/>Azafe ná-doun zunuiti saama: Zakuul, Zozɛfe, Netania ta Azaleyɛla, naati ta-lotuɠɔi ɠɛni ga ti-ɠɛɛ, nii masagi ɠɛni losu tuɠɔ, é ɗa GALA gooi wo guyeiti su. <verse eid="1CH 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3"/>Yedutun nɔnɔ ma lointi ti ɠɛni ga nu lɔzita: Gedaliya, Seli, Ezayi, Simeyi, Ɠasaɓiya ta Matitia, ti-ɠɛɛ ɠɛni losu ti luɠɔ, nii é ɠɛni GALA gooi wosu guyeiti su, é ɗa kɔnigi ɠɛin bu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI maamusɛ vai ma. <verse eid="1CH 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4"/>Ɠeman mavofodaiti su: Ɓukiya, Matania, Uziyɛle, Seɓuwɛle, Yelimɔte, Ɠanania, Ɠanani, Eliyata, Gidalati, Lomameti-Ezɛɛl, Yoseɓekasa, Maloti, Wotiil, Maɠaziɔte. <verse eid="1CH 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5"/>Niiti pɛ ti ɠɛni ga Ɠeman ná-doun zunuiti, nii é ɠɛni ga masagi ná-GALA goo wo nui, GALA ge ɠɛni ɓɔɛzu pɔ, nii a kɛ é naa maamusɛ ná-zobogi vaa zu. É ɠula doun zunu puugɔ maazu naanigɔiti (14) polu, GALA ge doun anzanu saʋagɔ veeni Ɠeman ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6"/>Ti-ɠɛɛni ti ɓena lo ti pɛ ti luɠɔ, ti ɗa guyei loo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, ga kɔtɛgi, kɔnigi ta papai, ʋele ɠana ti ɠɛni ta-wotii ɠɛɛzu la GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. Azafe ʋe, Yedutun ʋe ta Ɠeman ti ɠɛni masagi ná-devei wu. <verse eid="1CH 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7"/>Levi nui niiti ti kalagi woni, ti ɠɛ ga kalamɔinti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI lɛbi vai zu ga guyei, ti ɠɛni ga nu unfelegɔ puulɔsaʋa maazu lɔsaʋa (288). <verse eid="1CH 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8"/>Ta-wotii zeini kpasu ga kpakutoomai, zeelɔzɔɠɔzu la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti zɔɠɔzu, ɓaa kalamɔinti ta kaladopoiti zɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="1CH 25:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9"/>Kpakutooma mɔungi nii é zɔɠɔni Azafe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ma, naa looni Zozɛfe ma, felesiɛi loo Gedaliya ma ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10"/>Saʋasiɛi, Zakuul, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11"/>Naanisiɛi, Yiseli, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12"/>Dɔɔlusiɛi, Netania, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13"/>Dɔzitasiɛi, Ɓukiya, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14"/>Dɔfelasiɛi, Yesaleyɛla, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15"/>Dɔsaʋasiɛi, Yesaya, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16"/>Taaʋuusiɛi, Matania, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17"/>Puusiɛi, Simeyi, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18"/>Puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11), Azalɛle, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19"/>Puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12), Ɠasaɓiya, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20"/>Puugɔ maazu zaʋasiɛi (13), Suɓayɛle, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21"/>Puugɔ maazu naanisiɛi (14), Matitia, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔɔlusiɛi (15), Yelemɔte, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔzitasiɛi (16), Ɠanania, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔfelasiɛi (17), Yoseɓekasa, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25"/>Puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋasiɛi (18), Ɠanani, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26"/>Puugɔ maazu taaʋuusiɛi (19), Maloti, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27"/>Puufelesiɛi (20), Eliyata, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28"/>Puufele maazu ɠilasiɛi (21), Wotiil, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29"/>Puufele maazu velesiɛi (22), Gidalati, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12). <verse eid="1CH 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30"/>Puufele maazu zaʋasiɛi (23), Maɠaziɔte, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12) <verse eid="1CH 25:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31"/>Puufele maazu naanisiɛi (24), Lomameti-Ezɛɛl, ta ná-doun zunuiti, naa ʋɛɛ kɛɛɠɛlointi ba, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu felegɔ (12).<verse eid="1CH 25:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26"/>
  <para style="s">Siɠida makɛ nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1"/>Wɛlɛ ʋele ɠa siɠida makɛ nuiti ti zeini la kpasu. Kolé mavofodaiti saama, niiti ti ɠɛni ná, tiya ɠaa: Kolé ná-doun zunui Meselemiya, Azafe ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nu ɠɛni ga naa. <verse eid="1CH 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2"/>Ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti eɠɛʋelei ti zɔlɔɔ pelei la: Zakali, Yediayɛle, Zeɓadia, <verse eid="1CH 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3"/>Yateniyɛle, Elame, Yoɠanan ta Eliyɔyenayi. <verse eid="1CH 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4"/>Woɓɛde-Edɔme ná-doun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga niiti eɠɛʋelei ti zɔlɔɔ pelei la: Semaya, Yeɠozaɓade, Yoa, Sakaal, Netaneyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5"/>Amiyɛle, Isakaal ta Pewuletayi, ti pɛ kpɔga ɠɛni ga nu lɔsaʋa, tɔɔzei GALA ge tuya looni bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6"/>Ná-doun zunui Semaya doun zunua zɔlɔɔni, niiti ti ɠɛni ga zobobɛ nuiti ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti bu, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni ga sɔɓelama nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7"/>Naama loun zunuiti ti ɠɛni ga: Wɔteni, Lefayɛle, Woɓɛde, Ɛlɛzaɓade, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga ti-ɠɛɛlointi Eliyu ta Samakia niiti ti ɠɛɛni ga soofaala nu ɠiteɠitegiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8"/>Woɓɛde-Edɔme mavofodaiti kana. Tiya-o, ti-lointi-yo, naa ʋɛɛ ta-wolodamaiti ba, ti ɠɛni ga nu ʋuulɔzita maazu felegɔ (62), ti pɛ ti ga sɔɓelama nuiti, niiti ti ɠɛni ta-wotiiti kɛɛzu ga zɛbɛi.<verse eid="1CH 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9"/>Meselemiya nɔnɔ ma ɓɔgi zu, ná-doun zunuiti ta kɛɛɠɛlointi ka ti ɠɛni su, ti nu puugɔ maazu lɔsaʋa (18), ti ɠɛni ga sɔɓelama nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10"/>Melali mavofodai Woza doun zunuiti sɔlɔɔni. Simili ɠa é ɠɛni ga totuɠɔi, anɛɛ ni tɔ lɛi é ʋa ɠɛni ga doun mɔungi, kɛɛɠɛ seini ga totuɠɔi. <verse eid="1CH 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11"/>Naa ʋolu, felesiɛi ɠɛni ga Yilikiya, saʋasiɛi Teɓaliya, naanisiɛi Zakali. Woza ná-bolodamai zu nuiti ti ɠɛni ga nu puugɔ maazu saʋagɔ (13).<verse eid="1CH 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti ta-ɓɔgi naati pɛɛ, naa ʋɛɛ totuɠɔiti ba, ta ti-ɠɛɛlointi pɛ, ti ɠɛni ta-wotii ɠɛɛzu Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="1CH 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13"/>Ti kpakutoomai ɠɛɛni ga ti siɠidaʋɛti gaaɠwɛ pɛlɛyeɠe ɓɔgiti ba, zeelɔzɔɠɔzu la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni ɓolomadɔɠɔiti ta seizumaanɛgiti zɔɠɔzu.<verse eid="1CH 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14"/>Kpakutoomai maaʋele ma, Selemiya ɠa é folo ɠulazu ʋele ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ zɔlɔɔni. Ná-doun zunui Zakali, nii é ɠɛni ga tɛnɛbo nu wola ɠigi ma, kpakutoomai maaʋele ma, naa lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋele ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ zɔlɔɔni. <verse eid="1CH 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15"/>Lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋele ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ veeni Woɓɛde-Edɔme ya, kasɔ ʋuu ʋɛlɛiti ti ve ná-doun zunuiti zea. <verse eid="1CH 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16"/>Supime ta Woza, naati ka folo liizu ʋele ziɠidaʋɛ veeni ti ya, naa ʋɛɛ siɠidaʋɛ ʋa, ná laaseigi ga Salekɛte, nii daalaosu ga pelei zu ʋele nii é lɛɛzu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:16">Wɛlɛ, ʋele ɠaa botiiti gaaɠwɛɛni la ga ti ɠaaɠooza ʋelei: <verse eid="1CH 26:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17"/>Folo ɠulazu ʋele ʋɛlɛlaʋɛ, Levi nu lɔzita foloi ma, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu ɠɔʋɛzu ʋelei, nu naanigɔ foloi ma, lɛkpɛmaʋɛ nu yeezazu ʋelei, nu naanigɔ foloi ma, nu velefelegi zeizu felegɔ kasɔ ʋuuzu felegɔiti faa ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18"/>Pɛɛbai ʋɔ pelei, folo liizu ʋelei, nu naanigɔ ɠa é ɠɛni nu lɛɛzuʋɛ makɛsu, nu felegɔ ɗa pɛɛbaiti makɛ. <verse eid="1CH 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19"/>Siɠida makɛ nuiti ta-ɓɔgiti kaa, niiti ti laaseigiti ti zɛʋɛni, ti ga Kolé ta Melali ti-mavofodaiti.<verse eid="1CH 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Levi nuiti ta-woti ɓiigi tanigaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20"/>Levi nui tanigaa ʋelei Ayiya la, é ɠɛni ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛ wu naavolo makɛ nui, ta sɔɔlaiti pɛ makɛ nui, niiti ti veai ga GALA nɔnɔ. <verse eid="1CH 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21"/>Ti ɠɛni ga Layedan mavofodaiti, Gɛɛlɛson ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nuiti, ti ɠilagilagi ti ɠɛni ga ta-ʋɛlɛyeɠeiti ma lotuɠɔiti. Ti-laaseigiti kaa: Yeɠiyeli, <verse eid="1CH 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22"/>ta ná-doun zunuiti Zetame ta kɛɛɠɛloin Zowɛle. Tiya ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu naavoloi makɛ vai ɠɛni ti ʋa.<verse eid="1CH 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23"/>Amalame, Yiseɠaal, Eɓelɔn ta Uziyɛle ti-mavofodaiti saama, niiti ti zeɠeni, <verse eid="1CH 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24"/>ti ɠɛni ga: Seɓuwɛle Gɛɛlɛsome mavofodai, Moize ná-doun zunui, nii é ɠɛni ga naavolo makɛ nuiti ta-lotuɠɔ wolai. <verse eid="1CH 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25"/>Kɛɛɠɛlointi niiti ti ɠɛni ga Eliyezɛɛl mavofodaiti, naati seɠezeɠeʋɛ da ga ti zɔlɔɔ pelei: Leyaɓia, Ezayi, Yolame, Zikili ta Selomite. <verse eid="1CH 26:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26"/>Selomite ta kɛɛɠɛlointi ka ti zeini GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu zɔɔlaiti makɛ vai unda, niiti masagi Davide ti veeni GALA bɛ, ta pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti, ta nu waagilagila kundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ nu ungilagila kundiɠiiti ba, ta salaʋusu ɠundiɠii zɔiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27"/>Naati, ti kɔɔzoganii ɠilazuʋɛ veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ɓɛtɛ vai zu. <verse eid="1CH 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28"/>Selomite ta kɛɛɠɛlointi ka mɔnɔ ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu zɔɔlaiti pɛ ma, niiti niima nuiti ti ti veeni GALA bɛ, naa ʋɛɛ ani mɔtaiti pɛ ba niiti ti veai GALA bɛ: GALA goo wo nui Samiyɛle, Kise ná-doun zunui Sayile, Nɛɛl ná-doun zunui Aɓenɛɛl, Seluya ná-doun zunui Zoaɓe.<verse eid="1CH 26:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29"/>Yiseɠaal mavofodaiti saama, Kenania ta ná-doun zunuiti ka ti ɠɛni ga bɛbɛi ma vaaɠaaɠulaba nuiti Izilayɛle yooi zu, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni ga kundiɠiiti ta tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30"/>Eɓelɔn nuiti saama, Ɠasaɓiya ta kaɲɔɠɔiti, sɔɓelama nu waagila undɔfela (1.700), naati ka ti ɠɛni wɛlɛzu Izilayɛle yooi ma, nii é Zuludɛn ɠobaʋɛ folo liizu ʋelei, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-faiti unda, ta ti ɗa nuɓusɛiti zɔɠɔzu vaiti gaaɠula ba. <verse eid="1CH 26:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31"/>Pɛlɛyeɠe laasei sɛʋɛiti da wooi ma, Yeliya ɠa é ɠɛni ga Eɓelɔn nuiti ta-lotuɠɔi. Masagi Davide ná-kona ʋuunaanigɔi (40) ma masa fai zu, ti faiti buuʋɛtɛni, ti ka ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti ta ti zaama ti ga nu ɓiigiti, Yazɛɛl taazuʋɛ Galaade ɠoʋii ma. <verse eid="1CH 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32"/>Yeliya ta ná-bolodai zu nuiti ti ɠɛni ga nu waafelegɔ undɔfela (2.700), ti ga nu ɓiigiti, ta pɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti. Tiya ɠa masagi Davide GALA faiti ta nuɓusɛiti zɔɠɔzu vaaɠaaɠulaba vai ɠalivaani ti ma, Luɓɛn mavofodaiti, Gade mavofodaiti, ta Manasé mavofodaiti gilazuʋɛ unda.<verse eid="1CH 26:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɔʋɛbɛi zei ʋelei kpasu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1"/>Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠe lotuɠɔiti daaseigiti pɛtɛ, niiti ti zeɠeni ga salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti, nu waagilagilagiti ta nu ungilagilagiti unda, ta faaɠaaɠulaba nuiti niiti ti ɠɛni ɓɔsu masagi ʋa salaʋusu ɠɔɔɓɔgiti faa zu, niiti ti ɠɛni ʋaazu alu-o-alu, ti ɗa ta-wotii ɠɛ. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni kɔɔɓɔgi ɠilagilagi pɛ su.<verse eid="1CH 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2"/>Kɔɔɓɔ mɔungi nii alu mɔungi veeni zea, nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni su. Zɔi é ɠɛni unda, naa ɠɛni ga Zaɓidiyɛle ná-doun zunui Yasoɓeyame. <verse eid="1CH 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3"/>É ɠɛni ga Pelɛze mavofodai ta, tɔ ɠa alu mɔungi zu é ɠɛni kɔɔʋɛbɛi ma ɠundiɠiiti pɛ devezu. <verse eid="1CH 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4"/>Kɔɔɓɔgi velesiɛi nii alugi velesiɛi ɠɛni zea, naati ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ga waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000), Aɠoa nui Dodayi ɠa é ɠɛni naa unda, ná-seikobai ɠɛni ga Mikelɔte. <verse eid="1CH 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5"/>Alugi zaʋasiɛi ma ɠɔɔɓɔgi ma lotuɠɔi ɠɛni ga zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Yeɠoyada ná-doun zunui Ɓenaya, tiya ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000). <verse eid="1CH 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6"/>Ɓenaya naa ɠɛni kɔɔɠuluɓa ʋuusaʋagɔiti (30) unda, é ná-doun zunui Amizaɓade zeini ná-kɔɔɓɔgi naa unda. <verse eid="1CH 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7"/>Kɔɔɠuluɓai naanisiɛi nii alugi naanisiɛi ɠɛni zea, naa ɠɛni ga Azayɛle, Zoaɓe kɛɛɠɛloin, ti yɛ liizu la, ná-doun zunui Zeɓadia ʋilɛ potogi zu, tiya ɓalaa ti ɠɛni ga nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000). <verse eid="1CH 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8"/>Alugi lɔɔlusiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Yizala ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nui Samewute. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9"/>Alugi lɔzitasiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Ikese ná-doun zunui Ila, Tekoa nu ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10"/>Alugi lɔfelasiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Efelayime mavofodai Ɠelɛse, Palon nu ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11"/>Alugi lɔsaʋasiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Ɠusa nui Siɓekayi, Zela ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nu ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12"/>Alugi laaʋuusiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Anatɔte nui Aɓiyezɛɛl, Ɓɛnzamɛn mavofodai ta ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13"/>Alugi ʋuusiɛi nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Netofa nui Maɠalayi, Zela ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nu ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14"/>Alugi puugɔ maazu ɠilasiɛi (11) nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Pilaton nui Ɓenaya, Efelayime mavofodai ta ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu. <verse eid="1CH 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15"/>Alugi puugɔ maazu velesiɛi (12) nɔnɔi ɠɛni ga Netofa nui Ɠɛledayi, Woteniyɛle mavofodai ta ɠɛni de. Nu waaʋuufele maazu naanigɔ (24.000) ɠa é ɠɛni ná-kɔɔɓɔgi zu.<verse eid="1CH 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Boloda lotuɠɔiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16"/>Wɛlɛ totuɠɔi niiti ti-laaseigi ʋɛɛ, naati ka ti ɠɛni bolodaiti unda Izilayɛle yooi zu. Luɓɛn ná-bolodai: Zikili ná-doun zunui Eliyezɛɛl. Simiyɔn ná-bolodai: Maaka ná-doun zunui Sefatia. <verse eid="1CH 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17"/>Levi ná-bolodai: Kemuwɛle ná-doun zunui Ɠasaɓiya, Aalɔn mavofodaiti tɔnɔi ɠɛni ga: Sadɔke. <verse eid="1CH 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18"/>Zuda ná-bolodai: Eliyu, Davide kɛɛɠɛloin ta ɠɛni de. Isakaal ná-bolodai: Mikayɛle ná-doun zunui Womeli. <verse eid="1CH 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19"/>Zaɓulɔn ná-bolodai: Aɓediyase ná-doun zunui Yisemaya. Nɛfɛtali ná-bolodai: Azaliyɛle ná-doun zunui Yelimɔte. <verse eid="1CH 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20"/>Efelayime ná-bolodai: Azazia ná-doun zunui Wozé. Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ: Pedaya ná-doun zunui Zowɛle. <verse eid="1CH 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21"/>Manasé ná-bolodai ɠilazuʋɛ, é ɠɛni zeini Galaade: Zakali ná-doun zunui Yido. Ɓɛnzamɛn ná-bolodai: Aɓenɛɛl ná-doun zunui Yasiyɛle. <verse eid="1CH 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22"/>Dan ná-bolodai: Yeloɠame ná-doun zunui Azalɛle. Niima nuiti ka ti ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle wolodaiti ma lotuɠɔiti.<verse eid="1CH 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23"/>Davide la ɠɛni kɛɛni, ti ʋa zunu loungoiti daaseigiti sɛʋɛ, niiti ta-ɠonagi ɠɛni ga puufelegɔ (20), é yei bu, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI minazeɠeni ga toɠa Izilayɛle nuiti gaawɔɔlɔ, ti mɔin eɠɛ somideɠaiti ti geeɠɔlɔgi ɠa. <verse eid="1CH 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24"/>Seluya ná-doun zunu Zoaɓe daasei sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeini, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni gaaɓelani, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiiɠaawanani Izilayɛle ma naama laasei sɛʋɛi vaa zu. Naa ɠa é kɛɛni, naama laasei sɛʋɛi é ɠɛɛni, ma ɠaalugiti ti la ʋilɛni Davide ɠɛɛ vaiti ma zɛʋɛiti su.<verse eid="1CH 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masagi ná-botiɠɛ nu wolaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25"/>Adiyɛle ná-doun zunui Azamavɛte ɠa é ɠɛni masagi ná-naavolo makɛ vai unda. Niiti ti ti ɠaalɛɛni ba ɓalaɠaiti su, taa wolaiti ta taa goiti su, ta siɠi gaaɠoozagiti su, nui nii é ɠɛni naati unda, naa ɠɛni ga Woziase ná-doun zunui, Zonatan. <verse eid="1CH 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26"/>Zɔi ma é ɠɛni kpalaga lii ɠɛ nuiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Keluɓe ná-doun zunui Ezili. <verse eid="1CH 27:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27"/>Zɔi é ɠɛni leezɛn ɓele wotiɠɛ nuiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Simeyi, Lama nu ɠɛni de. Nii é ɠɛni dɔɔ makɛ vai unda kpeleiti su, naa ɠɛni ga Sefame nui Zaɓidi. <verse eid="1CH 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28"/>Ziɛlaʋɛ ma nɛmɛi zu, zɔi é ɠɛni wolive ɓelei ta sikɔmɔɔl kpeleiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Ɓaale-Ɠanan, Gedɛɛl nu ɠɛni de. Nui nii é ɠɛni gulɔiti makɛsu, naa ɠɛni ga Yoase. <verse eid="1CH 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29"/>Togani ɓulugi niiti ta-laamii wosuʋɛ ɠɛni ga Salon nɛmɛi zu, nui nii é ɠɛni naati unda, naa ɠɛni ga Sitilayi, Salon nu ɠɛni de. Togani ɓulugi nii ma é ɠɛni pɛtugiti su, Adalayi ná-doun zunui Safate ɠa é ɠɛni naati unda. <verse eid="1CH 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30"/>Zɔi é ɠɛni ɲɔmɛiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Woɓile, Isemayɛle nu ɠɛni ga naa. Nii é ɠɛni soovale saaiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Melonɔte nui Yedeya. <verse eid="1CH 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31"/>Zɔi é ɠɛni baala kpulugiti ta boli ɓulugiti unda, naa ɠɛni ga Ɠagaal nui Yazize. Niima nuiti kpein ka ti ɠɛni Davide ɠɔligiti unda.<verse eid="1CH 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ɓɔɠɔi ná-tɛnɛbo nuiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32"/>Davide kɛkɛi Zonatan ɠɛni ga ná-tɛnɛbo nui, é ɠɛni ga faaɠwɛ nu wola, é ɠɛni ga sɛʋɛ ɠɛ nui. Tɔ ʋe, Ɠakamoni ná-doun zunui Yeɠiyɛle ʋe, tiya ɠa ti ɠɛni masagi ná-dointi kalasu. <verse eid="1CH 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33"/>Ayitofɛle ɠɛni ga masagi ná-tɛnɛbo nui. Aaleke nui Ɠusayi ɠa é ɠɛni ga masagi ná-dɔɔɠuzu vaa makɛ nui. <verse eid="1CH 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34"/>Ayitofɛle zeɠeai ma ná, Ɓenaya ná-doun zunui Yeɠoyada ʋilɛni potogi zu, ta Aɓiataal. Zoaɓe ɠa é ɠɛni ga kɔɔɠuluɓa wolai masagi ná-kɔɔʋɛbɛiti unda.<verse eid="1CH 27:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28"/>
  <para style="s">Davide GALA sei ʋɛlɛ lo fai ɠalivaa vai <optbreak/> Salomɔn ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1"/>Davide Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti pɛ gaalɛɛni ba Zeluzalɛme: bolodama ɠundiɠiiti, masagi ɓɔɠɔi ná-salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti, salaʋusu ɠundiɠiiti niiti ti ɠɛni nu waagilagilagiti ta nu ungilagilagiti unda, masagi ta ná-dointi kɔligiti ta togani ɓulugiti makɛ nuiti, tosuba nu wolaiti masa pɛlɛi wu, kɔɔɠuluɓa wolaiti, ta sɔɓelama nuiti pɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2"/>Masagi Davide ɠaalɔni, é zɛba é ɓɔɛ ti ʋɔ ɠani: «Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, naa ʋɛɛ nà-nuɓusɛiti ba, à woilo gòo ma! É ɠɛa nɛɛni bɛ̀ ga gè GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo, ʋɛ ná a ɠɛ ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui looɠosuʋɛ, ta ada-ƓALAGI ɠɔɠɔlosuʋɛ. Gè kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi pɛ kɛɛʋɛ pɛlɛi lo fai zu. <verse eid="1CH 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3"/>Kɛlɛ GALA kɛɛʋɛ mà: ‹Ɗa lɛi è ʋa ɠɛ pɛlɛ losu bɛ̀, ɗa ga kɔɔɠɔ nu, è ɲamai ʋuuʋɛ.› <verse eid="1CH 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI ɠa é yiimazeɠea ga ze kɛ̀ɛ ʋɛlɛi wu, nii a kɛ é kɛ̀ ga Izilayɛle masagi, ta gè ɠɔoɠɔ masa pɛlɛyeɠei laalao. Mazɔlɔɔ Zuda ná-bolodai ɠa é yiimazeɠei la ga naa lo zɔiti tuɠɔ. Zuda wolodai naa zu, é yiimazeɠe ga kɛ̀ɛ ʋɛlɛi, tama kɛ̀ɛlointi pɛ saama, nà ɠa é yiimazeɠeai ga ze, é sèi masadai zu Izilayɛle unda. <verse eid="1CH 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI doun zunu mɔinmɔin feeʋɛ bɛ̀. Doun zunui naati saama, é yiimazeɠe ga Salomɔn ga naa zei Izilayɛle masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa ta é masadai ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zaalai zu. <verse eid="1CH 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6"/>É zɛba é ɠɛ ma: ‹È-loin Salomɔn ɠa é nà-pɛlɛi losu, ta ma ɠoizuʋɛti pɛ. Tɔɔzei gè yiimazeɠea la, ga é ɠɛ ga dòun zunui, nɔ̀un nà ɠɛ bɛ ga kɛɛɠɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7"/>Nà ɓaa ná-masa fai maazu eyɛsu ɠɔ, ni a zɛbɛzeɠena, ʋelei é kɛɛzu la za, ga é ɠolo nà-deveiti ta nà-tɔgiti bɛ.› <verse eid="1CH 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8"/>Naa ɠa é ba, za ɠani, Izilayɛle pɛ gaazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-bɛbɛi pɛ gaazu, ta ada-ƓALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠaazu, à minazeɠena ga wa ɠolo Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wa-ƓALAGI ná-deveiti pɛ bɛ, wo ɗa kala, nii a kɛ wo kwɛɛ ga gola. Naazu zou ʋagɔi nii ɠa yɛ wo ya, wo fe wo-mavofodaiti zea ga pogani eyɛsu ɠɔ.<verse eid="1CH 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9"/>«Ɗɛi ma è ga dòun zunui Salomɔn, ɠaaɓa kele, è è-ɠɛɛ ná-GALAGI ɠwɛɛ ga pagɔ, lɛbiyai ve bɛ ga è-yii pɛ, ta kisiɛ ʋagɔi zu, tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa wɛlɛzu nui yiima munu poun, é kisiɛiti pɛ pɛtɛ. Ni ɗa gaiziɛna, toɠa ɓɔɠɔ yɛna è ka, kɛlɛ ni ɗa ʋoluavena ba, toɠa ɠɛlɛ è ʋa eyɛsu ɠɔ. <verse eid="1CH 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10"/>Kwɛɛ niina ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yiimazeɠea ga ɗe, ga è sei ʋɛlɛ lo bɛ, ʋɛ ná ɠɛɛzu ga seizu ɲadegai. Zɛbɛzeɠe, è botii lɔɔzei.»<verse eid="1CH 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠazaʋigi vee vai <optbreak/> Salomɔn ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11"/>Davide GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ma lɛɛ wosuʋɛ ma ɠazaʋigi veeni Salomɔn ya, naa ʋɛɛ ma ʋɛlɛiti kazaʋigiti ba, pɛɛbaiti, naavolo makɛsuʋɛti, geezu ʋɛlɛiti, ta pɛlɛ ɠoozu ʋɛlɛiti, naa ʋɛɛ minazeɠe kesui laazuʋɛ ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12"/>Naa ʋoluma, é naa pɛ ma ɠazaʋigiti feeni zea, niiti é deveni ga é ti lo: Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ma ɠoizuʋɛ, pɛlɛi niiti ti ɠakusu ma, ʋɛti ti ɠɛɛzu ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu naavolo makɛsuʋɛti ta anii niiti kpein ti veai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13"/>Naa ʋolu, masagi Levi nuiti ta zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta-zeikpasu zɛʋɛiti feeni Salomɔn ya, naa ʋɛɛ botii ma zii pɛ ba niiti ti maanɛai ga ti ɗa ɠɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu, ta sɔɔlaiti pɛ niiti botii ɠɛɛzu ga tiye GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu. <verse eid="1CH 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14"/>É zanugi wuɲɛgi liegɔi lɛɛni la, nii maanɛai é lɔ zanu sɔɔlaiti gilagilagi zu, botii ɠilagilagi vaa zu, ʋele nɔ ɠana ɓalaa é kɛɛni la ga walii, sɔɔlai ɠilagilagiti pɛ faa zu ti maanɛai ti lɔ botii ɠilagilagiti su. <verse eid="1CH 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15"/>É zanu fitina zei aniiti ta ma fitinaiti buɲɛgi liegɔi lɛɛni ti ɠilagilagi pɛ, ʋele nɔ ɠana ɓalaa é kɛɛni la ga walii geleiti ta ma fitinaiti, é zoloo botii ma nii é ɠɛɛzu ga ti ɠilagilagi. <verse eid="1CH 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16"/>É zanugi liegɔi lɛɛni nii gaawuunsu, é ʋu taɓalii ɠilagilagiti ma, niiti ɓului laazu ti ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ta walii wuɲɛgi, walii laɓaliiti faa zu. <verse eid="1CH 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17"/>É sua zɔɔ mitɛ wolaiti kazaʋigi lɛɛni la, naa ʋɛɛ ɲama vaza aniɲakaiti ba ta zanu gooleiti, ti pɛ ti ga zanu kitei, naa ʋɛɛ ziawɔiti ba ti ga zanugi. É zanugi liegɔi lɛɛni nii maanɛai é ɓɛtɛ ga ziawɔi ɠilagilagi. Ʋele nɔ ɠana é kɛɛni la ga ziawɔi niiti ti ɓɛtɛzu ga walii. <verse eid="1CH 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18"/>É ansansegiti ma zalaɠa ɠulazuʋɛ ma ɠazaʋigi lɛɛni la, nii zanu gbaai ʋuuzu ma. É zanugi wuɲɛgi liegɔi lɛɛni ɓalaa, naa ʋɛɛ zanu wotoloi ʋa, kpɛtɛai ga seeluɓɛinti niiti ti-ɠoʋegi ɠɛni zɛlɛni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-minazeɠe kesui maazu. <verse eid="1CH 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19"/>Davide ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɠɔi ɠa é botii nii ma ɠazaʋigi pɛ sɛʋɛa sɛʋɛi zu, nii a kɛ gè ti ɠaaɠa.»<verse eid="1CH 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20"/>Naa ʋoluma, Davide ɠɛni Salomɔn ma: «Dòun zunu, yiilɔɔ, zɛbɛzeɠe, è tɔɔzei ga botii ɠɛa! Mina lua, è maa mina ɓali, mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI nii é ga nà-GALAGI, naa ɠa yɛsu è ʋa, é la è yɛga ná pɛ, é la ɠɛlɛa è ʋa pɛ, eyɛsu è ɓe ga botii naati pɛ kɛ, nii maanɛai ga è kɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu. <verse eid="1CH 28:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21"/>Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ta Levi nuiti ɓalaa kana, ti zeiʋɛ su kpɛkpɛ ga kpɔgiti, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi wu wotiiti faa ma. Niima wotiiti pɛ su, ɗa kpɔba zɔlɔɔ ɲɛɛliɠi nuiti saama, botii ɠilagilagiti pɛ faa zu, niiti a nɛɛ ti ʋɛ ga ti ɓɔ è ʋa, kundiɠiiti ta nuɓusɛiti pɛ ta è yeema.»<verse eid="1CH 28:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29"/>
  <para style="s">Vebɛaniiti niiti Davide ti veeni <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1"/>Masagi Davide ɠɛni bɛbɛi ma: «Dòun zunui Salomɔn, nii ɠilagi GALA ge yiimazeɠeai la, toɠa ga zunu loungo nɔ, ɠi gola la dɛ zea, botii ma suwɔɔlɔʋɛ, tɔɔzei pɛlɛi nii la ga nuɓusɛ nɔnɔ, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa nɔnɔ ʋe. <verse eid="1CH 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2"/>Nɔ̀un nà ɓɔɠɔi gè sòoda vai pɛ kɛɛʋɛ, nii a kɛ gè kɛʋele ɓɛtɛi ɠɛ nà-GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi nii lo fai zu: zanugi, walii, kɔlu ɓɔigi, kɔlu ɠite, naa ʋɛɛ gului ʋa, gè naati gaalɛɛʋɛ ba, nii a kɛ niiti kpein ti maanɛai ga ti ɓɛtɛ ga sɔɔlai naa ma ziiti, ti ʋa ɓɛtɛ ga tiye. Gè kɔtu ʋapagiti gaalɛɛʋɛ ba ɓalaa: niiti ta zoo ɲɛkpɛzu, niiti ti volozu, ma ʋɔnɛgiti, kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagi ma zii pɛ, ta kɔtu ɠolegiti, kɔtui wola mɔinʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3"/>Naa pɛ poluma, nii gè kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu, GALA sei ʋɛlɛi nɛɛ ʋelei ma bɛ̀, gè nà ɓɔɠɔi kɔli papagiti fea, zanugiti, waliiti, niiti ti ga kpɔ̀ɠɔ geleiti, é ɠula niiti polu gè ti ɓɛtɛai GALA pɛlɛ ɲadegai lo fai zu. <verse eid="1CH 29:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4"/>Nii makɛgai bɛ̀ naa ɠa ga: kilo waaungila (100.000) zanu kitei zu, nii é zeɠezu Wofiil, naa ɓɔ kilo waaunfelegɔ waaʋuunaanigɔ (240.000) ʋa walii maaɲadegai zu pɛlɛi ɠoozuʋɛ ziɛ vai zu. <verse eid="1CH 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5"/>Zanugi ta walii niiti ta ná, nii a kɛ sɔɔlai nii nɔpɛ maanɛai ga é ɓɛtɛ ga zanugi ɓaa walii, ti ɓɛtɛ ga niiti, botii pɛ su niiti ɲɛɛliɠi ɠɛ nuiti ta ɠɛ ti kɛ. Niima ziɛgi zu niina, wo zaama, ɓɛ ɠa kɛʋele ɓɛtɛai ga é faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga ɠoozunɛ ʋele Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ?»<verse eid="1CH 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vebɛanii niiti nuɓusɛiti ti ti veeni <optbreak/> GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6"/>Naama ziɛgi zu Izilayɛle ɠundiɠiiti kpein, pɛlɛyeɠe geleiti, boloda geleiti, nu ungilagila ta nu waagilagila kundiɠiiti, naa ʋɛɛ niiti ba ti masagi ná-faiti unda, ti pɛ ti zɛba ti vebɛaniiti fe, ti daai ɠisu. <verse eid="1CH 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7"/>Nii ti gaalɛɛni ba é ɠɛni ga: zanugi kilo waaungila waaʋuulɔfela (170.000), zanu kae waapuugɔ (10.000), walii leʋeni kilo waaunsaʋagɔ (300.000) ʋa, kɔlu ɓɔigi a la zeeli kilo waaundɔzita (600.000) zu, kɔlu ɠitei a la leʋe kilo miliyɔn saʋagɔ (3.000.000) ʋa. <verse eid="1CH 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8"/>Zɔiti kɔtu zɔngɔ ɓaagiti ti ɠɛni ti ya, naati ti ɠɛni ʋaazu ga tiye, ti ɗa kaliva Yeɠiyɛle ma, Gɛɛlɛson mavofodai, ga ti ʋa da Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi wu naavolo makɛsuʋɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9"/>Nuɓusɛi wola ɠoozunɛɛni vebɛanii naati fai zu, tɔɔzei ti ɠɛni feezu ga yii pɛ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ. Masagi Davide ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa gola ɠoozunɛɛni.<verse eid="1CH 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide ná-mama fe ƓALA falii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10"/>Davide mamagi veeni Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ bɛbɛi pɛ gaazu, é ɠɛ ma:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">«Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, mamagi ɠa è ʋɛ eyɛsu ɠɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:10">gi-mɛmɛwola Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI.<verse eid="1CH 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ɗa ɠa è-ʋo ge ga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">bɔɔlɔi, zɛbɛi, pagi, lɛbiyai ta masadai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">Mazɔlɔɔ nii kpein é geeɠɔlɔgi zu ta zooi ma ta ga ɗɔnɔ, ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">Ɗa ɠa è-ʋo ge ga masadai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:11">ɗa ɠa zobogi è ya fuluanii pɛ unda.<verse eid="1CH 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12"/>Ɗa ɠa kpɛtɛi ta lɛbiyai zeɠezu è ʋɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">È leve ɠa anii pɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">gaaɓaai ta zobogi naati ta è yeezaama.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:12">Zobogi ɠa è ʋɛ ga zɔi è pɔ ga è unbuzeɠe, è naa wuzeɠe ta è gaaɓaai ve bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13"/>Naa ɠa é ba, gá-ƓALAGI, gá è maamusɛzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:13">gi ɗa-lɛbiyai ɠula kɛlɛma.<verse eid="1CH 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ga leeni kae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">nà-nuɓusɛiti ɓalaa ta ga leeni kae,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">gi zoosu gi nii ɠɛɠala vaaɓɔɠɔi ɠɛ è ʋɛ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">Nii kpein ka zeɠezu ɗa nɔ è ʋɔ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:14">Nii gi feai è ya, gi naa zɔlɔɔgɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi nɔ è ya.<verse eid="1CH 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15"/>Gá nɔ ga wɛɛinti ta seikɔɠɔma nuiti è ɠaazu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">ʋelei nɔ gi-mɛmɛwolani ti ɠɛni la.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">Gi-zii ma voloiti eteai zu, ta nɔ ga eɠɛ niinigi é leʋesu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:15">é leʋesu, kito nɔpɛ ge la bɛ.<verse eid="1CH 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gá-ƓALAGI, naavoloi nii pɛ ka zɔlɔɔsu ɗa nɔ è ya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">nii kpein gi gaalɛai ba ɠani, nii a kɛ gi pɛlɛi lo nii è-laaseigi ɠa ʋɛ ba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:16">ɗɛi è ɲadegai, niiti pɛ ta ga ɗɔnɔ.<verse eid="1CH 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17"/>Ee, nà-GALAGI, gè suɠwɛɛ ga ɗa gi yiizumɔsu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">è ɠoozu ɠa ɗa nɛɛ, siɛgi zu nui ta a ziɛna la telebodai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">Naa ma ka é ba, gè niima vebɛaniiti pɛ feeʋɛ è ya zii zɔledai zu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:17">É ɠɛ bɛ̀ ga koozunɛ, siɛgi zu gè ɗa-nuɓusɛiti pɛtɛga la, ti ɗa ʋa ga vebɛaniiti ga ɠoozunɛ ʋele.<verse eid="1CH 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18"/>Ee, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, gi-mɛmɛwolani Abalaame, Izaake, ta Izilayɛle ta-ƓALAGI, ɠi pagɔi nii ta kisiɛ ʋagɔi niiti makɛ yeenɔpɛ ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ziimaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:18">Ti-yii latigai makɛ kpaankpaan è ʋɔ pelei.<verse eid="1CH 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19"/>Zii ve dòun zunui Salomɔn ya, nii gaa la ɠwɛni su fele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:19">nii a kɛ é ɠolo ɗa-leveiti bɛ, naa ʋɛɛ ɗa-ɠalagiti ta ɗa-lɔgiti ba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 29:19">É ziɛ ga ti pɛ, ta é GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo, nii gè ma ɠɛʋele ɓɛtɛi ɠɛai.»<verse eid="1CH 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gulɔi ziɛ vaa Salomɔn ma <optbreak/> é ʋa ɠɛ ga masagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20"/>Naa ʋoluma, Davide ɠɛni bɛbɛi ma: «À Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI mama, wa-ƓALAGI!» Bɛbɛi pɛ ge zɛba é mamagi ve Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, ti-mɛmɛwolani ta-ƓALAGI. Ti ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa, ti la Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɔɠɔwu ta masagi ɠaazu. <verse eid="1CH 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21"/>Poluma zobui, ti zalaɠaiti ta gala zalaɠaiti kulani, ti fe Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ: nikɛ zinɛ waagila (1.000), baala sinɛ waagila (1.000), ta baala ziʋo waagila (1.000), naa ʋɛɛ puya zalaɠaiti ba ga dɔɔi nii a la kula ɠɛ su, naa ʋolu, ti zalaɠa mɔinmɔin kiligaa ɠula Izilayɛle pɛ bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22"/>Naama voloi ti daamii ta kpɔɔlei woni ga koozunɛ wolai Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠaazu. Ná zeizu velesiɛi ɠɛni ga nii, ti gulɔi ziɛ Davide ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ma Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laaseigi zu, é ʋa ɠɛ ga ta-masagi. Ti gulɔi ziɛni ɓalaa Sadɔke ma, é ɠɛ ga zalaɠa ɠula nui. <verse eid="1CH 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23"/>Salomɔn zeini Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-masa kpɔkpɔgi ɠa, ga é masadai ɠɛ kɛɛɠɛ Davide ʋotogi zu. É masadai zeɠeni, é ɗa li luɠɔma, Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ ti ɠoloni bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24"/>Kundiɠiiti ta salaʋusuiti, naa ʋɛɛ masagi ná-doun zunuiti pɛ ba, ti ɠoloni bɛ. <verse eid="1CH 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI Salomɔn unbuzeɠeni Izilayɛle nuiti pɛ gaazu, é ná-masadai maawui é leʋe zɔiti pɛ ba, ti masadai ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle unda tɔun tuɠɔ.<verse eid="1CH 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide zaa vai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1KI 2:10-12">1 Masagiti 2:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26"/>Izayi ná-doun zunui Davide masadai ɠɛɛni Izilayɛle pɛ unda. <verse eid="1CH 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27"/>É kona ʋuunaanigɔ (40) ɠɛni masadai zu Izilayɛle unda: É kona dɔfelai ɠɛɛni Eɓelɔn, é kona ʋuusaʋagɔ maazu saʋagɔi (33) ɠɛ Zeluzalɛme. <verse eid="1CH 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28"/>Davide zaani, kɛlɛ pɔlɔzaɠaga ʋoluma kɔɛkɔɛ ziilɛi su, é zii zɔlɔɔni, naa ʋɛɛ naavoloi ta lɛbiyai ʋa. Ná-doun zunui Salomɔn ɠa é masadai ɠɛɛni potogi zu.<verse eid="1CH 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29"/>Masagi Davide ná-kɛɛwotiiti, é zo ma mɔungiti ma, é li ma ɠaaɓelagiti pɔ, naati sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA goo wo nuiti Samiyɛle, Natan ta Gade ta-zɛʋɛiti su. <verse eid="1CH 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30"/>Ná-masadai, ná-zobogi, naa ʋɛɛ fai pɛ ba é ɠɛɛni ná-yeeɠɛɠalai, Izilayɛle yooi zu, ta zɔɔma masa zooiti su, naa pɛ bogɛ sɛʋɛi naati su.<verse eid="1CH 29:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29"/>
</usx>
